  <book code="ACT" style="id">EN_KTLT kuf_Katu,⋅Western_ltr Wed Mar 05 2025 09:33:05 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Acts</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tarnêêng Nôôq Sưưq-đô</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tarnêêng Nôôq Sưưq-đô</para>
  <para style="toc3">Act</para>
  <para style="mt">Tarnêêng Nôôq Sưưq-đô</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Nhan móón Thê-ô-phi-lơ, dhiq kalóóng bha-aar laloom hei aku ve xaraq leq dyóp rau hơq Chuôq Jê-su ơi tââp têêng lơq truuih pachóóm, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />patơk tangêi Ađó bâân tađââng chô leq pleng, xók ơi đóng praaq kayua tââq Chuôq Yaang Liêm đóng nôôq sưưq-đô đu Ađó ơi chââih, <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />kung nek nôôq manưih hơq Ađó ơi tơk pakah chênh ađêi xók mamông đóng piđó, xong xók Ađó ơi đơơp janah ka-ai, palơq bơk pan-nal, ơi taai pakah palơq piđó kalóóng puôn jêt tangêi lơq praaq nôôq chiên leq katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Xók talum mat palơq piđó, Ađó ơi kayua đóng piđó kah chóóm xooq tââq Jê-ru-sa-leem, bơơi phaai đương paraaq hươq ưng Ama, “nek rau hơq adhi anó ơi xâng tââq thêi, <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />kơi Jang ơi têêng bap-teem palơq đơơk, bơơi adhi anó e bâân bap-teem palơq Chuôq Yaang Liêm kah meen đươnh tââq nôôq tangêi ađô.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Taai kơi ađek, xók mandrươh vôôiq tơk, piđó tamóh Ađó kơi ađô: “Chuôq ơơi, ve lua Amei pachô katiêk đóng I-sơ-ra-êên leq bhêêl ađôk?” <verse eid="ACT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Kơi ađek bơơi Ađó praaq lơq piđó: “Rau koom đóng adhi anó bâân n'nal eh rau nek tangêi jơ môôiq kaxe kamó đu Ama ơi kanóq ting mataai karơ ưng Ađó. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Dhơ kơi ađek, adhi anó e pei đơơp mataai raman xók Chuôq Yaang Liêm dhaluônh jaq dhiq ađêi, lơq adhi anó e nek nôôq manưih truuih đuui leq thêi dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem, kalóóng luch xưưq Ju-đê, xưưq Sa-ma-ri, lơq patơk xariêq pale katiêk.” <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Xong xók praaq nôôq paraaq achêk, xók piđó dyơq chaling lêi, nek Ađó bâân padyók, lơq mưi gaboq dhaluk pađơp Ađó lơh tââq mat piđó. <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Xók bhêêl piđó dyơq đương chamet lêi leq pleng xók Ađó chô leq pleng, lơq lêi tôôh, bơơr chanak padruuih xơp aau bhóók tơk dyương hót tóór piđó. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />Nhiđó praaq: “Nôôq manưih Ga-li-lê tôôh, hau nôôq pe dyương chaling lêi leq pleng? Chuôq Jê-su ađôk, Yaang ơi bâân padyók chô leq pleng lơh tââq nôôq pe, e kung tơk kơi kalơng đu nôôq pe ơi lêi Ađó dyók leq pleng.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Kơi achêk hayơq, tââq akoq bôôl bâân đóók nek Ô-liiu, piđó val chô tơk Jê-ru-sa-leem, hơq bôôl ađek đan dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem, ve magral kalơng vôôiq kalóóng mưi tangêi Sa-baat. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Xók piđó ơi chô tơk, piđó vôôiq dyók leq buông yaal dhiq piđó xók tơơt at, nek ve Phi-e-rơ, lơq Jang, palơq Ja-kơ lơq En-rê, Phi-liip lơq Thô-ma, Ba-thê-lê-mi lơq Ma-thi-ơ, Ja-kơ akóón padruuih A-phê lơq Si-môôn Xê-lôôt, palơq Ju-đe, akóón ưng Ja-kơ. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Tabhơt piđó maar pajêi makơi lóóm kalóóng rau nhan gavơh, palơq nôôq manưih pađiil palơq Ma-ri, amêêq ưng Chuôq Jê-su, lơq palơq nôôq adhi padruuih ưng Ađó.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Kalóóng nôôq tangêi ađek, xong xók yuur dyương dhiq bhlưa kalóóng nôôq adhi anó ađêi (parbơk nôôq manưih dhiq dham ađô nek mơ mưi hariêng bơơr jêt), Phi-e-rơ praaq: <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />“Nhan praaq, nôôq manưih adhi anó, ađô nek rau dhakơi phaai bâân tajaap kalóóng Bha-aar Yaang Pleng, nek paraaq đu Chuôq Yaang Liêm ơi loom móón dhiq bóóp bhua Đa-viit leq Ju-đa, ađó vaaih xar manưih đââng kalơng đóng kabhuh kóóp Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Taai ađó ơi bâân đóók maleq palơq nôôq he lơq ơi đơơp phơn ađêi leq tarnêêng ađôk.” <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />(Kơi ađek hayơq ađó ơi kơl mưi kalung klung tââq jêên makông ưng tarnêêng kah dhalam, lơq xong xók bâân chabươp tapajuk akoq, ađó bhraaiq luônh, dyơq luch luônh ađó bâân tapươi leq nguôi. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Chiên ađôk vaaih xar rau keen palơq tabhơt nôôq ngaai tơơt at dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem. Taai kơi ađek, kalung klung ađek bâân đóók palơq dhariêng praaq ưng piđó nek “Hak-een-đa-ma”, kluôh nek “Kalung Klung Ahaam”.) <verse eid="ACT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />“Taai tarnêêng achêk ơi bâân xaraq kalóóng bha-aar Haanh Yaang Pleng:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Phaai lơơi kalung klung ađó bâân bhahi bhatoong,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">kung óóq ve ngaai mamông dhiq ađek,’ lơq</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Phaai lơơi manưih đu lââng pei đơơp tarnêêng ưng ađó.’<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Taai kơi ađek, kơng phaai ve nôôq manưih ơi ting vôôiq palơq nôôq he kalóóng bhluuch tangêi kaxe đu Chuôq Jê-su vôôiq val bhlưa nôôq he, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />tanââp tââq pheep bap-teem ưng Jang đóng patơk tangêi hơq Ađó bâân padyók lơh tââq nôôq he — mưi kalóóng nôôq manưih chêk phaai xar manưih truuih đuui leq đu mamông lóóiq ưng Ađó nek palơq nôôq yi.” <verse eid="ACT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Piđó kayua bơơr chanak, Jô-seep bâân đóók nek Ba-sa-ba, hơq ađó nek bâân đóók achak nek Juk-tu, lơq Ma-thia. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Xók nhan gavơh, piđó móón: “Kakoh Chuôq, chênh Amei, Yaang n'nal kalóóng lóóm ưng dyóp ngaai, nhan chaleq mưi kalóóng bơơr chanak ađô hơq Amei ơi chââih nek ngaai <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />hơq đóng pei đơơp tanơơt ưng tarnêêng đôk palơq tarnêêng sưưq-đô đu Ju-đa ơi m'peq lơơi đóng vôôiq tơk dham ưng ađó.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Piđó pei padhơơch leq bơơr nak chêk, nek dhơơch chaleq pâng Ma-thia, hơq nek ađó bâân chââih maleq palơq majêt mưi sưưq-đô.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Xók tangêi Bhiêk Xââng Jêt Tangêi ơi tơk vaq, tabhơt piđó tơơt nek palơq xóng ađêi dhiq mưi dham. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Parmat, mưi dhariêng tââq pleng xuul, thê kơi ploong dhiiq karơ bâân pruung tơk, lơq ađó mót bing plok kalóóng đong dhiq piđó xók tơơt. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Lơq nôôq n'taak ngóq kơi palơq óih pakah palơq piđó, xók ơi nh'xóóng mađơq, hơq nôôq ađek jrươp bóq dhiq ting chanak manưih kalóóng piđó. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Tabhơt piđó bâân bing bhlaai Chuôq Yaang Liêm lơq tââp tanââp praaq palơq nôôq dhariêng lââng, ting kơi Yaang Liêm đóng leq piđó praaq.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Xók ađek ve nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq xók tơơt at dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem, nek nôôq manưih bhi huuiq tââq dyóp ađó katiêk ưng nôôq dhanuôr raal pleng. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Xók dhariêng ađek xuul tarlóng, ganơr manưih krong madhiq lơq bâân nhok nhói taai dyóp ngaai maar xâng piđó praaq palơq dhariêng ưng ađêi. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Tabhơt dhanuôr maar hêq lêi lơq lêi lóng chrih, móón kơi ađô: “Lêi tôôh, eh dhơq tabhơt nôôq manưih xók praaq ađek nek dhanuôr Ga-li-lê eh alua? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Ng'kơi têêng nôôq he xâng dyóp chanak kalóóng piđó praaq palơq dhariêng n'tua ưng ađêi kalóóng xưưq đu nôôq he bâân n'niên? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Nek manưih Baat-thê, manưih Mê-đi, manưih Ê-la-miit, nôôq manưih tơơt at dhiq Mê-sô-bô-ta-mi, Ju-đê, ve dyơq Kaap-ba-đôk, Bông, A-si, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />kung kơi Phi-ri-gi, Baam-phi-li, Ai Kơp, nôôq xưưq kalóóng Li-bi đan Si-reen, lơq nôôq tamóói Rô-ma bóói tham, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />tabhơt manưih Jo Thaaiq lơq manưih đu huuiq taruuih Jo Thaaiq, manưih Kơ-rêêt lơq manưih A-rơp, nôôq he maar xâng piđó praaq palơq dhariêng ưng nôôq he leq nôôq tarnêêng gamak mataai ưng Yaang Pleng.” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Tabhơt piđó maar hêq xâng lơq lêi kah n'nal kakơi, manưih ađô praaq palơq manưih tôôh: “Chiên ađô kiêng móón nek hau rau?” <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Dyơq masôôq lââng ajóóch ơi praaq kơi ađô: “Nôôq manưih ađek nek xók bâân ból buôh baq!”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Bơơi xók ơi yuur dyương, Phi-e-rơ palơq majêt mưi sưưq-đô ơi pei praaq lơq móón palơq piđó:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 2:14">“Nhan móón lơq adhi anó, manưih dhanuôr Jo Thaaiq lơq tabhơt nôôq ngaai dyơq tơơt at dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem, chiên ađôk phaai xar rau keen palơq adhi anó, lơq nhan nek tameng katór xâng paraaq aku. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Taai nôôq manưih ađô yươq bâân ból kơi adhi anó ngóq, ơi xók ađôk nek jơ đu pe kalóóng tangêi. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Dhơ kơi ađek, ađô nek rau ơi bâân praaq tââq Jô-êên manưih đââng taruuih:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />‘Yaang Pleng praaq: “Tarnêêng e vaaih tơk kalóóng nôôq tangêi xariêq,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">“Aku e n'toh Yaang Liêm Aku dhiq dyóp ng'kar m'bech,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">Akóón padruuih lơq akóón pađiil nôôq akóón e praaq đââng taruuih,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">padruuih n'dhóm ưng nôôq akóón e lêi rau tapalêi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">lơq nôôq manưih takóh ưng nôôq akóón e m'pó lêi parnó.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Patơk mơ dhiq nôôq dhơn padruuih, dhơn pađiil ưng Aku kalóóng nôôq tangêi ađek,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">Aku e n'toh Yaang Liêm Aku, lơq piđó e praaq đââng taruuih.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Aku e đóng nôôq parnó chrih dhiq pleng yaal</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">lơq nôôq kanal chrih dhiq katiêk êêp,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">ahaam lơq óih nek palơq kabul gayươk.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Mat tangêi e bâân vaaih xar kanam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">dyơq mat hayum nek xar ahaam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">xók kah ơi tơk tangêi gamak lơq cha-iil taklaaq ưng Chuôq.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Lơq dhơ dhangaai manưih đu gavơh nhan achak ưng Chuôq nek e bâân tapaq.”’<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />Nhan móón lơq adhi anó, nôôq manưih I-sơ-ra-êên, nhan tameng xâng nôôq paraaq ađô: Chuôq Jê-su manưih Na-xa-reet nek manưih bâân Yaang Pleng alua pakah palơq adhi anó palơq nôôq tarnêêng mataai, raman chrih lơq kanal chrih hơq tââq Ađó, Yaang Pleng ơi têêng dhiq m'pơng adhi anó, kơi chênh adhi anó ơi n'nal. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Yaang achêk ơi takóóp, ting kơi tarnêêng ơi ravang lơơi lơq rau n'nal laloom ưng Yaang Pleng, adhi anó ơi leng karchêt xók teeng dhiq n'lóóng baang chatông tââq têi nôôq manưih kah gani, <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Ađó nek Yaang đu Yaang Pleng ơi têêng mamông lóóiq, xong xók paxooq lơh tââq đu jarnah ưng kan chêt, taai ađó kah ve đuôh jư kadhâng Ađó hót raal ađêi. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Ơi bhua Đa-viit praaq leq Ađó kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">‘Aku taluôn luôn lêi Chuôq tơơt toom mat aku</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">ơi Ađó tơơt hót tươm aku, đóng aku yươq bâân kakhin kapơn.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Taai kơi ađek, lóóm aku bhuui sương lơq n'taak aku bhuui marhaal.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">Bơơi dyơq lơh ađek, achak araang aku e kung tơơt at kalóóng lóóm rââm.<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Ơi Ađó e kah m'peq lơơi ravaai aku kalóóng bóng maraaih,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:27">e kung kah lơơi đóng Yaang Tabah Ađó lêi đu nh'xoq kluuiq.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Ađó ơi pakah đóng aku kalơng parmông;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:28">Ađó e têêng đóng aku bing bhlaai lóóm bhuui sương nek palơq moh mat ưng Ađó.’<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Nhan móón nôôq pe, nhan móón adhi anó, palơq rau taniih, rau ve chóóm praaq palơq adhi anó leq abhươp Đa-viit, nek ađó ơi chêt lơq ơi bâân tơp, ping ưng ađó dyơq dhiq m'pơng nôôq he patơk tangêi ađôk. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Lơq hayơq, ơi nek manưih đââng taruuih lơq ơi n'nal kơi Yaang Pleng ơi đóng paraaq ng'kóh palơq ađêi đóng patơơt mưi akóón chachau mađó leq dhong nooi ađêi dhiq tanơơt ađêi, <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />hayơq xong xók lêi loom tarnêêng ađô, bhua ơi praaq leq đu mamông lóóiq ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih, kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:31">Ađó yươq rau bâân m'peq lơơi kalóóng bóng maraaih,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:31">m'bech ng'kar Ađó kung yươq rau lêi nh'xoq kluuiq.<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Yaang Pleng ơi têêng Chuôq Jê-su ađô mamông lóóiq, tabhơt nôôq yi nek manưih truuih đuui đóng rau ađek. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Ơi kơi ađek, xók ơi bâân padyók tơơt hót atươm Yaang Pleng lơq đơơp pei paraaq hươq leq Chuôq Yaang Liêm tââq Ama, nek Ađó ơi n'toh tarnêêng kơi ađô, nek rau đu adhi anó xók lêi lơq xâng.<verse eid="ACT 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Taai Đa-viit ơi kah dyók leq pleng, bơơi chênh ađó praaq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">‘Chuôq praaq palơq Chuôq aku: “Nek tơơt hót atươm Aku,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />đóng patơk xók Aku têêng nôôq brau ưng Akóón xar parđâq ng'gơq dyung ưng Akóón.”’<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />Kơi ađek hayơq, tabhơt đong I-sơ-ra-êên phaai n'nal kơi tamưng nek Yaang Pleng ơi đóng Ađó têêng Chuôq lơq Yaang Paq Manưih, chênh nek Chuôq Jê-su ađô, manưih đu adhi anó ơi teeng đinh.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Xók ơi xâng kơi ađek, piđó ka-ai karuôq kalóóng lóóm, hayơq móón palơq Phi-e-rơ lơq nôôq sưưq-đô đu dyơq, kơi ađô: “Nôôq manưih adhi anó ơơi, hau nôôq yi phaai têêng?” <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Hayơq Phi-e-rơ praaq palơq piđó: “Phaai klôôq lóóm lơq dyóp ngaai kalóóng adhi anó phaai đơơp pheep bap-teem vơn achak Chuôq Paq Manưih Jê-su đóng bâân talơơi matu lơt ưng ađêi, hayơq adhi anó e bâân đơơp kaliim nek Chuôq Yaang Liêm. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Ơi praaq hươq ađek nek ravang đóng leq adhi anó, đóng akóón chachau ưng adhi anó lơq đóng leq tabhơt nôôq manưih tơơt changaai, chêk nek dhơ dhangaai đu Chuôq nek Yaang Pleng nôôq he alua ơi dhaloong.” <verse eid="ACT 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Palơq bơk paraaq lââng dyơq, ađó ơi truuih đuui lơq pató pachóóm piđó, kơi ađô: “Phaai đóng ađêi bâân paq jóói tââq dhong nooi môôp aak ađôk.” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Kơi ađek, xók xong pei đơơp paraaq ưng ađó, piđó đơơp bap-teem, pamơ pe ngaan ravaai ơi bâân mót leq Akóón Dhơn Chuôq kalóóng tangêi achêk. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Hayơq, piđó bhiêk taluôn kalóóng paraaq pachóóm ưng nôôq sưưq-đô lơq kalóóng marau tarnêêng, kalóóng đu veh beng lơq kalóóng paraaq gavơh nhan.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Rau kakhin kapơn n'toh dhiq dyóp ngaai, lơq bơk rau chrih liêm palơq kanal chrih pakah tââq nôôq sưưq-đô. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Tabhơt nôôq manưih huuiq hayơq krong lóóiq dhiq mưi dham lơq đươi makơi dyóp rau, <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />piđó baan katiêk karuung lơq drươp karvaan ađêi, hayơq nh'xóóng piđó đóng leq dyóp ngaai, ting kơi dyóp chanak ve kơng đươi hau rau, <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />dyóp tangêi dyơq bhiêk mưi lóóm tơơt kalóóng đong bhanuôih, drươh veh beng dhiq dyóp đong, piđó ơi nh'xóóng tarmông kalóóng bhuui sương lơq bhơt lóóm lalua, <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />bhi haanh Yaang Pleng lơq ve têêng mót lóóm palơq tabhơt manưih dhanuôr, dyơq Chuôq xók dyơq đóng kơơq nôôq manưih bâân paq mót leq kalóóng kabhuh achêk dyóp tangêi.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Xók achêk, Phi-e-rơ lơq Jang đơk leq đong bhanuôih mót jơ gavơh nhan, nek mót jơ đu takiêh. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Mưi nak achêk, ơi khuch tââq kalóóng luônh amêêq ađêi, ơi bâân glâk tơk, nek manưih hayơq dyóp tangêi palââng patơơt dhiq palóng ưng đong bhanuôih, dhiq bâân đóók nek Palóng Liêm, đóng nhan jêên poor jóói tââq nôôq manưih mót leq kalóóng đong bhanuôih, <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />hayơq xók lêi Phi-e-rơ lơq Jang ravang mót leq kalóóng đong bhanuôih, ađó gavơh nhan đóng đơơp jêên poor jóói. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Bơơi xong xók nek palơq Jang lêi limrang leq ađó ađek, Phi-e-rơ praaq: “Nek lêi leq nôôq yưa!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Kơi ađek ađó lêi chamet leq nhiđó, rââm pei đơơp m'bưưiq ve rau tââq nhiđó. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Dhơ kơi ađek, Phi-e-rơ praaq: “Vaang lơq baak, kah rau đu ve tơơt dhiq aku, bơơi rau đu aku ve, aku đóng amei ađôk. Vơn achak Chuôq Paq Manưih Jê-su manưih Na-xa-reet, nek bhadyaang vôôiq.” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Xók ơi kadhâng tamưng anó dhiq têi atươm, ađó tơq anó yuur dyương, nek n'drươh, tapaang dyung lơq mat tapaang dyung ưng anó bâân tiêl karơ. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Xók xong yuur chaplóng, ađó dyương mưng lơq tââp jađaang vôôiq, hayơq ađó mót leq kalóóng đong bhanuôih palơq nhiđó, drươh vôôiq drươh chaplóng drươh bhi haanh Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Tabhơt dhanuôr hangiêk lêi ađó jađaang vôôiq lơq bhi haanh Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />Hayơq piđó đâh n'nal ađó achêk, kơi ađó biêh nek manưih buôn tơơt nhan jêên poor jóói dhiq Palóng Liêm ưng đong bhanuôih, kơi ađek hayơq piđó bâân buur bing rau hêq lêi lơq lóng chrih taai tarnêêng ơi val vaaih đóng ađó.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Xók achêk, xók ađó achêk bhiêk tapun ting Phi-e-rơ lơq Jang, tabhơt dhanuôr palơq bing rau hêq lêi, ting pajươk yuur mut tơk leq piđó dhiq palóng ving, dhiq bâân đóók nek Palóng Ving Sa-lô-môôn. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Bơơi xók lêi kơi ađek, Phi-e-rơ ââi lóóiq palơq manưih dhanuôr: “Nhan móón adhi anó, nek manưih dhanuôr I-sơ-ra-êên ơơi, hau adhi anó pei lêi chrih leq tarnêêng ađôk? Môôiq hau adhi anó lêi nôôq yi limrang thê kơi nôôq yi ơi têêng anó achêk bhadyaang vôôiq tââq mataai môôiq tarnêêng liêm n'tua ưng ađêi? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Yaang Pleng ưng Ap-ra-haam, Yaang Pleng ưng I-saak lơq Yaang Pleng ưng Ja-kôôp, nek Yaang Pleng ưng avuôq nôôq he, ơi bhi haanh Dhơn Ratơơq ưng Ađó, nek Chuôq Jê-su, Yaang đu adhi anó ơi kóóp pajaau lơq kah đươi toom mat Phi-laat xók abhươp ađek ơi kayua paloh Ađó. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Bơơi adhi anó ơi kah đươi Yaang Cha-iil Tabah lơq Bhơt Liêm, nhan kayua bâân paloh đóng ađêi mưi nak leng manưih, <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />bơơi adhi anó ơi leng Yaang Tââp Tanââp Parmông, nek Yaang đu Yaang Pleng ơi têêng mamông lóóiq tââq akan chêt, hơq nôôq yi nek manưih truuih đuui đóng rau ađô. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Lơq tââq lóóm huuiq dhiq achak Ađó, akonh ađek, manưih đu adhi anó maar lêi lơq n'nal, hayơq achak Ađó ơi têêng đóng karơ. Lóóm huuiq achêk đươi dhiq Ađó ơi đóng akonh achêk đu karơ bhơt kơi achêk drươh toom mat tabhơt adhi anó. <verse eid="ACT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />Xók ađôk, nhan móón adhi anó, aku n'nal nek adhi anó ơi têêng vôôiq kalóóng đu kabaang, lơq nôôq manưih têêng takóh gamak ưng adhi anó kung kơi ađek. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Bơơi nôôq rau đu Yaang Pleng ơi loom praaq dhiq bóóp ưng tabhơt nôôq manưih đââng taruuih, nek Yaang Paq Manưih ưng Ađó phaai đơơp ka-ai jarnah, nek Ađó ơi têêng tajaap kơi ađek. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Taai ađek, nek klôôq lóóm, lơq val chô, đóng matu lơt ưng adhi anó bâân katel tabil, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />hơq đóng ganah liêm tame tơk tââq đu ve mat ưng Chuôq, lơq Ađó kayua Yaang ơi bâân chaleq đóng adhi anó, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />nek Yaang kơng phaai jư lóóiq dhiq katiêk pleng đóng tơk ganah hayuur lóóiq dyóp rau, nek rau hayơq Yaang Pleng ơi praaq tââq hanua bơơi bóóp nôôq manưih đââng taruuih liêm ưng Ađó. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Alua kơi ađek, Môôi-se ơi praaq kơi ađô: ‘Chuôq, Yaang Pleng ưng nôôq he e pahayuur đóng adhi anó mưi nak đââng taruuih thê kơi aku tââq m'pơng kalóóng nôôq adhi anó ưng ađêi. Adhi anó e tameng xâng ađó ting kơi dyóp rau dhơ dharau hau rau hayơq ađó praaq palơq adhi anó. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Bơơi rau e avaaih đóng ngaai manưih hơq la kah tameng xâng manưih đââng taruuih ađek, nek manưih achêk e bâân taleng karchêt tââq manưih dhanuôr.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Kơi ađek hayơq, tabhơt nôôq manưih đââng taruuih tââq Sa-mu-êên lơq nôôq manưih vôôiq tatun ađó, la piđó pơơh bóóp praaq, hayơq piđó kung truuih đuui leq nôôq tangêi ađô. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Adhi anó nek akóón chachau ưng nôôq manưih đââng taruuih lơq ưng raket bóóp đu Yaang Pleng ơi têêng palơq avuôq ađêi, xók praaq lơq Ap-ra-haam, kơi ađô: ‘Lơq tââq mưi akóón chachau ưng akóón, tabhơt nôôq dhong nooi dhiq katiêk e bâân phươk.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Laloom tââm lơq adhi anó, xong tââq pahayuur Dhơn Ratơơq ađó, Yaang Pleng ơi kayua Yaang achêk tơk đóng phươk leq adhi anó nek têêng palâh lóóm dyóp ngaai tââq đu môôp aak ưng ađêi.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Xók achêk, xók piđó dyơq praaq lơq manưih dhanuôr, nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih, palơq linh bhlơng jư đong bhanuôih lơq nôôq manưih Sa-đu-sê pơh tơk leq piđó, <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />kabhróónh bhlơng taai bơơr nhiđó dyơq truuih pachóóm manưih dhanuôr lơq truuih pakah đu mamông lóóiq tââq akan chêt kalóóng Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Hayơq kabhuh piđó kóóp lơơi bơơr nhiđó lơq tamót leq đong kanam đương tơk brương yóng rayiiu, taai xók ađek ơi kanam aq. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Bơơi phơn bơk kalóóng sôôq nôôq manưih xók ơi xâng taruuih ađek ơi huuiq, lơq sôôq manưih padruuih ơi tơk mơ xââng ngaan.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Tarnêêng vaaih xók tangêi rayiiu, kabhuh takóh têêng gamak ưng piđó palơq nôôq takóh bhươl lơq nôôq thêi pachóóm gani bâân karong lóóiq dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem, <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />lơq An-ne, takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm, palơq Kaai-phe, Jang, A-lek-xan-đơ lơq tabhơt nôôq manưih mađó leq kabhuh takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Xók ơi đââng bơơr nhiđó gluh dhiq m'pơng, piđó tamóh: “Ađó tââq mataai raman, môôiq vơn achak ngaai hơq nôôq pe ơi têêng tarnêêng ađek?” <verse eid="ACT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Leq xók ađô, taai bâân bing bhlaai Chuôq Yaang Liêm, Phi-e-rơ ơi praaq lơq piđó: “Nhan móón nôôq pe đu têêng gamak ưng manưih dhanuôr lơq nôôq takóh bhươl, <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />la mađôk nôôq yi glêh bâân tamóh leq tarnêêng liêm palơq mưi nak ka-ai, kơi n'đó hau ganơơm ađó achêk ơi bâân yươh, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />nek đôk phaai nek rau bâân tabhơt nôôq pe lơq tabhơt dhanuôr I-sơ-ra-êên n'nal tơk, kơi vơn achak Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih manưih Na-xa-reet, Yaang đu nôôq pe ơi teeng dhiq n'lóóng baang chatông, Yaang đu Yaang Pleng ơi têêng mamông lóóiq tââq akan chêt, achêk nek ganơơm Yaang ađek hayơq manưih ađô dyương khe karơ dhiq toom mat nôôq pe. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Ađó nek kaliêng dhơl ơi bâân takađiq taai nôôq pe, chênh nek nôôq thơơq-xêi, hơq ơi xar bhangôh dhơl n'tól đong. <verse eid="ACT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Kah ve đu paq jóói dhiq dhơ dhangaai lââng, ơi dhiq raal pleng kah ve achak ngaai lââng chóóm đóng leq dhiq m'pơng akóón manưih đóng nôôq he phaai ganơơm ađek bâân paq.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Xók lêi đu garâ nhóól ưng Phi-e-rơ lơq Jang, lơq n'nal giit kơi ađô bơơr nhiđó nek nôôq manưih kah ve hok lơq dhanuôr, nek piđó hêq lêi, piđó kung bâân n'nal bơơr nhiđó, kơi ađô nhiđó ơi glêh tơơt lơq Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />N'drươh xók ađek, taai lêi manưih padruuih ơi bâân yươh dyương lơq bơơr nhiđó, hayơq piđó kah ve rau chóóm tapraaq lóóiq. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Xók achêk, lơh tââq xók kayua đóng nôôq manưih ađek gluh tââq đong xêi xanêi, piđó praaq tamóh palơq xóng piđó, <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />kơi ađô: “Nôôq he hau chóóm têêng palơq nôôq manưih ađô? Achêk nek ơi mưi mataai chrih dyóp ngaai kung lêi ơi vaaih tââq nôôq manưih ađôk, alua nek drêh dróói palơq tabhơt nôôq ngaai dyơq mamông dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem, lơq nôôq he kah chóóm kah đươi. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Dhơ kơi ađek, đóng tarnêêng ađôk óóq tanđôôr leq lơh dyơq m'pơng kalóóng manưih dhanuôr, nôôq he phaai praaq trêh piđó óóq dyơq pei vơn achak achêk đóng praaq leq dhơ dhangaai.” <verse eid="ACT 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Kơi ađek, xók đóng dhaloong bơơr nhiđó mót, piđó praaq kayua óóq praaq môôiq truuih pachóóm pei ve rau dyơq vơn achak Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Bơơi xók Phi-e-rơ lơq Jang ââi, bơơr nhiđó ơi praaq lơq piđó: “Ve lua nek pâng dhiq toom mat Yaang Pleng xók ting xâng bóóp nôôq pe lơh Yaang Pleng? Nôôq pe nek kanóq lêi. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Ơi nôôq yi kah chóóm pat praaq leq rau dhơơm ađêi ơi lêi lơq xâng.” <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Kơi ađek hayơq, xók ơi gaam kơơq, piđó paloh bơơr nhiđó vôôiq, taai kah rau lêi rauriq đóng hơq piđó ve chóóm phaak bơơr nhiđó, ơi nek taai manưih dhanuôr, taai dyóp ngaai maar bhi haanh Yaang Pleng leq tarnêêng ơi vaaih. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Ơi manưih padruuih tôôh, manưih đu mataai chrih payươh ađô vil vaaih, nek ơi lơh puôn jêt tuôi.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Xók achêk, xong xók bâân paloh, bơơr nhiđó tơk palơq adhi anó akóón dhơn chuôq ưng ađêi lơq truuih lóóiq dyóp rau đu nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm lơq nôôq takóh bhươl ơi praaq lơq nhiđó. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Xók ơi xâng, piđó mưi lóóm karơ dhariêng đak leq Yaang Pleng lơq móón: “Kakoh Chuôq, Amei nek Yaang ơi tavaaih pleng, katiêk lơq taxiiq, palơq dyóp rau dhiq kalóóng ađek, <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />nek Yaang, ơi tââq avuôq nôôq yi bơơi Chuôq Yaang Liêm, tââq dhiq bóóp ưng Đa-viit dhơn ratơơq Amei, ơi praaq kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">‘Hau chóóm nôôq katiêk pagrâ jar-ââih,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">lơq nôôq dhanuôr mangê hư bil?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Nôôq bhua dhiq hóng katiêk yuur dyương,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">lơq nôôq kuôn kadhâng akoq bâân karong lóóiq xóng ađêi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">jơl lóóiq Chuôq, lơq jơl lóóiq Yaang đơơp xut dhơu ưng Amei.’<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Ơi kalóóng alua, bhơt Hê-rôôt lơq Bôôn-xơ Phi-laat, nek palơq nôôq dhanuôr katiêk palââng lơq dhanuôr I-sơ-ra-êên, ơi bâân karong chô maleq dhiq kalóóng kanóón ađôk jơl lóóiq Dhơn Ratơơq tabah liêm ưng Amei nek Chuôq Jê-su, Yaang đu Amei xut dhơu, <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />đóng têêng dyóp rau tarnêêng đu têi Amei lơq tarnêêng ưng Amei ơi kanóq loom đóng vaaih. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Xók ađôk, Chuôq ơơi, nhan phaai lêi chamet nôôq paraaq gaam ưng piđó, lơq nhan đóng leq nôôq dhơn ratơơq ưng Amei truuih xêi paraaq Amei lơq tabhơt lóóm nhóól <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />xók Amei jarơ têi ưng Amei vaq đóng rau payươh, nôôq kanal chrih lơq nôôq tarnêêng raman chrih bâân vaaih tơk ganơơm achak ưng Dhơn Ratơơq tabah liêm Amei, nek Chuôq Jê-su.” <verse eid="ACT 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Xók piđó ơi gavơh nhan xong, dhiq đu piđó xók nhoom lóóiq veq dha-ơr, hayơq tabhơt piđó maar bâân bing bhlaai Chuôq Yaang Liêm lơq praaq taruuih paraaq ưng Yaang Pleng nek palơq lóóm nhóól.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Xók achêk, nôôq manưih kabhuh ganơr bơk ơi huuiq maar ve makơi mưi lóóm lơq yaang lóóm. Kah ngaai lêi mưi rau kalóóng nôôq rau chô leq ađêi nek ưng ađêi, hơq palơq piđó, dyóp rau nek ưng xóng ađêi. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Palơq mataai raman karơ gamak, nôôq sưưq-đô pakah paraaq truuih leq đu mamông lóóiq ưng Chuôq Jê-su, lơq phươk liêm yaal gamak tơơt dhiq tabhơt piđó. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Ơi kah ve ngaai manưih thiêuq hat m'pơng kalóóng piđó, ơi la nôôq ngaai nek manưih kala katiêk môôiq đong xaang, nek xong xók baan, piđó đââng tơk sôôq jêên ơi ve bâân, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />hayơq lơơi dhiq dyung nôôq sưưq-đô, lơq jêên achêk ơi nh'xóóng đóng dyóp nak manưih ting kơi manưih ađek ve rau kơng đươi.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Xók achêk, Jô-seep, manưih ơi nôôq sưưq-đô đóók nek Ba-na-ba (achak bâân lók kiêng móón Akóón ưng Đu Bhơơl Chut Lóóm), nek mưi manưih Lê-vi, dhanuôr Chiip-rơ, <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />xong xók baan dham ruông mađó leq ađêi, ađó ơi đââng jêên tơk lơq lơơi dhiq dyung nôôq sưưq-đô.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Xók achêk, mưi nak achêk achak A-na-nia, palơq Sa-phi-ra, kađiêl ađêi, ơi baan mưi dham katiêk, <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />hayơq ađó ađek ha-ơu jư panlei đóng ađêi mưi phơn tââq sôôq jêên achêk (manưih kađiêl kung n'nal) lơq xong xók ơi đââng mưi phơn tôôh tơk, ađó ađek lơơi dhiq dyung nôôq sưưq-đô. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Bơơi Phi-e-rơ praaq: “A-na-nia, ơi hau Sa-taan bing bhlaai lóóm amei têêng đóng amei praaq galơơk Chuôq Yaang Liêm hơq ha-ơu panlei đóng ađêi mưi phơn tââq jêên ưng dham katiêk ađek? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Xók dyơq ađek, kah alua dham katiêk dyơq nek ưng amei, lơq xók ơi tabaan vaq, sôôq jêên dyơq raal kataai ưng amei kah alua? Ng'kơi têêng hayơq amei karnóq chiên ađôk kalóóng lóóm ađêi? Eh rau amei praaq galơơk akóón manưih dhơq, hayơq nek lơq Yaang Pleng.” <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Kơi ađek hayơq, xók ơi A-na-nia xâng nôôq paraaq achêk, ađó pat parhââm hơq kalơm, lơq rau kakhin kapơn gamak bhlơng n'toh dhiq tabhơt nôôq ngaai xâng rau tarnêêng ađô. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Xók achêk, xók ơi yuur dyương, nôôq manưih n'dhóm raleng ađó ađek lơq xók ơi glâk leq nguôi hayơq piđó đââng vôôiq tơp.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Bơơi tarnêêng vaaih tơk mơ pe jơ tatun ađek, kađiêl ađó ađek vôôiq mót, kah ve n'nal rau chiên ơi vaaih. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Phi-e-rơ praaq palơq pađiil: “Nek praaq đóng aku n'nal ve alua bơơr anhưa ơi baan dham katiêk achêk mơ janaaq kah?” Hayơq pađiil móón: “Lalua, janaaq achêk n'đơq.” <verse eid="ACT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Bơơi Phi-e-rơ kayua pađiil: “Hau chóóm hayơq chiên ađek bâân bơơr nhưa makơi lóóm karnóq hơq klêêu Yaang Liêm ưng Chuôq? Nek lêi tôôh, tapaang dyung ưng nôôq manưih ơi tơp kayiik amei dyương dhiq palóng, hơq e piđó kung đââng amei vôôiq tơp.” <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />N'drươh, pađiil ađek kalơm dhiq dyung ađó lơq pat parhââm. Xók achêk, xók jađaang mót, nôôq manưih n'dhóm lêi xaak pađiil, xong xók ơi glâk pađiil leq nguôi, piđó tơp pađiil dhiq tóór kayiik ađó. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Đu kakhin kapơn dhaang gamak n'toh dhiq tabhơt Akóón Dhơn Chuôq lơq dhiq tabhơt nôôq ngaai xâng leq nôôq chiên ađô.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Xók achêk, tââq tapaang têi ưng nôôq sưưq-đô, bơk kanal chrih lơq tarnêêng chrih liêm val vaaih dhiq kalóóng dhanuôr manưih, lơq piđó maar makơi lóóm tơơt dhiq Palóng Kriing Ving Sa-lô-môôn. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Bơơi kah ngaai lââng khin ting mót lơq piđó, dhơ dhanuôr manưih biêh xók bhi haanh piđó. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Xók achêk, n'dhương bơk manưih bâân mót leq xók pei lóóm huuiq dhiq Chuôq lơh dyơq, parbơk bơk bhlơng luch padruuih palơq pađiil, <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />patơk mơ palââng patơk đââng manưih ka-ai gluh leq kalơng, tabêch dhiq chong lơq alơơq, đóng xók Phi-e-rơ vôôiq lalơh, nek bhơt m'bưưiq a-ô ưng ađó ve chóóm pađơp dhiq ngaai ađek kalóóng piđó. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Mưi tanóói manưih bơk bhlơng kung taruiq xóng piđó tââq nôôq kanóón xirvir Jê-ru-sa-leem, ting đââng manưih ka-ai lơq nôôq manưih bâân abhưi nhuq bóq janah, hayơq tabhơt piđó maar bâân yươh.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Bơơi xong xók yuur dyương, takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm lơq tabhơt nôôq manưih ting ađó ađek (nek nôôq manưih maleq kabhuh Sa-đu-sê) bing bhlaai lóóm makhinh, <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />hayơq nôôq manưih achêk pei têi dhiq nôôq sưưq-đô lơq tamót piđó leq đong kanam król madhiq. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Bơơi xók hayum, mưi dhơn pleng ưng Chuôq ơi lóng palóng đong kanam, đââng piđó gluh leq nguôi, hơq pató: <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Nek vôôiq, lơq xong xók dyương kalóóng đong bhanuôih, nek truuih palơq manưih dhanuôr dyóp paraaq ưng parmông ađô.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Kơi ađek hayơq, xók ơi xâng kơi ađek, piđó vôôiq mót leq đong bhanuôih xók pleng marư-rư brương lơq truuih pachóóm. Xók achêk, xong xók thêi kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm lơq nôôq manưih ting ađó ađek vôôiq tơk, piđó dhaloong pahoop Nôôq Takóh Xêi Xanêi lơq tabhơt nôôq takóh bhươl kalóóng dhanuôr I-sơ-ra-êên, hayơq kayua manưih tơk đong kanam đóng đââng nôôq sưưq-đô tơk. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Bơơi xók tơk dham, nôôq kabhuh linh kah rau lêi nôôq sưưq-đô kalóóng đong kanam, kơi achêk nek xong xók val chô lóóiq, piđó truuih xêi, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />móón kơi ađô: “Nôôq yi lêi đong kanam ơi bâân takađơp palơq dyóp tarnêêng tamưng, lơq linh jư nek dyương nham palóng, bơơi xong xók lóng, nôôq yi kah lêi ngaai tơơt hót kalóóng dyơq.” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Xók achêk, n'drươh xók nôôq piđó ơi xâng nôôq paraaq achêk, luch kuôn kadhâng koq kabhuh linh đong bhanuôih lơq nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm maar nhok karnóq leq nôôq truuih móón, hau chóóm chiên kơi ađek lóóiq ve chóóm val vaaih. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Kơi ađek hayơq, mưi ngaai ađek, xong xók vôôiq tơk, ơi truuih palơq piđó kơi ađô: “Nek lêi tôôh, nôôq manưih đu nôôq pe król leq đong kanam nôk xók tơơt kalóóng đong bhuôih, ơi dyương truuih pachóóm manưih dhanuôr!” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Xók ađô, kuôn kadhâng koq, vôôiq palơq nôôq linh, ơi đââng piđó chô, bơơi kah pei grâ karơ, ơi piđó kakhin manưih dhanuôr e nh'jau ađêi bâân taglơm lơq dhơl. <verse eid="ACT 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Xók ơi đââng nôôq sưưq-đô chô, nôôq manưih achêk lơơi piđó m'pơng Nôôq Takóh Xêi Xanêi, hayơq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm praaq tamóh piđó, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />kơi ađô: “Nôôq yi ơi praaq leq nôôq pe kah đóng pheep truuih pachóóm kalóóng achak ađô, hơq lêi tôôh, nôôq pe ơi têêng Jê-ru-sa-leem bing bhlaai đu pachóóm ađêi, lơq nôôq pe nek kiêng đââng ahaam ưng ađó achêk n'toh dhiq piing nôôq yi.” <verse eid="ACT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Bơơi xók ââi lóóiq, Phi-e-rơ lơq nôôq sưưq-đô praaq: “Phaai huuiq xâng Yaang Pleng lơh nek palââng. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Yaang Pleng ưng avuôq nôôq he ơi têêng Chuôq Jê-su mamông lóóiq, Ađó nek Yaang đu nôôq pe ơi leng, xók yông dhiq n'lóóng chatông. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Yaang Pleng ơi padyók Yaang achêk dyók têêng Bhua lơq Yaang Paq Manưih tơơt hót atươm ađêi, lơơi đóng rau klôôq lóóm leq I-sơ-ra-êên palơq rau lơơi matu lơt. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Nôôq yi nek manưih truuih đuui ưng nôôq tarnêêng achêk, nek palơq Chuôq Yaang Liêm, Yaang đu Yaang Pleng ơi đóng leq nôôq manưih xâng huuiq Ađó.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Bơơi xók xâng paraaq achêk, piđó kabhróónh bhlơng hơq kiêng leng chêt nôôq sưưq-đô. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Xók achêk, xók mưi nak tôôh yuur dyương m'pơng Nôôq Takóh Xêi Xanêi, nek mưi manưih Pha-ri-si, achak nek Ga-ma-li-êên, takóh pachóóm gani, bâân tabhơt dhanuôr bhi chap, ađó kayua đââng nôôq sưưq-đô gluh leq nguôi maxưưiq. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Hayơq ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Nhan móón nôôq pe, nôôq manưih I-sơ-ra-êên, phaai chagơn palơq ađêi kala leq rau đu nôôq pe karnóq têêng đóng nôôq manưih ađô. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Taai laloom tangêi ađô, Thêêu-đa ơi yuur dyương, tư móón ađêi nek mưi manưih ng'kơi ađek, parbơk manưih padruuih ơi mót kabhuh palơq ađó leq mơ puôn hariêng, hơq ađó ơi bâân taleng nek tabhơt nôôq manưih đu bâân huuiq xâng ting ađó maar bâân tablah, hayơq kabhuh piđó vôôiq tơk dham kah dyơq ngaai. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Xong ađó ađô, Ju-đa manưih Ga-li-lê ơi yuur vaaih kalóóng ganah yaap lêi dhanuôr lơq paxuq garuiq manưih dhanuôr ting ađêi. Ađó ađek kung chêt, hayơq tabhơt nôôq manưih đu bâân huuiq xâng ting ađó maar bâân tachêh tavươk. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Xók ađôk aku praaq palơq nôôq pe rau ađô: Phaai xooq changaai tââq nôôq manưih achêk lơq takê piđó, ơi la karnóq ađô môôiq tarnêêng ađô nek tââq akóón manưih, nek ađó e bâân hư bil, <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />bơơi la rau ađek nek tââq Yaang Pleng, nek nôôq pe e kah đuôh têêng pahư kalơm piđó, hơq kah machưng nôôq pe tơk mơ ve chóóm bâân lêi nek manưih tajơl palơq Yaang Pleng.” Kơi ađek nek, piđó bâân huuiq xâng kơi ađó. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Xong xók đóng dhaloong nôôq sưưq-đô, xók ơi m'bhiiq xong, piđó praaq kayua kah chóóm pheep truuih pachóóm vơn achak Chuôq Jê-su, hayơq piđó paloh đóng vôôiq. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Kơi ađek hayơq, nôôq sưưq-đô vôôiq kalơng xooq tââq đu toom mat palơq Nôôq Takóh Xêi Xanêi, bhuui marhaal taai piđó ơi bâân móón nek đaang đơơp jruôn taai Achak Chuôq. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Dyóp tangêi, tââq kalóóng đong bhanuôih lơq kalóóng ting đong, piđó kah dhêi truuih pachóóm lơq truuih pakah Taruuih Liêm — Chuôq Jê-su nek Chuôq Paq Manưih.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Xók achêk, kalóóng nôôq tangêi ađek, xók nôôq môôn-đô n'dhương yuur bơk, nek rau pambhoonh ơi vaaih tââq manưih Jo Thaaiq chapiên praaq dhariêng Hi-laap palơq manưih Hê-bơ-rơ, taai nôôq manưih kamaai ưng piđó xók bâân m'peq lơơi kalóóng tarnêêng poor yaauq dyóp tangêi. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Kơi ađek hayơq, xong xók majêt bơơr sưưq-đô dhaloong karong manhoom bơk bhlơng nôôq môôn-đô, piđó praaq: “Đôk nek rau kah ve đươi chóóm palơq nôôq yi xók m'peq lơơi paraaq ưng Yaang Pleng leq tatun đóng têêng yaauq baang chana. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Bơơi, nhan móón adhi anó, nhan chââih tââq m'pơng adhi anó tapól chanak manưih padruuih ve tanđôôr liêm, bing bhlaai Yaang Liêm lơq rau tabech, nek nôôq manưih đu nôôq yi ve chóóm pajaau kayua đóng tarnêêng ađô. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Dyơq nôôq yi nek e bhiêk taluôn kalóóng rau gavơh nhan lơq tarnêêng truuih pachóóm paraaq Chuôq.” <verse eid="ACT 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Bóóp paraaq ađek têêng liêm lóóm toom mat tabhơt akóón dhơn Chuôq. Hayơq nek, piđó chââih Ê-tiên, mưi manưih bing bhlaai lóóm huuiq lơq Chuôq Yaang Liêm, Phi-liip, Bô-kô-rơ, Ni-ka-nô, Ti-môôn, Ba-mê-na lơq Ni-kô-la, manưih An-ti-ôôt ting huuiq taruuih Jo Thaaiq, <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />nek nôôq manưih đu piđó đââng tơk đóng dyương toom mat nôôq sưưq-đô, lơq xong xók gavơh nhan, nôôq sưưq-đô lơơi têi dhiq nôôq manưih achêk.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Hayơq ađek, paraaq ưng Yaang Pleng bhiêk tanđôôr, lơq parbơk môôn-đô dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem n'dhương dyók bơk lơh, patơk mơ manhoom bơk bhlơng nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih ơi đươi xâng lóóm huuiq.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Xók achêk, Ê-tiên bing ơơn lơq mataai raman, têêng tarnêêng chrih liêm lơq mataai chrih gamak kalóóng manưih dhanuôr. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Bơơi masôôq manưih ơi yuur vaaih, nek nôôq manưih mađó leq đong gươl tôôh, dhiq bâân đóók nek “Nôôq Manưih Rathaai,” palơq nôôq manưih Si-reen, manưih A-lek-xan-tri, lơq nôôq manưih tââq Si-li-si lơq A-si, tarkaai palơq Ê-tiên. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Hayơq hơq, piđó kah ve chóóm đuôh jơl lóóiq đu tabech lơq Yaang Liêm đu ađó ơi paraaq pakah ganơơm Yaang achêk. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Tatun ađek, piđó paxuq dharơơl nôôq manưih đóng praaq kơi ađô: “Nôôq yi ơi xâng ađó ađek praaq nôôq paraaq chôlô jơl lóóiq palơq Môôi-se lơq Yaang Pleng.” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Piđó paxuq luch manưih dhanuôr palơq nôôq takóh bhươl palơq nôôq takóh pachóóm gani, lơq xong xók ruul tơk, piđó kóóp ađó lơq garuiq tơk Nôôq Takóh Xêi Xanêi. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />N'drươh xók ađek, piđó loom ravang lơơi nôôq manưih praaq galơơk, truuih kơi ađô: “Manưih ađô kah dhêi praaq nôôq paraaq chôlô tơk leq dham tabah liêm lơq gani. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Taai nôôq yi ơi xâng ađó praaq kơi Jê-su manưih Na-xa-reet tôôh e pahư bhơt dham ađôk lơq tadhơ nôôq xanêi đu Môôi-se ơi truuih lóóiq đóng nôôq he.” <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Xók lêi li mrang leq ađó, tabhơt nôôq manưih xók tơơt dhiq kalóóng Nôôq Takóh Xêi Xanêi lêi moh mat ađó kơi ngóq moh mat ưng dhơn pleng.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Xók achêk, takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm móón: “Nôôq tarnêêng ađek ve pâng kơi achêk môôiq kah?” <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Hayơq nek, ađó ââi:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 7:2">“Nhan móón palơq nôôq pe, nôôq adhi anó lơq nôôq taha takóh, nhan tameng xâng: Yaang Pleng cha-iil tabah ơi pakah palơq avuôq Ap-ra-haam ưng nôôq he xók ađó tơơt dhiq Mê-sô-bô-ta-mi, laloom kah ơi xók ađó tơơt at dhiq Cha-raan; <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />lơq Yaang Pleng praaq palơq ađó kơi ađô: ‘Phaai xooq tââq xưưq xaang ưng amei, kung kơi tââq xóng anó kabhuh ưng amei, lơq amei nek vôôiq tơk xưưq đu Aku dhakơi e chaleq đóng amei.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Xong ađek, xong xók gluh tââq xưưq ưng dhanuôr Ken-đê, ađó mamông dhiq Cha-raan. Hayơq tââq ađek, xong xók ama ađó ơi bil, Yaang Pleng ơi đââng ađó mót leq xưưq ađô, kalóóng dham đu nôôq pe xók tơơt mamông. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Yaang Pleng ơi kah đóng leq ađó mưi drươp karvaan kalóóng xưưq, tơk mơ mưi dham mađơq tapaang dyung kung kah. Hayơq đu Yaang Pleng ơi hươq đóng xưưq leq ađó đóng chô leq têi ađêi kala, palơq đóng dhong nooi ưng manưih n'niên tatun ađó, dhơ ađó kah ơi ve akóón. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Dhơ kơi ađek, Yaang Pleng ơi praaq kơi ađô, kơi dhong nooi ađó e nek dhanuôr tơơt at dhiq mưi xưưq changaai chrih, hayơq palââng e kóóp piđó têêng dhơn xól hơq janah kalóóng puôn hariêng kamó. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Yaang Pleng praaq: ‘Lơq Aku e phaak katiêk đu piđó ơi phaai têêng dhơn, hayơq tatun ađek, piđó e gluh vôôiq lơq bhuôih haanh Aku dhiq dham ađô.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Yaang Pleng kung ơi đóng leq ađó raket bóóp leq tarnêêng iêt ng'kar, lơq taai kơi ađek, ađó n'niên I-saak lơq têêng tarnêêng iêt ng'kar đóng akóón ađêi xók tangêi đu takóól; I-saak têêng kơi ađek đóng Ja-kôôp, lơq Ja-kôôp kung têêng kơi achêk đóng majêt bơơr chanak takóh kabhuh. <verse eid="ACT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Ơi nôôq takóh kabhuh makhinh lơq Jô-seep, piđó ơi baan ađó leq Ai Kơp; hơq Yaang Pleng tơơt palơq ađó, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />lơq paq jóói ađó tââq dyóp rau jarnah xangaat ưng ađó, Yaang Pleng kung đóng ơơn lơq đu tabech leq ađó dhiq toom mat Pha-ra-ôôn, bhua Ai Kơp, lơq bhua achêk ơi đóng ađó dyók têêng gamak jư lêi Ai Kơp palơq tabhơt đong ađêi. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Xók achêk, mưi ganah ha-ul yuur tơk vaaih dhiq plok xưưq Ai Kơp lơq Ka-na-aan, lơq đu bhrê hư lóng gamak, lơq nôôq avuôq ưng nôôq he kah tââq chik bâân tarmông. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Kơi ađek hayơq, xong xók xâng dhiq Ai Kơp ve aviq mi, Ja-kôôp kayua nôôq avuôq nôôq he tơk ađek đu mưi chu. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Lơq kalóóng dharơp đu bơơr, Jô-seep ơi tư pakah ađêi kala đóng nôôq anó ađêi, hayơq parlóng đong ưng Jô-seep bâân Pha-ra-ôôn n'nal tơk. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Xók achêk, xong xók kayua nôôq anó chô, Jô-seep kayua kêch Ja-kôôp, ama ađêi, palơq tabhơt m'bhuh xóng, palơq masôôq manưih nek tapól jêt xââng. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Kơi ađek nek, Ja-kôôp vôôiq dhuônh tơk Ai Kơp, hayơq ađó xir, lơq nôôq avuôq ưng nôôq he kung kơi ađek. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Piđó bâân đââng tơk Si-cheem lơq tơp kalóóng ping đu Ap-ra-haam ơi kơl lơq janaaq palơq baak tââq nôôq akóón padruuih ưng Hê-mô dhiq Si-cheem. <verse eid="ACT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />Xók achêk, ting kơi ganah tangêi ưng paraaq hươq hơq Yaang Pleng ơi hươq palơq Ap-ra-haam ơi đan tơk, nek sôôq dhanuôr n'dhương bơk lơq bâân bơk bhlơng dhiq Ai Kơp, <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />patơk xók mưi abhua lââng dyók têêng kadhâng kala Ai Kơp, hơq abhua achêk biêh kah n'nal Jô-seep. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Ơi mangê tabhrê manưih dhanuôr nôôq he, abhua achêk ơi janah avuôq nôôq he, têêng đóng nôôq paniên par-aang ưng piđó bâân m'peq lơơi, kah chóóm jư đóng mamông. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Leq xók hơq Môôi-se bâân n'niên, ađó liêm kre toom mat Yaang Pleng. Ađó bâân ban paar pe kaxe kalóóng đong ama ađêi. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Xók achêk, xók ađó bâân tapakah, akóón pađiil ưng Pha-ra-ôôn ơi đââng ađó chô lơq ban paar ađó kơi akóón padruuih ađêi. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Môôi-se bâân pachóóm kalóóng dyóp rau tabech ưng manưih Ai Kơp, ađó dyơq ve kataai kalóóng bóóp paraaq lơq tarnêêng têêng ưng ađêi. <verse eid="ACT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Bơơi xók ganah puôn jêt tuôi ơi tơk palơq ađó, vaaih karnóq kalóóng lóóm ađó kiêng vôôiq tham adhi anó ađêi, nek akóón chachau I-sơ-ra-êên. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Xók lêi mưi chanak tôôh bâân tajanah, ađó ơi yuur dyương paq lơq yuur têêng đu charóót đóng manưih bâân tajanah xók m'bhiiq chêt manưih Ai Kơp tôôh, <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />ađó dyơq ngóq adhi anó n'nal kơi Yaang Pleng taai têi ađêi xók đââng tơk đu paq jóói đóng piđó, bơơi piđó kah n'nal. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Tangêi tatun, ađó tabhral m'pơng piđó xók tarkaai, lơq ađó praaq pahêêl piđó đââng tơk rau paliêm, kơi ađô: ‘Adhi anó ơơi, nôôq pe maar nek adhi anó. Ơi hau nôôq pe têêng ka-ai karuôq xóng ađêi?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Bơơi manưih xók kađiq kalươm manưih tóór ađêi ơi dhalươq ađó xooq, tamóh: ‘Ngaai ơi kayua amei têêng manưih kadhâng akoq lơq xêi xanêi dhiq nôôq yi? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Ve kơq nek amei xók kiêng leng aku kơi tarnêêng đu amei ơi leng manưih Ai Kơp tangêi manua?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Kơi ađek hayơq, Môôi-se mut klôôn toom bóóp praaq achêk, lơq ađó val xar tamóói tơơt kađơu kalóóng xưưq Ma-đi-aan, dhiq đu ađó bâân n'niên bơơr akóón padruuih. <verse eid="ACT 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />Xók puôn jêt kamó ơi lơh, mưi dhơn pleng tabhral lơq ađó dhiq kruung vơng leq bôôl Si-naai, dhiq mưi par-aang óih róh dhiq tââm xông. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Xók achêk, xók móng lêi kơi ađek, Môôi-se lêi lóng chrih leq tapakah ađek, hayơq xók ađó vôôiq pađan đóng lêi chóóm giit, nek ve dhariêng ưng Chuôq: <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Aku nek Yaang Pleng ưng avuôq amei, Yaang Pleng ưng Ap-ra-haam, ưng I-saak lơq ưng Ja-kôôp.’ Xók ađek, ơi rau kakhin kapơn dhuum tơk, Môôi-se kah khin lêi. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Hayơq Chuôq praaq lơq ađó: ‘Nek lêh jêi gluh tââq dyung amei, ơi dham hơq amei xók dyương nek katiêk tabah liêm. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Taai ơi chamet lêi, Aku ơi móng lêi rau hadhaap janah ưng dhanuôr Aku dhiq Ai Kơp, Aku ơi xâng dhariêng xaxih ưng piđó, lơq Aku ơi dhaluônh đóng paq jóói piđó. Xók ađôk, nek vôôiq pađan leq ađô, Aku kayua amei vôôiq leq Ai Kơp.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />Môôi-se ađô, manưih hơq piđó ơi kah đươi xók móón: ‘Ngaai ơi kayua amei têêng manưih kadhâng akoq môôiq kuôn xêi xanêi?’ — Yaang Pleng kayua ađó n'drươh têêng manưih kadhâng akoq n'drươh têêng manưih paq jóói, taai têi ưng mưi dhơn pleng ơi tabhral palơq ađó dhiq tââm axông. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Ađó ơi đââng piđó gluh, xong xók têêng nôôq raman chrih lơq kanal chrih dhiq xưưq Ai Kơp lơq dhiq Taxiiq Bhrôông, kung kơi kalóóng kruung vơng bhluuch puôn jêt kamó. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Achêk nek Môôi-se, ađó ơi praaq palơq akóón anaaq I-sơ-ra-êên kơi ađô: ‘Yaang Pleng e hayuur mưi manưih đââng taruuih đóng adhi anó thê kơi aku, tââq kalóóng m'pơng nôôq adhi anó ưng nôôq pe.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Ađô nek manưih tơơt kalóóng manưih dhanuôr dhiq kruung vơng palơq dhơn pleng, Yaang ơi praaq lơq ađó dhiq bôôl Si-naai, lơq palơq nôôq avuôq nôôq he, ađó nek manưih ơi pei đơơp paraaq mamông đóng đââng leq nôôq he, <verse eid="ACT 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />hơq nek palơq ađó, avuôq nôôq he kah kiêng đơơp huuiq; palâh lóóiq, piđó kah đươi lơq palâh lóóm ađêi jamoh leq Ai Kơp, <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />xók kayua A-rôôn: ‘Phaai têêng đóng nôôq yi nôôq yaang e kađââng nôôq yi. Leq phơn Môôi-se ađô, ađó ơi đââng nôôq yi gluh tââq xưưq Ai Kơp, nôôq yi kah n'nal hau rau chiên ơi vaaih đóng ađó achêk.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Kơi ađek nek, piđó têêng mưi kabhêi karók akóón kalóóng nôôq tangêi achêk lơq tapôông adhah bhuôih đóng leq kabhêi ađek, hayơq bhuui marhaal ơi tarnêêng ưng têi ađêi. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Xók achêk, Yaang Pleng palâh hóng lơq lơơi mak kơi piđó bhuôih haanh nôôq chatur charo dhiq pleng, kơi ơi xaraq kalóóng bha-aar ưng nôôq manưih đââng taruuih, kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">‘Đong I-sơ-ra-êên ơơi, ve kơq</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">nôôq pe ơi tapôông đóng Aku nôôq adhah bhuôih lơq bhanuôih kalóóng bhluuch puôn jêt kamó kalóóng kruung vơng?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Nôôq pe ơi glâk pơơq bhanuôih ưng yaang Mo-lok lơq</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">chatur charo yaang Room-phaan ưng nôôq pe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">— nôôq kabhêi hơq nôôq pe ơi têêng đóng bhuôih haanh piđó —</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">lơq Aku e patââi đââng nôôq pe hót tôôh Ba-bi-lôôn.’<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />Pơơq bhanuôih tơơt palơq avuôq nôôq he kalóóng kruung vơng, i kơi Yaang praaq palơq Môôi-se ơi truuih pachóóm, phaai têêng pơơq achêk ting markơi đu ađó ơi lêi, <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />hơq nek palơq pơơq achêk, xong xók đuui ting đơơi, avuôq nôôq he kung ơi đââng ting raal đơơi Jô-suê kalóóng kalơng vôôiq pei xưưq ưng nôôq dhanuôr đu Yaang Pleng ơi đuôi xooq toom mat avuôq nôôq he đóng patơk đơơi Đa-viit, <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />nek manưih bâân ơơn toom mat Yaang Pleng, lơq ađó ơi nhan tamóh đóng chêk mưi dham patơơt đóng đong ưng Ja-kôôp. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Kơi ađek hayơq, Sa-lô-môôn ơi xêi kadhơng đong leq Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ACT 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Dhơ kơi ađek, Yaang Bhơt Yaal kah tơơt at kalóóng dham têi manưih ơi têêng, kơi manưih đââng taruuih ve praaq:<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />‘Chuôq praaq: Pleng nek tanơơt Aku, lơq katiêk nek parđâq lơơi dyung Aku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Nôôq akóón e xêi kadhơng đong ng'kơi đóng Aku?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Môôiq dhiq dham ravang đóng đu dhêi drơq ưng Aku?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Eh alua têi Aku ơi tavaaih tabhơt nôôq rau ađô?’<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Nôôq manưih kađiq ơơi, lóóm lơq katór kah đơơp iêt ng'kar tôôh! Nôôq pe taluôn tajơl Chuôq Yaang Liêm. Avuôq ưng nôôq pe ng'kơi, nôôq pe kung kơi achêk. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />N'đó manưih đu kalóóng nôôq manưih đââng taruuih hơq avuôq ưng nôôq pe ơi kah kóóp róp? Piđó ơi leng nôôq manưih đââng taruuih laloom leq rau tơk ưng Yaang Bhơt Liêm, hơq nôôq pe nôk xók ơi xar manưih đu tajơl lơq manưih leng chêt Yaang achêk, <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />chênh nek nôôq manưih ơi đơơp gani ơi rau truuih praaq ưng nôôq dhơn pleng, hơq kah pei jư.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Xók achêk, xong xók xâng nôôq paraaq achêk, piđó bâân tapraaq môôp pagrâ kalóóng lóóm ađêi, lơq piđó kap mênh kaniêng palơq ađó. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Bơơi xók bâân bing bhlaai Chuôq Yaang Liêm, xong xók lêi li mrang leq pleng, ađó lêi đu cha-iil tabah ưng Yaang Pleng lơq Chuôq Jê-su dyương dhiq hót atươm Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Ađó praaq: “Lêi têêh, aku lêi nôôq talaang pleng bâân talóng bhươh, lơq Akóón Manưih dyương dhiq hót atươm Yaang Pleng.” <verse eid="ACT 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Xók achêk, xong xók lalơu karơ dhariêng, piđó kapit katór ađêi lóóiq hayơq maar pơh ruul leq ađó. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Xók ơi galôôi gluh leq nguôi kanóón, piđó glơm dhơl ađó. Nôôq manưih đương lêi lơơi aau nguôi ưng ađêi dhiq dyung mưi padruuih n'dhóm bâân đóók nek Saau-lơ. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Piđó glơm dhơl Ê-tiên xók bhêêl ađó nhan gavơh, kơi ađô: “Kakoh Chuôq Jê-su, nhan đââng chô ravaai akóón.” <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Kơi ađek hayơq, xong xók chakoh takól chok leq, ađó lalơu karơ dhariêng: “Chuôq ơơi, Amei yươq n'toh matu ađô leq piđó.” Xók praaq paraaq achêk xong nek ađó bêch.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Xók achêk, Saau-lơ biêh iêm lóóm tarnêêng leng chêt Ê-tiên. Kơi ađek hayơq, kalóóng tangêi ađek, mưi ganah kóóp janah gamak ơi vaaih tajơl palơq Akóón Dhơn Chuôq dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem, dyơq tabhơt nôôq manưih xâng huuiq tablah plok xưưq Ju-đê lơq Sa-ma-ri, chapiên nôôq sưưq-đô. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Nôôq manưih bhi huuiq ơi tơp buur Ê-tiên lơq ve nhiim ka-yô gamak bhlơng đóng leq ađó. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Bơơi, Saau-lơ têêng pahư gamak leq Akóón Dhơn Chuôq. Xók bhiêk mót dyóp đong, kóóp tabhơt padruuih lơq pađiil gluh, ađó tamót piđó leq đong kanam.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Dhơ kơi ađek, nôôq manưih bâân tablah ơi vôôiq dyóp leq truuih Taruuih Liêm leq paraaq Chuôq. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Xók achêk, Phi-liip vôôiq dhuônh tơk xưưq Sa-ma-ri, ađó truuih Yaang Paq Manưih đóng piđó. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Xók achêk, manưih dhanuôr makơi lóóm chamet xâng leq rau dhơơm bâân Phi-liip pachóóm, bơơi xók xâng nôôq praaq ađek lơq lêi nôôq raman chrih đu ađó têêng. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Ơi bơk manưih kalóóng sôôq piđó bâân nôôq yaang môôp bóq, piđó ơi gluh lơh xong xók lalơu dhariêng karơ. Dyơq bơk manưih arươp lơq khuch nek ơi bâân yươq. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Xók achêk, ve rau bhuui marhaal gamak kalóóng kanóón ađek.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Bơơi mưi manưih padruuih tôôh, achak nek Si-môôn, laloom hei ơi glêh têêng magun mabhru kalóóng kanóón lơq têêng pachrih dhanuôr Sa-ma-ri, tư móón ađêi nek manưih mataai gamak, <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />manưih đu tabhơt piđó, tââq paniên tơk taha, maar chamet ting xâng taai móón kơi ađô: “Manưih ađô nek mataai raman ưng Yaang Pleng, nek rau bâân đóók nek Mataai Gamak.” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Xók achêk, palââng ting xâng ađó, taai kalóóng mưi ganah đươnh, ađó ơi têêng piđó chrih lêi nôôq tarnêêng magun mabhru. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Bơơi xók piđó huuiq Phi-liip, ơi bâân truuih taruuih liêm leq katiêk Yaang Pleng lơq achak ưng Chuôq Jê-su Paq Manưih, nek piđó đơơp bap-teem, tabhơt padruuih lơq pađiil. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Hayơq chênh Si-môôn kung huuiq, xók ơi đơơp bap-teem, ađó dyơq bhiêk tơơt palơq Phi-liip. N'drươh, xók lêi nôôq kanal chrih lơq nôôq tarnêêng mataai raman gamak ơi vaaih, ađó hêq lêi bhlơng.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Xók achêk, xong xók xâng kơi dhanuôr xưưq Sa-ma-ri ơi pei đơơp taruuih ưng Yaang Pleng, nôôq sưưq-đô dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem kayua Phi-e-rơ lơq Jang tơk palơq piđó, <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />nek bơơr sưưq-đô đu xong xók ơi tơk, ơi gavơh nhan đóng piđó, đóng piđó ve chóóm bâân đơơp Chuôq Yaang Liêm. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Ơi Ađó biêh kah ơi dhaluônh dhiq piing mưi ngaai kalóóng sôôq piđó, bơơi piđó chapiên nek ơi bâân bap-teem kalóóng achak Chuôq Jê-su giêl. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Kơi ađek bơơr sưưq-đô lơơi têi dhiq piđó, hayơq piđó bâân đơơp Chuôq Yaang Liêm. <verse eid="ACT 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Xók achêk, xók lêi kơi Yaang Liêm chóóm bâân đóng tââq đu lơơi têi ưng nôôq sưưq-đô, nek Si-môôn cher jêên đóng piđó, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />móón: “Nhan kung đóng aku mataai raman ađô đóng la ngaai đu aku lơơi têi, nek ađó achêk ve chóóm bâân đơơp Chuôq Yaang Liêm.” <verse eid="ACT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Bơơi Phi-e-rơ móón palơq ađó: “Nhan đóng baak ưng amei tơơt kalóóng hư bil palơq amei, taai amei ngóq chóóm kơl ơơn đóng ưng Yaang Pleng palơq jêên! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Kah ve phơn môôiq ting tapâng ve rau kalóóng chiên ađô ravang đóng amei, taai lóóm amei kah ve nek dhalam tapat toom mat Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Kơi ađek, nek klôôq lóóm leq rau aak ađô ưng amei lơq gavơh nhan palơq Chuôq, kah machưng đươi ađek hơq karnóq ưng lóóm amei e bâân lơơi lơt. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Ơi aku lêi amei dyơq tơơt kalóóng mơt tang lơq taklooiq ưng rau matu lơt.” <verse eid="ACT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Bơơi ââi lóóiq, Si-môôn ââi: “Nhan nôôq pe gavơq nhan palơq Chuôq klóóih đóng aku, đóng óóq mưi rau râ kalóóng nôôq rau đu nôôq pe ơi praaq ve chóóm vaaih leq aku.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Kơi ađek, xong xók truuih đuui lơq pachóóm paraaq Chuôq, piđó val chô palâh leq Jê-ru-sa-leem, n'drươh ađek truuih Taruuih Liêm đóng bơk bhươl kanóón ưng manưih Sa-ma-ri.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Xók achêk, mưi dhơn pleng ưng Chuôq praaq palơq Phi-liip kơi ađô: “Nek yuur dyương lơq vôôiq leq charhóóng hót hóng dhiq kalơng tââq Jê-ru-sa-leem dhuônh tơk Ga-xa.” (Achêk nek dhiq bhahi bhatoong.) <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Xók ơi yuur dyương, ađó yuur vôôiq, lơq lêi tôôh, mưi manưih padruuih, ađó Ê-thi-ô-bi, kuôn talêch dhơn ratơơq ưng Kaan-đaak, bhua pađiil Ê-thi-ô-bi, nek manưih biêh xók jư lêi tabhơt đong kavaan ưng amooq, ađó ơi tơk đóng bhuôih haanh dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem, <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />n'drươh xók ađek, ađó xók val chô, tơơt dhiq xe axeh ưng ađêi lơq đok bha-aar paraaq taruuih Ê-saai. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Xók achêk, Yaang Liêm praaq palơq Phi-liip: “Nek tapun pađan lơq vôôiq pagriêq xe axeh ađek.” <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Kơi ađek hayơq, xók ơi mut tơk, Phi-liip xâng kuôn ađô xók đok paraaq taruuih Ê-saai nek ađó móón: “Amei ve lua n'nal rau dhơơm ađêi xók đok ađek kah?” <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Bơơi manưih kuôn ââi: “Ng'kơi ve aku chóóm đuôh n'nal, la kah mưi ngaai ađek e pachóóm đóng aku?” N'drươh xók ađek, ađó kayua Phi-liip bhadyaang dyók ting tơơt palơq ađêi. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Xók achêk, paleh Bha-aar Yaang Pleng đu kuôn xók đok nek kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">“Ađó ơi tađââng vôôiq pakơi trưưu tơk leq đong leng dhanah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">lơq kơi trưưu akóón bơq parngau toom mat manưih chakap xok ađó,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">kơi ađek, Ađó kah pơơh bóóp ađêi.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Kalóóng rau takađiq, paraaq dhalam ưng Ađó bâân tapei drooih.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">Ngaai e truuih lóóiq dhong nooi Ađó?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">Ơi parmông Ađó ơi tapatââi tââq katiêk.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Xók tapraaq, Kuôn talêch tamóh palơq Phi-liip: “Aku nhan amei đóng aku n'nal, manưih đââng taruuih xók praaq rau ađô leq ngaai — leq chênh ađêi kala môôiq leq mưi ngaai lââng?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Kơi ađek nek, pơơh bóóp ađêi lơq tanââp tââq phơn Bha-aar Yaang Pleng ađô, Phi-liip truuih Taruuih Liêm leq Chuôq Jê-su đóng manưih kuôn achêk. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Kơi ađek hayơq, xók piđó n'drươh vôôiq dhiq kalơng, piđó vôôiq tơk dham ve đơơk tôôh, nek kuôn talêch móón: “Lêi tôôh, đơơk! Ve rau xók kajơq aku đơơp bap-teem?” <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />[Xók achêk, Phi-liip móón palơq ađó: “La amei huuiq palơq tabhơt lóóm amei, nek amei e bâân paq.” Kơi ađek hayơq xók ââi bóóp, manưih kuôn móón: “Aku huuiq leq Yaang Paq Manưih, đu Akóón Yaang Pleng.”] <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Manưih kuôn kayua padyương xe axeh lóóiq lơq miq nhiđó maar dhaluônh leq đơơk, miq Phi-liip lơq kuôn jư lêi, hayơq ađó têêng bap-teem đóng manưih kuôn achêk. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Xók achêk, xók nhiđó ơi yuur tââq đơơk, Yaang Liêm ưng Chuôq đââng Phi-liip vôôiq, lơq kuôn talêch kah rau ve lêi ađó dyơq, manưih kuôn bhuui marhaal bhiêk vôôiq kalơng ađêi. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Dyơq Phi-liip nek bâân lêi dhiq A-xôôt, lơq xók vôôiq plok prah xưưq ađek, ađó truuih pachóóm Taruuih Liêm đóng tabhơt nôôq kanóón, đóng patơk xók ađó vôôiq tơk leq Sê-sa-rê.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Bơơi Saau-lơ, ơi xók dyơq bhiêk praaq paraaq gaam lơq rau leng karchêt jơl palơq nôôq môôn-đô ưng Chuôq, xong xók tơk palơq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />nek nhan tââq dhiq ađó nôôq tala bha-aar pagơơi đóng leq nôôq đong nhoom dhiq Đa-met, đóng la ađó bâân chêk dhơ dhangaai ting kalơng Huuiq, luch padruuih lơq pađiil, nek ađó đââng piđó ơi xók bâân taklooiq đââng chô leq Jê-ru-sa-leem. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Xók achêk, ơi xók vôôiq kalơng, tarnêêng val vaaih xók ađó đan tơk kanóón Đa-met, parmat brương tââq pleng dyóól dhiq ađó, <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />hayơq, xong xók kalơm leq katiêk, ađó xâng mưi dhariêng móón praaq palơq ađêi: “Saau-lơ, Saau-lơ, hau amei chóóm kóóp róp aku?” <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Xók achêk, ađó tamóh: “Chuôq ơơi, Amei nek ngaai?” Chuôq praaq: “Aku nek Jê-su đu amei xók kóóp róp; <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />dhơ kơi ađek, nek yuur dyương lơq vôôiq mót kalóóng kanóón, hayơq tarnêêng e bâân praaq palơq amei leq hau rau kiiq tââm đóng amei phaai têêng.” <verse eid="ACT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Bơơi nôôq manưih ting vôôiq palơq ađó nek dyương dhiq ađek kah chóóm praaq taklóng paraaq, xók xâng dhariêng hơq kah lêi ngaai. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Xók achêk, Saau-lơ yuur dyương tââq katiêk, bơơi xók mat ưng ađó meh lêi, nek ađó kah chóóm lêi ve rau. Kơi ađek hayơq, xong xók kadhâng têi chơơng ađó vôôiq, piđó đââng ađó mót kanóón Đa-met. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Bhluuch pe tangêi, ađó kah rau chóóm lêi, lơq ađó kah cha kung kah ơm.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Xók ađek, dhiq kanóón Đa-met ve mưi môôn-đô achêk achak A-na-nia. Chuôq praaq palơq ađó dhiq mưi rau tapalêi: “A-na-nia ơơi!”. Hayơq ađó ââi: “Chuôq ơơi, nhan lêi ađô, nô akóón!” <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Xók achêk, Chuôq praaq lơq ađó: “Xong xók yuur dyương, nek vôôiq tơk kalơng đóók nek Dhalam Tapat, lơq phaai chêk kalóóng đong ưng Ju-đa mưi manưih achak Saau-lơ, tââq Taat-sơ, nek chamet lêi, ơi ađó ađô xók gavơh nhan, <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />lơq kalóóng mưi rau tapalêi, ađó achêk ơi lêi mưi manưih achak A-na-nia vôôiq mót lơq lơơi têi dhiq ađêi đóng ađó achêk bâân brương mat lóóiq.” <verse eid="ACT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Bơơi A-na-nia ââi: “Chuôq ơơi, akóón ơi xâng tââq bơk ngaai leq ađó ađô, leq n'nal n'đơq rau môôp lơt ađó ađô ơi têêng đóng nôôq manưih tabah ưng Amei dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Lơq dhiq ađek, ađó ve bâân pajaau mataai tââq nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm đóng kóóp jư dyóp nak dhaloong gavơh achak Amei.” <verse eid="ACT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Kơi ađek bơơi, Chuôq praaq palơq ađó: “Bhiêk vôôiq, ơi manưih ađô nek parvech ưng rau bâân chââih palơq Aku, đóng đââng achak Aku gluh leq toom nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng, xêi pabhơt nôôq bhua, nek palơq akóón anaaq I-sơ-ra-êên; <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />ơi Aku e pakah đóng ađó achêk n'nal ađêi đơơp phaai xâng jarnah bơk ng'kơi taai achak Aku.” <verse eid="ACT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Kơi ađek hayơq, A-na-nia yuur vôôiq lơq vôôiq mót kalóóng đong ađek. Xong xók lơơi têi dhiq Saau-lơ, ađó praaq kơi ađô: “Anó Saau-lơ, Chuôq ơi kayua aku — chênh nek Chuôq Jê-su, Yaang ơi pakah palơq amei dhiq kalơng hơq amei vôôiq tơk ađôk — đóng amei ve chóóm bâân lêi lóóiq lơq bâân bing bhlaai Chuôq Yaang Liêm.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />N'drươh, mưi rau đu thê kơi xiêl, piđó n'tôq tââq mat ưng Saau-lơ, n'drươh, ađó bâân brương mat lóóiq, lơq xong xók yuur dyương, ađó đơơp têêng bap-teem; <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />xók ơi đơơp chana, ađó bâân chô lóóiq praan karơ. Xók achêk, ađó tơơt palơq nôôq môôn-đô dhiq Đa-met bơơr pe tangêi. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />N'drươh, ađó truuih pachóóm Chuôq Jê-su kalóóng nôôq đong nhoom, kơi Jê-su nek Akóón Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Dyóp ngaai tameng xâng maar hêq xâng, móón: “Eh lua nôk chêq nek dhươm đu ơi leng nôôq manưih gavơh nhan achak ađô dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem? Lơq eh alua ađó ơi tơk leq ađô taai rau ađek, đóng xong xók kóóp kađaai nek đââng chô piđó leq nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm ha lua?” <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Bơơi Saau-lơ bhiêk karơ lơh, lơq têêng paangra đóng nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq mamông dhiq Đa-met palơq truuih pakah kơi Jê-su nek Chuôq Paq Manưih.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Dhơ kơi ađek, xók bơk tangêi ơi lơh, manưih Jo Thaaiq tơơt pahoop madhiq tabâân leng ađó. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Kơi ađek bơơi, mangê ưng piđó ơi bâân truuih đóng Saau-lơ n'nal. Kơi ađek hayơq, palââng tơk mơ jư góón nôôq palóng kariing kanóón tóóng tangêi lơq hayum đóng leng karchêt ađó. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Xók achêk, xong xók đââng vôôiq kalóóng hayum, nôôq môôn-đô ưng ađó lơơi ađó padhaluônh hót nguôi jađơr kanóón, palơq tarnêêng xua ađó dhaluônh kalóóng mưi beq rađung.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Bơơi xók ơi tơk dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem, ađó tabhlơng tabâân đóng bâân ting mót palơq nôôq môôn-đô, hơq tabhơt piđó maar kakhin ađó, kah huuiq kơi ađó nek môôn-đô. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Xók achêk, xong xók đââng ađó vôôiq, Ba-na-ba đââng ađó tơk lum nôôq sưưq-đô, hayơq xêi đóng piđó ng'kơi têêng hơq ađó ơi lêi n'nal Chuôq dhiq kalơng, kung kơi Chuôq ơi praaq palơq ađó, lơq ng'kơi dhiq Đa-met, ađó ơi garâ lóóm truuih đuui vơn achak Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Kơi ađek nek, ađó tơơt palơq piđó xók vôôiq taval leq Jê-ru-sa-leem, garâ lóóm truuih đuui vơn achak Chuôq. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Ađó n'drươh praaq chiên, n'drươh ta-ââi palơq nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq praaq dhariêng Hi-laap, bơơi piđó tabâân leng ađó. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Bơơi xók ơi n'nal kơi ađek, nôôq adhi anó đââng ađó dhuônh leq Sê-sa-rê, lơq đââng ađó vôôiq leq Taat-sơ.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Kơi ađek, akóón dhơn Chuôq plok tabhơt xưưq Ju-đê, Ga-li-lê, lơq Sa-ma-ri ve rau yươq rau ha; ơi bâân tahayuur palơq bhadyaang vôôiq kalóóng rau bhi kakhin Chuôq lơq kalóóng rau tabhơơl lóóm ưng Chuôq Yaang Liêm, akóón dhơn Chuôq bâân n'dhương bâân vaaih bơk. <verse eid="ACT 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Xók achêk, chiên val vaaih ađek nek xók Phi-e-rơ xók vôôiq plok luch xưưq, nek kung vôôiq dhuônh tơk dham nôôq manưih huuiq Chuôq tơơt mamông dhiq Li-đa. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Hayơq dhiq ađek, ađó lum mưi manưih tôôh, achak Ê-nê, xók bêch dhuôr dhiq dharââng bhluuch takóól kamó, achêk nek manưih bâân ka-ai arươp. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Phi-e-rơ praaq palơq ađó ađek: “Ê-nê ơơi, Chuôq Jê-su Paq Manưih payươh đóng amei. Nek yuur dyương lơq dhoon dharââng amei vôôiq,” lơq n'drươh ađek, ađó yuur dyương. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Tabhơt nôôq ngaai mamông dhiq Li-đa lơq Sa-rôôn ơi lêi ađó, piđó maar val lóóiq palơq Chuôq.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Xók achêk, dhiq Jôôp-bê ve mưi môôn-đô tôôh achak Ta-bi-tha, achak achêk, xók ơi bâân lók, nek kiêng móón “Đô-ka”. Pađiil biêh bing nôôq tarnêêng liêm palơq bơk tarnêêng poor đu pađiil ơi têêng. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Chiên vil vaaih kalóóng nôôq tangêi ađek, achêk nek xong xók dhuôr ka-ai, ađó ơi chêt. Tatun ađek, xók ơi hóm raau đóng ađó xong, palââng tabêch ađó kalóóng buông dhiq gaak. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Ơi Li-đa dhiq đan Jôôp-bê, hayơq nôôq môôn-đô xók xâng kơi Phi-e-rơ dyơq tơơt dhiq ađek, piđó kayua bơơr chanak manưih vôôiq lum Phi-e-rơ, gavơh nhan: “Nhan óóq pajih jalưa đóng tơk leq nôôq yi.” <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Kơi ađek nek, xong xók yuur dyương, Phi-e-rơ vôôiq mandrươh palơq nhiđó, nek nôôq manưih đu, xók ơi tơk dham, piđó đââng ađó dyók leq buông dhiq gaak, hayơq tabhơt pađiil kamaai tơk dyương tóór ađó nhiim, lơq chaleq đóng ađó lêi nôôq aau chaguôk palơq bơk chanam n'nal n'đơq đu Đô-ka ơi ih xók dyơq tơơt palơq piđó. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Bơơi xók ơi kayua tabhơt gluh leq nguôi lơq chakoh takól leq katiêk, Phi-e-rơ gavơh nhan, hayơq xong xók palâh lóóm leq xaak, ađó praaq: “Ta-bi-tha, nek yuur aq.” Kơi ađek nek, pađiil meh mat ađêi, lơq xók lêi Phi-e-rơ, ađó yuur tơơt. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Xong xók tađương têi leq pađiil, ađó tơq pađiil yuur dyương, hayơq xók ơi dhaloong nôôq manưih huuiq Chuôq lơq nôôq pađiil kamaai mót, ađó đóng lêi pađiil dyơq mamông. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Xók achêk, tarnêêng ađô vaaih xar taruuih tanđôôr plok tabhơt Jôôp-bê lơq bơk manưih huuiq leq Chuôq. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Chiên val vaaih tatun ađek nek ađó ơi tơơt lóóiq bơk tangêi dhiq Jôôp-bê palơq mưi manưih tôôh achak Si-môôn, nek thơơq ih ng'kar.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Xók achêk dhiq kanóón Sê-sa-rê, mưi manưih achêk achak Koot-nêi, nek manưih kadhâng koq kalóóng kabhuh linh bâân đóók nek I-ta-li, <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />nek manưih bhreh bhriêl lơq bhi kakhin Yaang Pleng palơq tabhơt đong ađêi, têêng bơk tarnêêng poor jóói đóng manưih dhanuôr lơq gavơh nhan palơq Yaang Pleng kơi taluôn. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Kiêng mơ xók jơ đu takiêh kalóóng tangêi, kalóóng mưi rau tapalêi, ađó lêi drêh dróói mưi dhơn ưng Yaang Pleng bhral palơq ađêi lơq praaq palơq ađó: “Koot-nêi!” <verse eid="ACT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Bơơi xong xók lêi li mrang leq dhơn pleng lơq vaaih kapơn, ađó ââi: “Chuôq ơơi, ve raau kah?” Hayơq dhơn pleng achêk praaq palơq ađó: “Nôôq paraaq gavơh nhan ưng amei palơq nôôq tarnêêng poor jóói ưng amei ơi dyók tơk toom mat Yaang Pleng pakơi mưi bhanuôih hei taluôn. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Xók ađôk, nek kayua manưih tơk leq Jôôp-bê lơq vôôiq yua Si-môôn tôôh, ađó bâân đóók nek Phi-e-rơ. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Ađó achêk xók bâân yaauq taai mưi Si-môôn tôôh, thơơq ih ng'kar, nek manưih ve đong dhalam tóór taxiiq.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Kơi ađek hayơq, xók dhơn pleng, nek dhơn pleng praaq palơq ađó, ơi yuur xooq, nek xong xók dhaloong bơơr dhơn ratơơq kalóóng đong, palơq mưi chanak linh ve lóóm huuiq kalóóng sôôq nôôq manưih têêng yaauq ađêi, <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />lơq xók ơi truuih đóng piđó dyóp rau, ađó kayua piđó tơk leq Jôôp-bê.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Tangêi tatun, nek xók nôôq piđó achêk vôôiq dhiq kalơng lơq đan tơk kanóón, Phi-e-rơ vôôiq dyók leq taang pabhung đong đóng gavơh nhan patơk mơ jơ đu chapat. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Xók achêk, ađó tââp xâng ha-ul lơq kiêng cha, bơơi nek xók palââng ravang chana, mưi rau tapalêi bhral dhiq ađó, <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />ađó lêi talaang pleng ơi bâân tayaah lơq mưi rau kađôôq achêk padhaluônh, thê kơi mưi tala bhaai gamak, bâân padhaluônh leq katiêk taai puôn tahaal, <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />hơq kalóóng ađek nek tabhơt nôôq akóón adhah puôn dyung, nôôq adhah laai tatơ dhiq katiêk lơq nôôq achim pleng, <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Hơq mưi dhariêng praaq tơk palơq ađó: “Phi-e-rơ, nek xók yuur, hơq leng adhah lơq đah aq.” <verse eid="ACT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Bơơi Phi-e-rơ ââi: “Kakoh Chuôq, kah ve chóóm, ơi akóón yươq glêh ve đah cha dhơ dharau đu anhuq lơq kah ve sek.” <verse eid="ACT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Lơq mưi chu dyơq, dhariêng praaq achêk tơk palơq ađó kalóóng chu đu bơơr: “Rau dhơơm Yaang Pleng ơi têêng pasek, akóón óóq lêi nek anhuq.” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Kơi ađek hayơq, tarnêêng ađô vaaih tơk pe chu, lơq tala bhaai ađek n'drươh bâân takatoom chô leq pleng.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Xók achêk, nek xók Phi-e-rơ dyơq kanóq karaang kalóóng lóóm leq tapalêi đu ađó tame lêi nek hau rau, hơq lêi tôôh, nôôq manưih bâân Koot-nêi kayua vôôiq ơi dyương dhiq palóng, xong xók chêk tamóh đong Si-môôn. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Pei dhariêng dhaloong, piđó tamóh Si-môôn, bâân đóók nek Phi-e-rơ, ve alua môôiq eh nek xók bâân yaauq dhiq ađô. <verse eid="ACT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Dyơq Phi-e-rơ, nek xók dyơq đương kanóq leq rau tapalêi achêk, nek Yaang Liêm praaq palơq ađó: “Lêi tôôh, pe chanak padruuih xók chêk akóón. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Dhơ kơi ađek xong xók yuur dyương, akóón nek dhaluônh lơq vôôiq palơq piđó, óóq rau paangra, taai Aku ơi kayua piđó.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Kơi ađek nek, xók ơi vôôiq dhaluônh talum nôôq manưih achêk, Phi-e-rơ praaq: “Lêi nô, aku nôk manưih đu nôôq pe chik chêk. Ơi hau rau tarnêêng hơq nôôq pe vôôiq leq ađô?” <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Xók achêk, piđó ââi: “Takóh kadhâng akoq Koot-nêi, mưi manưih bhơt liêm lơq bhi kakhin Yaang Pleng, kung nek bâân haanh liêm taai tabhơt dhanuôr Jo Thaaiq, ơi bâân mưi dhơn pleng tabah pachóóm kayua phaai yua amei vôôiq leq đong ađêi đóng xâng nôôq paraaq pachóóm tââq amei.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Kơi ađek, xók ơi kayua piđó mót leq đong, ađó yaauq piđó. Hayơq tangêi rayiiu, xong xók yuur dyương, ađó yuur vôôiq palơq piđó, lơq nôôq adhi anó tââq Jôôp-bê ting vôôiq palơq ađó. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Lơq hayơq, tangêi tatun, piđó vôôiq tơk leq Sê-sa-rê. Xók achêk, Koot-nêi đương kêch piđó, xók bhêêl ơi dhaloong bơk xóng anó ađêi palơq nôôq parjơơk đan griêq nhoom hoop lóóiq. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Bhêêl ađek, chiên ơi vaaih xók Phi-e-rơ bhadyaang mót, bhêêl lum mat ađó, nek Koot-nêi bhuôih kakoh, chakoh takól dhiq dyung ađó. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Bơơi Phi-e-rơ tơq ađó yuur, praaq: “Nhan nek yuur dyương! Chênh aku kala kung nek akóón manưih giêl.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Xók praaq chiên palơq Koot-nêi, ađó mót lơq lêi bơk manưih ơi nhoom kaboq madhiq. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />N'drươh xók ađek, ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Chênh nôôq pe n'nal ađô nek rau lơt gani ng'kơi palơq mưi manưih Jo Thaaiq têêng parjơơk môôiq vôôiq tham mưi manưih dhanuôr lââng, bơơi palơq aku, Yaang Pleng ơi paraaq pachóóm óóq đóók mưi nak nek anhuq môôiq kah sek. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Taai kơi ađek, xong xók ơi bâân kayua, aku ơi vôôiq mưi kơi yươq karnóq karaang. Kơi ađek, aku xók karnóq, hau rau hơq nôôq pe đóng kayua aku?” <verse eid="ACT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Koot-nêi ââi: “Puôn tangêi bhalek, tơk jơ ađô, xók aku gavơh nhan kalóóng đong ađêi leq jơ đu takiêh, nek lêi tôôh, mưi manưih dyương toom mat aku xơp kun aau brương braang, <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />lơq manưih achêk praaq: ‘Koot-nêi, paraaq gavơh nhan ưng amei ơi bâân xâng lơq nôôq tarnêêng poor jóói ưng amei ơi bâân hei tơk toom mat Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Kơi ađek, nek kayua manưih vôôiq leq Jôôp-bê lơq kayua Si-môôn, nek ađó bâân đóók nek Phi-e-rơ. Ađó achêk xók bâân yaauq dhiq đong ưng Si-môôn, mưi manưih ih ng'kar, tóór taxiiq.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Taai kơi ađek, aku n'drươh đóng manưih vôôiq kayua amei, n'drươh ađek amei kung ơi vôôiq nek dhalam tơk leq ađô. Taai kơi ađek, xók ađôk, tabhơt nôôq yi tơơt dhiq ađô toom mat Yaang Pleng đóng xâng dyóp rau ơi bâân Chuôq pató pachóóm dhiq amei.” <verse eid="ACT 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Xók achêk, ơi pơơh bóóp praaq, Phi-e-rơ móón: “Ting kơi paraaq dhalam, aku n'nal nek Yaang Pleng eh rau nek Yaang mahóng malóóm. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Klóóih leq ađek, kalóóng dyóp dhanuôr, ngaai bhi kakhin Ađó lơq têêng rau bhơt liêm nek bâân đơơp đươi palơq Ađó. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Taruuih đu Ađó ơi pagơơi đóng manưih dhanuôr I-sơ-ra-êên, truuih Taruuih Liêm leq yươq rau ha ting tââq Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, Ađó nek Chuôq ưng akóón manưih — <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />nôôq pe ơi n'nal xók tarnêêng ơi vaaih bhluuch luch xưưq Ju-đê, tââp tanââp dhiq Ga-li-lê, xong pheep bap-teem đu Jang ơi truuih đuui, <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />leq Jê-su, Yaang gluh tââq Na-xa-reet, ng'kơi hơq Yaang Pleng ơi xut dhơu đóng Ađó palơq Chuôq Yaang Liêm lơq mataai raman, nek Yaang vôôiq leq ađô leq tôôh têêng tarnêêng liêm kre lơq payươh dyóp nak bâân abhưi bóq, ơi Yaang Pleng tơơt palơq Ađó. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Nôôq yi nek nôôq manưih lêi n'nal leq tabhơt nôôq tarnêêng đu Ađó ơi têêng, dhiq katiêk ưng manưih Jo Thaaiq lơq kơi dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem, kung nek Yaang đu piđó ơi leng palơq tarnêêng yông Ađó dhiq n'lóóng chatông. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Yaang Pleng ơi têêng đóng Ađó mamông lóóiq leq tangêi đu pe lơq đóng Ađó pakah kơi drêh dróói, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />eh rau đóng tabhơt dyóp ngaai, bơơi đóng nôôq manưih lêi n'nal ơi bâân Yaang Pleng chââih tââq laloom — chênh nek đóng nôôq yi, nôôq manưih ơi cha lơq ơm palơq Ađó xók Ađó mamông lóóiq tââq kan chêt. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Ađó ơi paraaq kayua nôôq yi truuih pachóóm đóng manưih dhanuôr lơq truuih đuui dyóp liêm kơi Ađó nek Yaang ơi bâân Yaang Pleng chââih têêng Yaang praaq xêi manưih mamông lơq manưih chêt. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Achêk nek leq Ađó, tabhơt nôôq manưih đââng taruuih truuih đuui nek la ngaai lơơi lóóm huuiq dhiq Ađó nek bâân đơơp rau lơơi matu lơt kalóóng achak Ađó.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Xók Phi-e-rơ dyơq praaq nôôq paraaq achêk, nek Chuôq Yaang Liêm jaq dhiq dyóp nak đương xâng taruuih ưng ađó. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Nôôq manưih huuiq mađó kabhuh đơơp iêt ng'kar — chênh nek tabhơt nôôq ngaai ơi vôôiq mandrươh palơq Phi-e-rơ — maar hêq lêi, taai rau đóng Chuôq Yaang Liêm kung bâân n'toh dhiq dhanuôr palââng. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Taai piđó xâng nôôq manưih ađô praaq palơq nôôq dhariêng lââng lơq bhi haanh Yaang Pleng. Leq bhêêl achêk, Phi-e-rơ pơơh bóóp: <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Ve kơq ngaai ađek ve chóóm kajơq đơơk đóng nôôq manưih ađô kah chóóm têêng bap-teem, chênh nek nôôq manưih ơi bâân đơơp Chuôq Yaang Liêm kung kơi nôôq he?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Kơi ađek hayơq, ađó kayua đóng piđó têêng bap-teem kalóóng achak Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. Tatun ađek, piđó nhan ađó tơơt lóóiq bơơr pe tangêi.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Xók achêk, nôôq sưưq-đô lơq adhi anó dhiq plok Ju-đê xâng kơi dhanuôr katiêk lââng kung ơi pei đơơp taruuih ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Kơi ađek hayơq, xók Phi-e-rơ vôôiq đơk tơk Jê-ru-sa-leem, nôôq manưih mađó kabhuh đơơp iêt ng'kar tarkaai palơq ađó, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />móón kơi ađó ơi vôôiq mót leq dham nôôq manưih kah đơơp iêt ng'kar lơq cha madhiq palơq piđó. <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Bơơi xók pei praaq, Phi-e-rơ kluôh tarnêêng leq piđó ting kơi matââq tââq kơi ađô: <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Aku xók gavơh nhan dhiq kanóón Jôôp-bê, lơq kalóóng gluh ravaai aku lêi rau tapalêi leq mưi rau kađôôq achêk xók dhaluônh, thê kơi tala bhaai gamak puôl puôn tahaal bâân padhaluônh tââq pleng lơq ađó tơk nham dhiq aku, <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />hơq xók chaling lêi leq ađek, aku chamet lêi lơq lêi akóón adhah puôn dyung dhiq katiêk, nôôq adhah dhiq krơng, nôôq adhah laai tatơ, palơq nôôq achim pleng. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Hayơq aku kung xâng mưi dhariêng praaq palơq ađêi: ‘Phi-e-rơ, xong xók yuur, nek leng adhah lơq đah aq!’ <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Bơơi aku ââi: ‘Kakoh Chuôq, Kah ve chóóm, ơi rau anhuq môôiq kah sek kah ve chóóm mót leq kalóóng bóóp akóón.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Dhơ kơi ađek, dhariêng tââq pleng ââi lóóiq kalóóng chu đu bơơr, kơi ađô: ‘Rau dhơơm Yaang Pleng ơi têêng pasek, akóón kah chóóm lêi nek anhuq.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Xók achêk, tarnêêng ađô vaaih tơk pe chu, hayơq dyóp rau bâân ruiq taval leq pleng. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Lơq lêi tôôh, pe chanak padruuih n'drươh xók ađek dyương dhiq palóng đong đu nôôq yi xók tơơt kalóóng, taai ơi bâân kayua vôôiq tââq Sê-sa-rê tơk palơq aku. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Xók achêk, Yaang Liêm kayua aku vôôiq palơq piđó, yươq rau ve karnóq. Kơi ađek hayơq, chapat adhi anó ađô kung vôôiq palơq aku, lơq nôôq yi mót leq kalóóng đong ưng ađó ađek. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Tatun ađek, ađó achêk ơi truuih lóóiq leq nôôq yi ng'kơi ađó achêk ơi lêi dhơn pleng dyương kalóóng đong ađêi, kayua kơi ađô: ‘Nek kayua manưih vôôiq leq Jôôp-bê lơq vôôiq yua Si-môôn, manưih bâân đóók nek Phi-e-rơ, <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />nek ađó e móón đóng amei nôôq paraaq pachóóm hơq đươi ađek, amei e bâân paq — amei lơq luch palóng đong ưng amei.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Bơơi xók aku tââp praaq, Chuôq Yaang Liêm ơi dhaluônh jaq dhiq piđó kung thê kơi dhiq nôôq he leq xók tââp tanââp. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Hayơq aku hei tơk paraaq ưng Chuôq, ng'kơi Ađó ơi praaq: ‘Jang ơi têêng bap-teem palơq đơơk; bơơi adhi anó e bâân bap-teem palơq Chuôq Yaang Liêm.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Kơi ađek hayơq, la Yaang Pleng ơi đóng leq piđó mađó mưi ơơn kung kơi đóng leq nôôq he xók patơơt lóóm huuiq leq Chuôq, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, hayơq aku nek ngaai hơq ve chóóm kajơq Yaang Pleng?” <verse eid="ACT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Xók achêk, xók ơi xâng nôôq paraaq achêk, piđó kah dyơq tarkaai hơq bhi haanh Yaang Pleng, móón kơi ađô: “Kơi ađek nek Yaang Pleng kung ơi đóng leq nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng rau klôôq lóóm đóng đơơp parmông.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Tatun ađek, nôôq manưih tachêh tavươk tââq tarnêêng janah ơi vaaih taai tarnêêng Ê-tiên ơi tablah patơk leq Phê-ni-xi, Chiip-rơ lơq An-ti-ôôt, kah praaq đóng ngaai leq taruuih, mơ chapiên manưih Jo Thaaiq. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Bơơi m'bưưiq manưih kalóóng sôôq ađek nek nôôq manưih tââq Chiip-rơ lơq Si-reen, hơq nôôq manưih ađô xók ơi vôôiq tơk An-ti-ôôt, piđó kung praaq palơq nôôq manưih Hi-laap, truuih Taruuih Liêm leq Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Têi ưng Chuôq tơơt palơq piđó; lơq masôôq bơk bhlơng, ơi huuiq, ơi palâh lóóm leq Chuôq. <verse eid="ACT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Xók achêk, taruuih leq nôôq manưih ađô tanđôôr tơk katór akóón dhơn Chuôq tơơt dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem, hayơq piđó kayua Ba-na-ba vôôiq patơk An-ti-ôôt, <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />hơq xong xók tơk leq ađek lơq lêi phươk liêm ưng Yaang Pleng, ađó bâân bhuui marhaal lơq chut lóóm tabhơt bhiêk tơơt kalóóng Chuôq palơq rau tamưng kalóóng lóóm. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Ơi ađó nek mưi manưih mamông liêm, bing bhlaai Chuôq Yaang Liêm palơq lóóm huuiq, lơq bơk manưih bâân n'dhương chô leq Chuôq. <verse eid="ACT 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Tatun ađek, ađó vôôiq tơk leq Taat-sơ đóng chêk Saau-lơ. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Xók ơi bâân lêi, ađó đââng Saau-lơ tơk An-ti-ôôt. Kơi ađek hayơq, chiên val vaaih palơq piđó patơk mơ kalóóng luch mưi kamó achêk nek bâân krong nhoom palơq akóón dhơn Chuôq lơq truuih pachóóm bơk manưih. N'drươh xók ađek, nek tââp tanââp dhiq An-ti-ôôt, nôôq môôn-đô bâân đóók nek manưih huuiq Chuôq.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Xók achêk, kalóóng nôôq tangêi ađek, nôôq manưih đââng taruuih tââq Jê-ru-sa-leem vôôiq dhuônh tơk An-ti-ôôt. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Kơi ađek hayơq, xong xók mưi nak kalóóng sôôq piđó, achak A-ga-buut, yuur dyương, ơi Yaang Liêm, ađó đóng n'nal kơi mưi ganơt ha-ul gamak ravang vaaih tơk dhiq plok hóng katiêk. Tarnêêng ađô ơi vaaih kalóóng đơơi Kơ-lôôt. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Kơi ađek nek kalóóng nôôq môôn-đô, dyóp nak kalóóng sôôq achêk, la ngaai ve đuôh mak meen ve, piđó ơi praaq xêi ravang phơn poor jóói đóng pagơơi adhi anó mamông dhiq Ju-đê, <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />hơq piđó lalua ơi têêng kơi ađek, xók kayua đââng tơk nôôq takóh bhươl tââq têi ưng Ba-na-ba lơq Saau-lơ.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Xók achêk, leq kamó kaxe ađek, bhua Hê-rôôt pei têi janah chanaaq masôôq manưih kalóóng akóón dhơn Chuôq. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Xók achêk, ađó ađek leng chêt Ja-kơ, anó ưng Jang, palơq bhươt. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Kơi ađek hayơq, xók lêi kơi tarnêêng ađô nek rau iêm lóóm palơq manưih Jo Thaaiq, ađó ađek kung val kayua kóóp jư Phi-e-rơ (hơq nôôq chiên ađek val vaaih leq nôôq tangêi ưng bhiêk Beng Kah Piêng), <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />lơq xong xók kóóp jư Phi-e-rơ, ađó ađek ơi đóng król leq đong kanam, pajaau đóng puôn kabhuh linh jư lêi ađó, kanóq đââng pagluh ađó toom dhanuôr xong Bhiêk Jalơh. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Kơi ađek nek, dhơ Phi-e-rơ xók takról kalóóng đong kanam, bơơi rau gavơh nhan nek dyơq bâân têêng mưi kơi nhan bhel palâh leq Yaang Pleng ơi đóng ađó taai akóón dhơn Chuôq. <verse eid="ACT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Xók achêk, leq xók Hê-rôôt ravang đââng ađó gluh xêi, chênh hayum ađek, Phi-e-rơ xók bêch bhlưa bơơr chanak linh, ơi takađaai palơq bơơr tarlêi xiêng, xók ađek nôôq linh đương jư hót laloom palóng xók đương jư đong kanam. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Lêi tôôh, mưi dhơn pleng ưng Chuôq bhral dyương hót tóór ađó, brương dyóól kalóóng buông takról. Xók achêk, xong xók tapeh leq bharêêu Phi-e-rơ, dhơn pleng payuur ađó, móón: “Nek yuur pađâh,” lơq nôôq tarlêi xiêng ađó n'tôq tââq têi. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Xók achêk, dhơn pleng praaq palơq ađó: “Nek tư n'dret tarveng lơq đâq dheep ưng amei vaq.” Kơi ađek hayơq, ađó têêng i kơi ađek. Dhơn pleng kung praaq palơq ađó: “Nek xơp aau nguôi ưng amei vaq lơq ting aku.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Xong xók gluh leq nguôi, ađó ting manưih achêk hơq ađó ơi kah n'nal kơi tarnêêng xók bâân têêng taai dhơn pleng nek lalua bơơi ađó bhiêk ngóq nek xók lêi mưi rau tapalêi. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Xók ơi vôôiq lalơh nôôq kabhuh linh đương jư đu laloom, hơq thưưq bơơr, nhiđó vôôiq tơk palóng kariing palơq bhaxêi đââng mót leq kanóón, hơq ađó tư tarlóng đóng nhiđó. Xong xók gluh leq nguôi, nhiđó vôôiq dhuônh leq mưi kalơng lơq dhơn pleng n'drươh xooq tââq ađó. <verse eid="ACT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Xók ađêi kala ơi meh lóóiq, Phi-e-rơ praaq: “Alua, xók ađô aku hayơq n'nal kơi Chuôq ơi kayua dhơn Ađó lơq paq jóói aku gluh tââq têi Hê-rôôt, palơq dyóp rau đương rââm ưng manưih Jo Thaaiq.” <verse eid="ACT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Lơq n'drươh, xók ơi n'nal kơi ađek, ađó vôôiq tơk leq đong Ma-ri, amêêq ưng Jang, bâân đóók nek Maak, đu dhiq ađô ve bơk manưih huuiq Chuôq bâân krong nhoom lơq xók gavơh nhan. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Xók achêk, xók ađó takóq palóng kariing, mưi dhơn ratơơq pađiil, achak Rô-đơ, bhadyaang pađan đóng ââi. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Xók bâân n'nal dhariêng ưng Phi-e-rơ, hơq taai bhuui sương, ađó ơi kah lóng palóng, bơơi lóóiq mut leq kalóóng, ađó truuih praaq kơi ađô: “Phi-e-rơ xók dyương dhiq palóng.” <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Dhơ kơi ađek, piđó móón palơq ađó: “Amei xươl aq.” Bơơi ađó bhiêk praaq makơi chiên avaaih kơi ađek. Kơi ađek hayơq, piđó móón: “Ađek nek dhơn pleng ưng ađó achêk.” <verse eid="ACT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Bơơi, Phi-e-rơ bhiêk takóq, lơq xong xók lóng, piđó lêi ađó lơq maar kadrêq lêi. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Xók achêk, xók ơi pei têi katah đóng piđó parngau, ađó truuih lóóiq đóng ng'kơi hơq Chuôq ơi đââng ađó gluh tââq đong kanam. Lơq N'drươh, ađó pató: “Nek truuih lóóiq nôôq tarnêêng ađô đóng Ja-kơ lơq đóng nôôq adhi anó.” Hayơq gluh leq nguôi, ađó vôôiq tơk mưi dham lââng. <verse eid="ACT 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Xók achêk, xók ơi brương, ve đu nhôôn nhaauq kah katưưiq kalóóng kabhuh linh taai tarnêêng ơi vaaih đóng leq Phi-e-rơ. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Dyơq Hê-rôôt, xók ơi kayua chêk lêi manưih hơq kah lêi, xók tamóh xong kabhuh linh đương jư, ađó ađek kayua leng piđó. Lơq xong xók vôôiq tââq Ju-đê dhuônh tơk Sê-sa-rê, ađó ađek tơơt lóóiq dhiq ađek.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Xók achêk, ađó ađek xók kabhróónh dhanuôr Ti-rơ lơq dhanuôr Si-đôôn. Kơi ađek hayơq, piđó pajươk vôôiq xóng piđó lum ađó ađek, lơq xók ơi đuôh pei lóóm Ba-la-tuut, nek kuôn đan griêq ưng bhua, piđó nhan paliêm taai xưưq piđó bâân kơl tarmông tââq xưưq ưng bhua. <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Bhêêl achêk, leq tangêi ơi ravang, xong xók xơp aau bhua lơq tơơt dhiq tanơơt, Hê-rôôt praaq karơ toom piđó. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Xók achêk, dhanuôr lalơu karơ: “Achêk nek dhariêng ưng mưi yaang, eh rau ưng akóón manưih!” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Hayơq n'drươh ađek, mưi dhơn pleng ưng Chuôq vei ađó ađek ơi taai ađó ađek kah tapôông rau cha-iil tabah leq Yaang Pleng, lơq xong xók ka-ai m'mreh janah, nek ađó ađek pat parhââm.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Dyơq taruuih ưng Yaang Pleng bhiêk vaaih karơ lơq n'dhương bơk.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Tatun ađek, Ba-na-ba lơq Saau-lơ val chô tơk Jê-ru-sa-leem, xók ơi paxong tarnêêng têêng yaauq ưng ađêi, ting đââng Jang ting vôôiq, manưih bâân đóók nek Maak.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Xók achêk, dhiq kalóóng Akóón Dhơn Chuôq dhiq An-ti-ôôt, ve nôôq manưih đââng taruuih lơq thêi pachóóm: Ba-na-ba, Si-mê-ôôn bâân đóók nek Ni-jê, Lu-si-uut manưih Si-reen; Ma-na-heem, adhi patơơt ưng bhua katưưiq Hê-rôôt, lơq Saau-lơ. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Bhêêl achêk, xók dyơq piđó bhuôih haanh Chuôq lơq điêng cha, nek Chuôq Yaang Liêm praaq: “Phaai pantua Ba-na-ba lơq Saau-lơ lalei đóng leq Aku, đóng têêng tarnêêng đu Aku ơi dhaloong nhiđó.” <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Taai ađek, xong xók điêng cha, nhan gavơh lơq lơơi têi dhiq bơơr nhiđó achêk, piđó lơơi đóng vôôiq.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Kơi ađek, xong xók bâân kayua vôôiq taai Chuôq Yaang Liêm, bơơr nhiđó dhuônh tơk Sê-lơ-xi; lơq tââq ađek nhiđó vôôiq bhuông tơk Chiip-rơ. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Xók ơi tơk dhiq Sa-la-miin, nhiđó truuih paraaq taruuih ưng Yaang Pleng kalóóng nôôq đong nhoom ưng manưih Jo Thaaiq. Xók achêk, nhiđó kung ve Jang kơi mưi manưih jóói poor. <verse eid="ACT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Tatun ađek, xong xók chaang gan bhơt kôông tơk luch Ba-phô, piđó lum mưi chanak achêk, manưih magun magru, manưih đââng taruuih galơơk manưih Jo Thaaiq, achak ađó nek Ba-jê-su, <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />hơq manưih ađô tơơt palơq kuôn jư kanóón Sê-juut Phaau-luut, mưi manưih tabech galang. Xók ơi kayua dhaloong Ba-na-ba lơq Saau-lơ, kuôn chêk tabâân đóng xâng taruuih ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Bơơi “manưih magun” Ê-li-ma (ơi achak ađó bâân kluôh kơi ađek), tajơl piđó, tabâân kơi paxraang kuôn jư kanóón tââq lóóm huuiq. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Dyơq Saau-lơ, kung đóók nek Phaau-lô, bâân bing bhlaai Chuôq Yaang Liêm, xók lêi limrang leq ađó ađek, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />lơq praaq: “Ni manưih bing bhlaai rau chachââr galơơk lơq dyóp rau đu aak, akóón ưng abhưi, brau ưng dyóp rau bhơt liêm, amei e kah dhêi paxưa kalơng dhalam tapat ưng Chuôq ha? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Xók ađôk, nek lêi aq, têi ưng Chuôq jơl palơq amei lơq amei e bâân kabaang, kah chóóm lêi mat tangêi kalóóng mưi ganah.” Kơi ađek nek, n'drươh, đu bhơơm kanam vaaih dhiq ađó, lơq ađó tachiêl viêl chêk manưih kadhâng têi chơơng ađó. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Xók ađô, xók ơi bâân lêi tarnêêng tame vaaih, kuôn jư kanóón huuiq, ơi bâân chrih lêi toom paraaq pachóóm ưng Chuôq.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Xók achêk, xong xók dhaluônh tââq bhuông tââq Ba-phô, nôôq manưih ting vôôiq palơq Phaau-lô vôôiq tơk Beet-jê mađó Baam-phi-li. Bơơi ơi róch xooq tââq piđó, Jang val chô leq Jê-ru-sa-leem. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Dyơq piđó, xong xók xooq tââq Beet-jê, nek vôôiq tơk An-ti-ôôt mađó Bi-si-đi, lơq xók ơi vôôiq leq đong gươl kalóóng tangêi Sa-baat, piđó tơơt xâng. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Tatun tarnêêng pei đok bha-aar gani lơq nôôq manưih đââng taruuih, nôôq manưih kadhâng lêi đong gươl kayua manưih tơk palơq piđó, praaq kơi ađô: “Nhan móón nôôq pe, nôôq manưih adhi anó, la taruuih payuur lóóm đu đóng leq dhanuôr ve dhiq nôôq pe, nek nhan phaai yuur praaq.” <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Kơi ađek hayơq, xong xók yuur dyương lơq hayuur têi têêng kanal, Phaau-lô praaq: “Nhan móón nôôq pe, nôôq manưih I-sơ-ra-êên lơq ngaai dhơơm bhuôih haanh Yaang Pleng, nhan tameng xâng. <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Yaang Pleng ưng dhanuôr I-sơ-ra-êên ađô ơi chââih avuôq nôôq he, têêng piđó grâ karơ kalóóng kaxe kamó tơơt at dhiq katiêk Ai Kơp, lơq palơq makóng têi hayuur payaal, Ađó kađââng piđó gluh tââq ađek. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Kalóóng mơ kaxe kamó puôn jêt kamó Ađó đơơp jruôn piđó dhiq kruung vơng. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Lơq xong xók leng kaxiêt tapól dhanuôr kalóóng xưưq Ka-na-aan, Ađó đóng xưưq ưng piđó leq nôôq he têêng drươp kavaan, <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />kalóóng mơ puôn hariêng xââng jêt kamó. Tatun nôôq tarnêêng ađek, Ađó ơi đóng leq piđó nôôq takóh xêi xanêi đóng tơk đơơi Sa-mu-êên manưih đââng taruuih. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Tââq xók ađek leq tatun, dhanuôr gavơh nhan mưi bhua, lơq Yaang Pleng ơi đóng leq piđó Saau-lơ, akóón padruuih ưng Kit, mưi manưih mađó kabhuh Bêên-ja-miin, kalóóng puôn jêt kamó. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Lơq xók ơi bhlêh lơơi ađó ađek, Ađó hayuur Đa-viit dyók têêng bhua ưng piđó, hơq xók truuih đuui leq ađó, Chuôq kung praaq: ‘Aku ơi bâân lêi Đa-viit, akóón padruuih Je-sê, mưi manưih ting lóóm Aku, nek manưih e têêng dyóp kanóq kiêng ưng Aku.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Tââq dhong nooi ưng bhua ađô, ting kơi paraaq hươq, Yaang Pleng ơi đââng tơk leq I-sơ-ra-êên mưi Yaang Paq Manưih, nek Chuôq Jê-su, <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />xók Jang ơi truuih paraaq laloom ađek mưi pheep bap-teem leq rau klôôq lóóm đóng tabhơt dhanuôr I-sơ-ra-êên, laloom đu tabhral ưng Ađó. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Xók achêk, xók Jang ơi paxong tarnêêng ađêi, ađó móón: ‘Adhi anó dhơơch aku nek ngaai? Eh rau nek aku ađô. Dhơ kơi ađek, nek lêi, Yaang xók tơk tatun aku, nek Yaang đu aku kah đaang đóng lêh dheep tââq dyung Ađó.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />Nhan móón nôôq pe, nhan móón adhi anó, nek akóón chachau mađó dhong nooi Ap-ra-haam lơq nôôq manưih bhi kakhin Yaang Pleng kalóóng m'pơng adhi anó, taruuih ưng leq đu paq jóói ađô ơi bâân tađóng tơk leq nôôq he. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Ơi nôôq manưih mamông dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem lơq nôôq takóh kadhâng akoq ưng piđó kah lêi n'nal Yaang achêk, hayơq piđó ơi têêng yaap nôôq paraaq ưng nôôq manưih đââng taruuih dyơq bâân đok dyóp tangêi Sa-baat, xók xêi matu Ađó. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Dhơ kah bâân lêi mưi rau đu đóng xêi leng, bơơi piđó ơi nhan kayua Phi-laat têêng Ađó bâân leng. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Xók achêk, xók piđó ơi têêng paxong dyóp rau bâân xaraq leq Ađó, nek xong xók padhaluônh tââq n'lóóng, piđó tabêch Ađó kalóóng mưi beq ping. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Bơơi Yaang Pleng ơi têêng Ađó mamông lóóiq tââq kan chêt, <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />hơq Ađó ơi bâân lêi kalóóng bơk tangêi taai nôôq manưih vôôiq đơk palơq Ađó tââq Ga-li-lê tơk Jê-ru-sa-leem, nôôq manưih achêk xók ađôk nek manưih truuih ưng Ađó toom dhanuôr. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Nôôq yi xók truuih đuui Taruuih Liêm đóng adhi anó, nek paraaq hươq ơi tơk palơq avuôq ưng nôôq he, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />kơi Yaang Pleng ơi paxong dyóp liêm rau achêk đóng nôôq akóón chachau ưng nôôq he, xók têêng Chuôq Jê-su mamông lóóiq. Kung kơi rau ơi bâân xaraq kalóóng Haanh Pleng đu bơơr:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">‘Akóón nek Akóón Aku, tangêi ađô Aku ơi n'niên Akóón.’<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Kơi lââng, ơi taai Ađó ơi têêng Yaang achêk mamông lóóiq tââq kan chêt, e kah ve val chô palơq rau hư bil dyơq, kơi ađek hayơq Ađó praaq kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">‘Aku e đóng leq Akóón nôôq ơơn phươk liêm ưng Đa-viit, chênh nek nôôq phươk liêm lalua.’<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Kung taai kơi ađek, Ađó praaq kalóóng mưi Haanh Pleng lââng, kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:35">‘Ađó e kah lơơi đóng Yaang Tabah Ađó lêi rau hư bil.’<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Bơơi hơq, palơq Đa-viit kalóóng klaang đơơi ưng ađêi kala, xong xók têêng yaauq kanóq kiêng ưng Yaang Pleng, nek ađó ơi bêch, bâân tơp palơq avuôq ađêi, lơq ơi lêi rau hư bil. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Bơơi Yaang đu Yaang Pleng ơi têêng mamông lóóiq nek yươq lêi rau hư bil. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Taai kơi ađek, nhan móón nôôq pe, nhan móón adhi anó, rau ađô phaai nek rau n'nal giit palơq adhi anó, kơi ganơơm Yaang achêk, rau talơơi matu lơt bâân truuih đuui đóng adhi anó lơq tââq dyóp rau đu taai piđó, adhi anó ơi kah ve đuôh bâân đóók bhơt liêm ting kơi gani Môôi-se. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Kalóóng Yaang achêk, dyóp nak huuiq nek bâân đóók bhơt liêm. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Kơi ađek, phaai chagơn lêi, ve nh'jau rau ơi bâân praaq kalóóng nôôq bha-aar đââng taruuih ve chóóm vaaih tơk đóng adhi anó:<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />‘Nôôq manưih pacheh kađiq tôôh, nek lêi, hayơq kapơn lêi lơq bâân leng kaxiêt vaq!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">Ơi Aku xók têêng mưi tarnêêng kalóóng đơơi nôôq pe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">mưi tarnêêng đu nôôq pe lalua kah huuiq, dhơ đóng ve ngaai truuih tanđôôr đóng nôôq pe.’”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Xók achêk, ơi xók bơơr nhiđó yuur vôôiq, dhanuôr nhan panhel đóng bâân pachóóm leq ađêi nôôq paraaq achêk leq tangêi Sa-baat tatun. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Bhêêl achêk, xók vaar nhoom hoop ơi xong, bơk manưih Jo Thaaiq lơq nôôq manưih bhơt lóóm ting mót taruuih Jo Thaaiq ơi vôôiq ting Phaau-lô lơq Ba-na-ba, xók bơơr nhiđó praaq chiên palơq piđó, nek pató pachóóm piđó bhiêk mamông kalóóng phươk liêm ưng Yaang Pleng.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Kơi ađek hayơq, leq tangêi Sa-baat tatun, kiêng luch kanóón krong nhoom đóng xâng taruuih ưng Chuôq. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Bơơi xók lêi ganơr manưih bơk, nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq bing lóóm makhinh, lơq tarkaai nôôq rau bâân praaq taai Phaau-lô, palơq praaq tamôôp ađó. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Ââi lóóiq kơi grâ, luch Phaau-lô lơq Ba-na-ba ơi praaq kơi ađô: “Rau kiiq tââm nek taruuih ưng Yaang Pleng phaai bâân pachóóm đóng nôôq pe laloom tââm. Ơi n'nal kơi nôôq pe kah đươi taruuih ađô lơq tư lêi ađêi kah đaang palơq parmông taluôn luôn, hayơq nek lêi, nôôq yi ơi bharviih leq nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Taai Chuôq ơi praaq kayua đóng nôôq yi kơi ađô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">‘Aku ơi patơơt akóón kơi brương đóng leq nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">đóng akóón mamông leq rau paq jóói yuur tơk leq luch pale katiêk.’”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Xók achêk, xók xâng kơi ađek, nôôq manưih dhanuôr katiêk lââng bhuui marhaal lơq bhi haanh taruuih ưng Chuôq, lơq tabhơt nôôq ngaai ơi bâân chaleq đóng parmông taluôn luôn nek maar huuiq. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Kơi ađek hayơq, taruuih ưng Chuôq bâân tanđôôr plok luch xưưq. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Bơơi manưih Jo Thaaiq paxuq nôôq pađiil ve lóóm huuiq bâân bhi chap palơq nôôq manưih têêng gamak kalóóng kanóón, hayơq mưi rau janah yuur vaaih tajơl Phaau-lô lơq Ba-na-ba, piđó kóóp bơơr nhiđó gluh tââq katiêk kanóón ưng piđó. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Xók achêk, xong xók tapiêh bhiq dhiq dyung đóng jơl lóóiq nhiđó, bơơr nhiđó vôôiq tơk I-kô-ni. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Dyơq nôôq môôn-đô bâân bing bhlaai bhuui marhaal lơq Chuôq Yaang Liêm.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Xók achêk, chiên ơi vaaih dhiq I-kô-ni ađek nek ting mandrươh nhiđó vôôiq mót leq kalóóng đong gươl ưng manưih Jo Thaaiq lơq paraaq pachóóm i kơi ađek patơk mơ bơk bhlơng manưih, luch Jo Thaaiq lơq Hi-laap, ơi huuiq. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Bơơi nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq kah huuiq ơi paxuq lơq têêng lóóm kanóq nôôq manưih katiêk lââng karnóq môôp jơl lóóiq nôôq adhi anó. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Taai kơi ađek, nhiđó tơơt lóóiq dhiq ađek mưi ganah đươnh, truuih pachóóm kơi nhóól grâ leq Chuôq, nek Yaang pakah đóng taruuih ưng phươk liêm Ađó palơq tarnêêng đóng nôôq kanal chrih lơq tarnêêng mataai chrih ơi vaaih ting tââq têi nhiđó. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Bơơi dhanuôr kalóóng kanóón bâân tablah, lơq masôôq nek ting manưih Jo Thaaiq, dyơq sôôq lââng ting nôôq sưưq-đô. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Dhơ kơi ađek, xók mangê janah chanaaq ưng luch nôôq manưih katiêk lââng lơq manưih Jo Thaaiq, palơq kabhuh kadhâng koq ưng piđó, bâân vaaih đóng janah lơq glơm dhơl nhiđó, <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />nek xong xók n'nal rau ađek, nhiđó xooq klôôn leq nôôq kanóón Li-kao-ni, Liit-trơ, Đeet-bơ, lơq kanóón parah ađek, <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />hayơq dhiq ađek, nhiđó bhiêk truuih pachóóm Taruuih Liêm.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Dhiq Liit-trơ, mưi nak khuch ke achêk xók tơơt, palơq bơơr beq dyung rabóót tââq xók dyơq kalóóng luônh amêêq ađêi, hơq ađó ađek kah glêh bhadyaang vôôiq. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Ađó ađô xâng Phaau-lô pachóóm, hơq ađó xók lêi li mrang leq ađó hayơq lêi kơi ađó ađô ve lóóm huuiq đóng bâân payươh. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Ađó praaq pakarơ dhariêng kơi ađô: “Nek yuur dyương tapat tââq dyung ưng amei”, hayơq ađó yuur chaplóng lơq bhadyaang vôôiq. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Lơq n'drươh, xók dhanuôr lêi rau đu Phaau-lô ơi têêng, piđó pei dhariêng, praaq palơq dhariêng Li-kao-ni ưng ađêi, kơi ađô: “Nôôq yaang, pei xơp chak araang akóón manưih, ơi vôôiq dhaluônh palơq nôôq he.” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Piđó kung đóók Ba-na-ba nek “yaang Jơơt”, hơq Phaau-lô nek “yaang Heek-mê,” taai ađó nek manưih đương praaq. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Maan drươh xók ađek, takóh kadhâng bhanuôih ưng yaang Jơơt, nek đong bhanuôih dhiq laloom kanóón, xong xók đââng karók lơq gavương pô tơk palóng kariing, ađó ađek kiêng tapôông bhanuôih palơq dhanuôr. <verse eid="ACT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Bơơi xók xâng kơi ađek, nek nôôq sưưq-đô, chênh nek Ba-na-ba lơq Phaau-lô, xong xók ơi heek aau ađêi, piđó haluông pađâh leq ganơr manưih, lalơu karơ <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />lơq móón: “Nôôq pe ơơi, hau adhi anó têêng nôôq tarnêêng ađô? Nôôq yi kung nek nôôq manưih mađó chak araang kơi adhi anó, xók truuih Taruuih Liêm đóng adhi anó, đóng palâh adhi anó tââq nôôq rau kah malơơi ađô đóng palâh leq Yaang Pleng taluôn mamông, Yaang tavaaih pleng, katiêk lơq taxiiq, palơq dyóp rau kalóóng ađek, <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />nek Yaang hơq kalóóng nôôq klaang đơơi ơi lơh, ơi lơơi đóng tabhơt nôôq dhanuôr bhadyaang vôôiq ting kơi kalơng n'tua ưng ađêi, <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />bơơi dhơ kơi ađek, Ađó ơi kah lơơi đóng thiêuq pan-nal leq chênh Ađó, xók dyơq têêng phươk liêm đóng adhi anó, palơq tarnêêng đóng bó tââq pleng palơq nil xóót leh bóóng pale, têêng lóóm adhi anó kabhôôq dyóp palơq dhanah chana lơq rau bhuui.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Lơq xók ơi praaq nôôq rau ađô, nhiđó chapiên đuôh kajơq dhanuôr yươq tapôông bhanuôih đóng ađêi.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Kơi ađek bơơi, nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq ơi tơk tââq An-ti-ôôt lơq I-kô-ni, xong xók pei lóóm dhanuôr hayơq glơm dhơl Phaau-lô, piđó gahóór ađó pagluh leq nguôi kanóón, taai ngóq ađó ơi chêt. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Dhơ kơi ađek, xók nôôq môôn-đô dyương xirvir ađó, nek xong xók yuur dyương, ađó vôôiq mót leq kalóóng kanóón, hayơq tangêi rayiiu, ađó vôôiq mandrươh palơq Ba-na-ba tơk Đeet-bơ. <verse eid="ACT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Maan drươh, xók ơi truuih Taruuih Liêm dhiq kanóón ađek lơq têêng đóng bơk chanak huuiq, nhiđó val chô dhiq Liit-trơ, hayơq tơk I-kô-ni, lơq An-ti-ôôt, <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />bhiêk têêng đóng mưng lóóm nôôq môôn-đô, payuur lóóm piđó yươq tadhơ lóóm kalóóng lóóm huuiq, kơi ađô: “Ơi talum bơk rau hadhaap janah nek rau kiiq tââm đóng nôôq he đóng mót kalóóng katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Xók achêk, xong xók pajaau tarnêêng nôôq takóh bhươl đóng piđó dhiq dyóp Akóón Dhơn Chuôq, xók ơi gavơh nhan palơq tarnêêng điêng cha, bơơr nhiđó pajaau nôôq manưih achêk leq Chuôq, nek Yaang đu piđó ơi patơơt lóóm huuiq ađek. <verse eid="ACT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Lơq xong xók chaang gan Bi-si-đi, nhiđó vôôiq tơk leq Baam-phi-li. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Xók pachóóm taruuih dhiq Beet-jê xong, nhiđó vôôiq dhuônh tơk At-ta-li. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Tââq dham ađek, nhiđó vôôiq bhuông tơk leq An-ti-ôôt, nek dhiq nhiđó ơi bâân pajaau leq phươk liêm ưng Yaang Pleng đóng tarnêêng đu nhiđó ơi paxong. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Xók achêk, xók ơi tơk nek dhiq lơq krong nhoom Akóón Dhơn Chuôq lóóiq, nhiđó truuih n'nal n'đơq rau Yaang Pleng ơi têêng palơq nhiđó lơq kơi Ađó ơi lóng palóng lóóm huuiq đóng nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Tatun ađek, nhiđó tơơt lóóiq palơq nôôq môôn-đô mưi ganah yươq gađóq.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Hayơq, masôôq manưih tôôh vôôiq dhuônh tââq Ju-đê, pachóóm nôôq adhi anó kơi ađô: “La adhi anó kah đơơp iêt ng'kar ting gani takóh ưng Môôi-se, nek adhi anó kah chóóm bâân paq.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Kơi ađek nek, xong xók ơi vaaih rau kah makơi lóóm lơq tarkaai kah katưưiq bhlưa Phaau-lô lơq Ba-na-ba palơq nôôq manưih tôôh, hayơq nôôq adhi anó kayua Phaau-lô lơq Ba-na-ba palơq masôôq manưih lââng bhlưa kalóóng piđó đóng vôôiq đơk lum nôôq sưưq-đô lơq takóh bhươl dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem leq tarvei ađô. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Kơi ađek, nôôq manưih bâân akóón dhơn Chuôq kayua vôôiq chaang gan luch Phê-ni-xi lơq Sa-ma-ri, truuih đuui giit palâh lóóm huuiq ưng nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng, lơq piđó ơi đââng lóóiq rau bhuui gamak đóng tabhơt nôôq adhi anó. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Xók achêk, xók ơi tơk dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem, piđó bâân pơh kêch taai akóón dhơn Chuôq, nôôq sưưq-đô lơq nôôq takóh bhươl, lơq n'drươh piđó praaq pakah n'nal n'đơq rau đu Yaang Pleng ơi ting têêng palơq ađêi. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Bơơi nôôq manưih ơi huuiq achêk mađó kabhuh Pha-ri-si yuur dyương, praaq kơi ađô: “Kơng phaai têêng pheep iêt ng'kar đóng nôôq manưih achêk lơq truuih pachóóm piđó phaai jư gani Môôi-se.” <verse eid="ACT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Kơi ađek nek, nôôq sưưq-đô lơq nôôq takóh bhươl pahoop lóóiq đóng lêi pagiit leq tarnêêng ađô. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Xók achêk, xong xók bơk tarkaai val vaaih, Phi-e-rơ, yuur dyương, praaq palơq piđó: “Nhan nôôq pe, nhan adhi anó, adhi anó maar n'nal kơi tââq nôôq tangêi tââp m'pơng kalóóng adhi anó, Yaang Pleng ơi chââih nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng ting tââq bóóp aku đóng xâng truuih Taruuih Liêm lơq huuiq. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Yaang Pleng, Yaang n'nal kalóóng lóóm, ơi truuih đuui đóng piđó, xók đóng Chuôq Yaang Liêm leq piđó, kung kơi đóng leq nôôq he; <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />lơq Ađó kah pantua bhlưa nôôq he palơq piđó, xók têêng lóóm piđó bâân sek tabah taai lóóm huuiq. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Kơi ađek nek hau xók ađô adhi anó klêêu Yaang Pleng, xók pakuuk leq tuôr nôôq môôn-đô et đu nôôq avuôq nôôq he kah chóóm, lơq nôôq he kung kah ve đuôh đóng geng? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Palâh lóóiq, nôôq he huuiq đóng bâân tapaq taai phươk liêm ưng Chuôq Jê-su, hơq piđó kung ting mưi tarnêêng kơi ađek.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Xók achêk, luch kabhuh manưih jư parngau lơq xâng Ba-na-ba lơq Phaau-lô truuih đuui n'đơq rau kanal chrih lơq tarnêêng raman chrih đu Yaang Pleng ơi têêng m'pơng kalóóng nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng tââq piđó. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Kơi ađek hayơq, xong xók piđó praaq xong, Ja-kơ ââi praaq, kơi ađô: “Nhan móón nôôq pe, nhan móón adhi anó, nhan tameng xâng aku. <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Si-môôn ơi chaleq ng'kơi Yaang Pleng laloom tââm ơi ka-er lêi đóng pei pagluh tââq nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng mưi dhanuôr đóng achak Ađó. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Rau ađô kung pâng palơq nôôq paraaq ưng nôôq manưih đââng taruuih kơi ơi bâân xaraq:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />‘Tatun nôôq tarnêêng achêk, Aku e val lóóiq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">hayơq Aku e têêng lóóiq pơơq ưng Đa-viit, nek pơơq ơi bâân kalơm,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">Aku e têêng lóóiq nôôq rau bâân talâh kalơm ưng ađó lơq hayuur ađó,<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />nek đóng phơn đu dyơq ưng akóón manưih lalua ve chóóm chik chêk Chuôq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">patơk mơ tabhơt nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng, hơq dhiq nôôq dhanuôr achêk, achak Aku bâân nhan gavơh dhiq tââq piđó.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">Chuôq praaq kơi ađek, xók têêng nôôq tarnêêng ađô, <verse eid="ACT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />nek rau bâân n'nal tơk tââq klaang hanua hana.’<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Taai kơi ađek, aku lêi kơi óóq pagei panhok đóng nôôq manưih tââq nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng val lóóiq palơq Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />dhơ kơi ađek, phaai xaraq bha-aar pató pachóóm piđó viêr changaai rau nhơơp xrơơm ưng kabhêi, rau tapiing, dhanah adhah chêt phet lơq ahaam. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Ơi tââq nôôq klaang đơơi hanua hana, dhiq dyóp kanóón, gani Môôi-se dyơq buôn ve bơk nak truuih pachóóm gani achêk, ơi bâân đok kalóóng đong gươl leq dyóp tangêi Sa-baat.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Xong ađek, nôôq sưưq-đô lơq takóh bhươl, palơq luch akóón dhơn Chuôq, lêi phaai kayua nôôq manưih bâân chââih m'pơng kalóóng piđó vôôiq tơk An-ti-ôôt mandrươh palơq Phaau-lô lơq Ba-na-ba — dhơơm Ju-đa bâân đóók nek Ba-sa-ba, lơq Si-la, chênh nek nôôq manưih kadhâng koq kalóóng nôôq adhi anó — <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />xók xaraq bha-aar vôôiq tââq têi piđó: “Nôôq sưưq-đô lơq nôôq takóh bhươl, nôôq adhi anó, pagơơi đóng nôôq manưih huuiq plok xưưq An-ti-ôôt, Si-ri lơq Si-li-si, chênh nek adhi anó, nôôq manưih gluh tââq nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng. Lóóm nh'nhơr chap yayar! <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Ơi xók ađô, nôôq yi ơi xâng kơi masôôq manưih chêk xók vôôiq gluh tââq m'pơng nôôq yi ơi panhok adhi anó palơq nôôq bóóp praaq têêng nhok nhói lóóm adhi anó, hơq nôôq manưih achêk nek nôôq yi kah rau kayua, <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />hayơq rau ve liêm tââm đóng nôôq yi nek xong xók krong mưi lóóm, pei chââih nôôq manưih, nek kayua piđó vôôiq tơk leq adhi anó palơq Ba-na-ba lơq Phaau-lô, bơơr adhi anó tanhơr ưng nôôq yi, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />nek bơơr nak ơi yươq châq chêt ađêi taai achak Chuôq nôôq he, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Taai ađek, nôôq yi ơi kayua Ju-đa lơq Si-la, nek nôôq manưih kung praaq pakah rau dhơơm ađô palơq bóóp praaq. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Ơi lalua kơi Chuôq Yaang Liêm lơq nôôq yi ơi lêi kah ve đóng kơơq hau rau bâân patơơt têêng haleng leq adhi anó chapiên nôôq rau đu kiiq tatun ađô: <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />phaai viêr changaai nôôq rau bhuôih leq kabhêi, ahaam, adhah chêt phet, lơq rau tapiing, adhi anó e têêng liêm, xók jư ađêi kala tââq nôôq rau achêk. Nhan đóng adhi anó bâân mưng karơ.”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Kơi ađek nek, xong xók bâân kayua vôôiq, nhiđó vôôiq dhuônh tơk leq An-ti-ôôt, lơq krong kabhuh manưih lóóiq xong, nhiđó pađơơp tala bha-aar đóng. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Xók achêk, xók đok bha-aar xong, nôôq manưih huuiq bâân bhuui marhaal toom rau payuur lóóm achêk. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Miq Ju-đa lơq Si-la, chênh nhiđó nek kung nôôq manưih đââng taruuih, ơi payuur lóóm nôôq adhi anó palơq mưi taruuih yaal lơq têêng piđó karơ lóóm. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Xók achêk, xong xók tơơt dhiq ađek mưi ganah, nhiđó bâân nôôq adhi anó đââng chalaang chô palơq nôôq manưih ơi kayua ađêi kơi yươq rau ha. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />[Bơơi Si-la lêi kơng tơơt lóóiq palơq piđó, hayơq Ju-đa ơi yuur vôôiq mưi ađêi.] <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Dyơq Phaau-lô lơq Ba-na-ba bhiêk tơơt dhiq An-ti-ôôt, pachóóm lơq truuih đuui paraaq Chuôq, palơq bơk manưih lââng.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Tatun ađek, xong masôôq tangêi kah tadhơ, Phaau-lô praaq palơq Ba-na-ba: “Lalua, nôôq he kơng tơk tham nôôq adhi anó, xók val lóóiq dhiq dyóp kanóón hơq tơơt dhiq ađek, nôôq he ơi truuih đuui paraaq Chuôq, lêi piđó xók ng'kơi.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Bơơi Ba-na-ba kung kiêng đââng Jang, bâân đóók nek Maak, ting vôôiq. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Dyơq Phaau-lô lêi kah đaang đóng đââng ađó achêk ting vôôiq, chênh nek ađó ơi yuur xooq tââq nhiđó dhiq Baam-phi-li lơq kah ting vôôiq palơq nhiđó kalóóng tarnêêng. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Xók achêk, mưi rau tarkaai gamak val vaaih, patơk mơ nhiđó bâân tablah xóng nhiđó, lơq n'drươh Ba-na-ba đââng Maak ting ađêi vôôiq bhuông tơk leq Chiip-rơ. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Dyơq Phaau-lô, xók ơi chââih Si-la, nek yuur vôôiq, xong xók bâân nôôq adhi anó pajaau leq phươk liêm ưng Chuôq. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Kơi ađek hayơq, ađó vôôiq plok xưưq Si-ri lơq Si-li-si, tamưng nôôq akóón dhơn Chuôq.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Xók achêk, Phaau-lô kung vôôiq dhuônh leq Đeet-bơ hayơq tơk Liit-trơ, lơq lêi tôôh, dhiq ađek ve mưi môôn-đô achêk achak Ti-mô-thê, akóón padruuih ưng mưi pađiil Jo Thaaiq huuiq, bơơi akonh nek manưih Hi-laap, <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />hơq ađó achêk bâân haanh liêm taai nôôq adhi anó dhiq Liit-trơ lơq I-kô-ni. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Phaau-lô kiêng ađó ađô ting vôôiq palơq ađêi, hayơq xong xók chââih ađó, Phaau-lô iêt ng'kar đóng ađó, taai malơơi ưng manưih Jo Thaaiq xók tơơt dhiq nôôq prah ađek, taai piđó maar n'nal kơi ama ưng ađó nek manưih Hi-laap. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Xók achêk, xók piđó vôôiq kalơng leq nôôq kanóón, piđó pachóóm lóóiq đóng nôôq manưih huuiq phaai jư nôôq pató pachóóm ơi bâân praaq xêi taai nôôq sưưq-đô lơq nôôq takóh bhươl dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Kơi ađek, nôôq akóón dhơn Chuôq bâân karơ kalóóng lóóm huuiq lơq dyóp tangêi maar dhương vaaih leq parbơk.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Xók achêk, piđó vôôiq chaang gan nôôq kanóón leq Phi-ri-gi lơq Ga-la-ti, taai ơi bâân Chuôq Yaang Liêm kah đóng truuih taruuih kalóóng kanóón A-si. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Tatun ađek, xók ơi tơk đan Mi-si-a, piđó tabhlơng vôôiq leq Bi-thi-ni, hơq Yaang Liêm ưng Chuôq Jê-su kung kah đóng pheep piđó. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Kơi ađek nek, lơơi jalơh Mi-si-a, piđó vôôiq dhuônh tơk Trô-et. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Mưi tapalêi vaaih palơq Phaau-lô kalóóng hayum: mưi manưih Ma-xê-đoan chêk xók dyương lơq dhaloong ađó, kơi ađô: “Xong xók chaang gan tơk Ma-xê-đoan, nhan phaai jóói nôôq yi.” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Kơi ađek nek, dhalam xók ađó ơi lêi tapalêi ađek, nôôq yi n'drươh tabâân kalơng vôôiq tơk Ma-xê-đoan, taai ting huuiq kơi Yaang Pleng ơi bâân dhaloong nôôq yi truuih pachóóm Taruuih Liêm đóng piđó.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Taai kơi ađek, xók ơi dhaluônh tââq bhuông tââq Trô-et, nôôq yi vôôiq tapat tơk Sa-mô-tra-xơ, hayơq tangêi rayiiu tơk Nê-a-bô-li, <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />tââq ađek, tơk Phi-liip, hơq đôk nek kanóón kiiq tââm kalóóng xưưq Ma-xê-đoan, mưi katiêk ưng La Ma, hayơq nôôq yi bhiêk tơơt dhiq kanóón ađô bơơr pe tangêi. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Maan drươh, leq tangêi Sa-baat, nôôq yi gluh hót nguôi palóng kanóón, hót tóór karuung, dham hơq nôôq yi karnóq nek dham gavơh nhan. Hayơq xong xók tơơt chok leq, nôôq yi praaq chiên palơq nôôq pađiil xók nhoom lóóiq dhiq ađek. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Mưi pađiil chêk achak Li-đi, nek manưih buôn baan bhaai bhrôông bhrơuq tââq kanóón Thi-a-ti-rơ, ơi ve lóóm bhi kakhin Yaang Pleng, xók đơơp tameng xâng, nek manưih hơq Chuôq ơi lóng lóóm đóng chamet lêi rau dhơơm xók bâân praaq taai Phaau-lô. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Xók achêk, dhalam xók pađiil ơi đơơp bap-teem palơq luch parlóng đong ađêi, pađiil mââl nôôq yi, kơi ađô: “La nôôq pe lêi aku nek mưi lóóm palơq Chuôq, nek nhan phaai tơơt lóóiq, mót leq kalóóng đong aku.” Pađiil chut pa-eep nôôq yi. <verse eid="ACT 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Tatun ađek, chiên val vaaih bhêêl nôôq yi xók vôôiq kalơng tơk dham gavơh nhan, mưi pađiil dhơn xól chêk xók bâân yaang Phi-tôôn bóq, lum nôôq yi, hơq pađiil ađek biêh xók têêng malơơi bơk bhlơng đóng kala ađêi palơq tarnêêng lêi padhơơch. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Xók vôôiq tapun hóng Phaau-lô lơq nôôq yi, pađiil ađek lalơu kơi ađô: “Nôôq manưih ađô nek nôôq dhơn ratơơq ưng Yaang Pleng Bhơt Yaal, hơq piđó xók truuih đuui đóng nôôq pe kalơng paq jóói.” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Xók ađek, pađiil ađek têêng kơi ađek kalóóng bơk tangêi. Bơơi ơi bâân panhok bhlơng, hayơq xók palâh lóóiq palơq yaang ađek, Phaau-lô praaq: “Kalóóng achak Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, aku kayua đóng amei vôôiq gluh tââq pađiil ađô.” Hayơq ađó gluh n'drươh bhêêl ađek.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Bơơi xók nôôq manưih kala ưng ađó ađek lêi kơi ganah tabâân jêên ưng ađêi ơi bil, nek xong xók pei kóóp Phaau-lô lơq Si-la, piđó gruiq bơơr nhiđó tơk dham buôn baan dhiq dham nôôq takóh kadhâng koq. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Bhêêl đââng bơơr nhiđó tơk toom nôôq kuôn gamak xong, piđó praaq: “Nôôq manưih ađô xók panhôôn nhaauq kanóón nôôq he, taai nek dhanuôr Jo Thaaiq, <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />hayơq piđó xók truuih pachóóm nôôq pheep takóh hơq kah ve pheep đóng nôôq he pei đơơp môôiq têêng, ơi nek dhanuôr La Ma.” <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Hayơq ganơr manưih maar yuur pơh jơl lóóiq bơơr nhiđó, hayơq xong xók đóng heek aau nhiđó xong, nôôq kuôn gamak praaq kayua vuôt nhiđó palơq parvuôt. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Maan drươh, xók ơi m'bhiiq vuôt bơơr nhiđó bơk aq, kabhuh ađek tamót bơơr nhiđó leq đong kanam, kayua leq kuôn jư đong kanam đương lêi nhiđó kơi chagơn, <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />hơq manưih kuôn achêk, xók ơi đơơp xâng kayua kơi ađek, ơi król nhiđó leq đong kanam kalóóng, lơq xiêng dyung nhiđó palơq kanum. <verse eid="ACT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Dhơ kơi ađek, mơ m'pơng hayum, xók bhêêl gavơh nhan, Phaau-lô lơq Si-la babóóch hat haanh Yaang Pleng, dyơq nôôq manưih takról lââng nek tameng xâng nhiđó. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Xók achêk, mưi ganơt dha-ơr katiêk gamak parmat val vaaih, patơk mơ nôôq bhanơn đong kanam bâân dha-ơr veq, hayơq tabhơt palóng n'drươh bâân talóng, lơq tarlêi xiêng dyóp ngaai talêh bhơt. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Hayơq nek bhêêl manưih jư đong kanam bâân ra-eh, lêi nôôq palóng đong kanam ơi bâân talóng, hayơq thuôt bhươt ađêi gluh, ađó ađek kiêng leng ađêi taai ngóq nôôq manưih takról ơi gluh xooq. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Bơơi Phaau-lô lalơu dhariêng karơ, kơi ađô: “Óóq têêng mahaai amei kala, taai tabhơt nôôq yi dyơq bhơt dhiq ađô.” <verse eid="ACT 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Kơi ađek nek, xong xók kayua pei dhơu, ađó ađek mut dhơq leq kalóóng, lơq taai bâân hayer papreh, ađó chakoh leq katiêk toom Phaau-lô lơq Si-la, <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />hayơq xong xók đââng piđó gluh leq nguôi, ađó praaq: “Nhan bơơr nhưa, hau rau dhiq aku lalua phaai têêng, đóng aku ve chóóm bâân paq?” <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Kơi ađek nek, nhiđó praaq: “Phaai huuiq dhiq Chuôq Jê-su, nek amei e bâân paq — amei lơq parlóng đong ưng amei.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Hayơq nhi bơơr pachóóm paraaq Chuôq đóng ađó palơq tabhơt nôôq manưih kalóóng đong ađó. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Lơq leq jơ ađek kalóóng hayum, xong xók đââng nhiđó vôôiq ting ađêi, ađó raau pasek đóng nhiđó dham nôôq bhrê, hayơq ađó n'drươh đơơp bap-teem — ađó palơq dyóp nak đong ađêi. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Maan drươh, bhêêl ơi đââng nhiđó leq đong ađêi, ađó dhoon baang cha gluh toom nhiđó lơq tabhlơng bhuui marhaal palơq nôôq manưih kalóóng đong, taai ơi đơơp huuiq Yaang Pleng.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Xók achêk, tơk brương, nôôq kuôn kayua nôôq linh đương jư vôôiq, móón kơi ađô: “Phaai paloh nôôq manưih ađek vôôiq.” <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Kơi ađek nek, kuôn jư đong kanam truuih lóóiq nôôq paraaq achêk đóng Phaau-lô, kơi ađô: “Nôôq kuôn ơi kayua manưih truuih kơi bơơr nhưa bâân paloh. Kơi ađek xók ađô, xong xók vôôiq gluh, nhan bơơr nhưa yuur vôôiq yươq rau ha.” <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Bơơi Phaau-lô praaq palơq piđó: “Xong xók pakah m'bhiiq vei nôôq yi, nek nôôq manưih kadhâng kataai dhanuôr La Ma, hơq kah xêi xanêi, piđó ơi m'peq nôôq yi leq đong kanam, hayơq xók ađô piđó tông paloh nôôq yi gluh ha? Lalua kah chóóm! Klóóih kơi ađek, chênh piđó, xong xók tơk ađô, phaai đââng nôôq yi gluh.” <verse eid="ACT 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Kơi ađek nek, nôôq linh jư truuih lóóiq nôôq paraaq ađek đóng kabhuh kuôn gamak, hayơq nôôq piđó kakhin kapơn xók xâng kơi bơơr nhiđó nek dhanuôr La Ma. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Bhêêl vôôiq tơk aq, nôôq kuôn mââl nhiđó lơq xong xók đââng gluh leq nguôi, nôôq kuôn nhan nhiđó xooq changaai tââq kanóón ađêi. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Kơi ađek nek, xók ơi gluh tââq đong kanam, bơơr nhiđó mót leq kalóóng đong ưng Li-đi. Lơq xong xók lum nôôq adhi anó, bơơr nhiđó payuur lóóm piđó, hayơq yuur vôôiq.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Xók achêk, xong xók vôôiq pagan Am-phi-bô-liit lơq A-bô-lô-ni, piđó vôôiq tơk Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka, dhiq ve mưi đong gươl ưng manưih Jo Thaaiq. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Hayơq ting kơi kaxu ưng Phaau-lô, ađó mót nhoom palơq piđó, lơq kalóóng pe tangêi Sa-baat, ađó kluôh lók palơq piđó ting tââq Bha-aar Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />xók klôôq lók dyóp lơq paraaq pakah kơi Chuôq Paq Manưih kơng phaai đơơp ka-ai janah lơq mamông lóóiq tââq kan chêt kơi ađô: “Chuôq Jê-su ađô, Yaang hơq aku truuih pakah đóng adhi anó, chênh nek Chuôq Paq Manưih.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Masôôq manưih kalóóng m'pơng piđó bâân huuiq ting lơq chô maleq ting Phaau-lô palơq Si-la, dhơơm luch masôôq bơk manưih Hi-laap bhuôih kakhin Yaang Pleng, lơq kah m'bưưiq nôôq pađiil ve tarnêêng gamak. <verse eid="ACT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Dhơ kơi ađek, taai nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq vaaih lóóm makhinh, hayơq xók ơi têêng payuur nôôq manưih đu aak chêk dhiq kalơng kanóón, karong mưi ganơr manưih bơk, piđó têêng nhôôn nhaauq kanóón ađô. Xong xók haluông leq đong Ja-sôôn, piđó chêk tabâân bơơr nhiđó đóng đââng pagluh toom dhanuôr. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Bơơi xók kah bâân lêi bơơr nhiđó, piđó galôôi Ja-sôôn palơq nôôq adhi anó tôôh gluh toom nôôq kuôn dhiq kanóón, yuur lalơu kơi ađô: “Nôôq manưih têêng tapalâh katiêk ađô, piđó kung xók ve mat dhiq ađô, <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />nek nôôq manưih hơq Ja-sôôn lơq tabhơt kabhuh ađô ơi kêch yaauq. Piđó xók têêng jơl lóóiq nôôq praaq kayua ưng Xê-xa, xók móón ve mưi bhua lââng, nek Jê-su.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Kơi ađek nek, nôôq piđó têêng đóng ganơr manưih bơk lơq nôôq kuôn dhiq kanóón nhôôn nhaauq xók xâng nôôq paraaq achêk. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Hayơq xong xók đơơp jêên paklóóih tââq Ja-sôôn lơq nôôq manưih đu dyơq, nôôq kuôn ploh đóng piđó vôôiq.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Bơơi hayơq, n'drươh leq hayum, nôôq adhi anó đââng miq Phaau-lô lơq Si-la vôôiq tơk Bê-rê, hơq bơơr nak ađô, xók tơk leq ađek, nek vôôiq leq đong gươl ưng manưih Jo Thaaiq. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Xók achêk, nôôq manưih dhiq ađô nek bhuui marhaal lơh nôôq manưih dhiq Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka, piđó ơi pei đơơp taruuih palơq tabhơt lóóm lalua, xók dyóp tangêi chamet lêi Bha-aar Yaang Pleng, lêi nôôq rau achêk ve pâng kơi ađek môôiq kah. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Hayơq, bơk manưih kalóóng sôôq piđó ơi huuiq, patơk masôôq pađiil Hi-laap leq kabhuh kavaan lơq kah m'bưưiq padruuih. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Bơơi xók manưih Jo Thaaiq dhiq Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka bâân n'nal kơi paraaq ưng Yaang Pleng kung xók bâân truuih đuui taai Phaau-lô dhiq Bê-rê, nek piđó kung tơk dhiq ađô, paxuq lóóm lơq panhôôn dhanuôr. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Kơi ađek nek, leq bhêêl achêk, nôôq adhi anó n'drươh đââng Phaau-lô vôôiq gluh tơk leq taxiiq, bơơi xók bơơr nhiđó Si-la lơq Ti-mô-thê nek dyơq tơơt dhiq ađek. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Dyơq nôôq manưih kađââng kalơng Phaau-lô ơi đââng ađó tơk luch A-thêên hayơq xong xók đơơp chaleq pagơơi đóng Si-la lơq Ti-mô-thê kơi bơơr nhiđó phaai tơk palơq ađó ve đâh ve kre, nek piđó palâh val lóóiq.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Xók achêk dhiq A-thêên, bơơi xók Phaau-lô đương rââm nhiđó, lóóm karnóq ađó bâân kabhróónh tââq hót kalóóng ađêi, xók lêi kanóón ađô ve bing bhlaai kabhêi. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Kơi ađek nek ađó tarkaai kalóóng đong gươl nek palơq manưih Jo Thaaiq lơq nôôq manưih bhuôih haanh Yaang Pleng, palơq nôôq manưih ve bâân talum leq dyóp tangêi dhiq dham buôn baan. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Bơơi masôôq manưih mađó kabhuh nôôq manưih hok yaal kabhuh Bhuui Sương lơq kabhuh Gơt Lóóm Malóóch kung tarkaai palơq ađó. Masôôq móón: “Dhươm praaq bơk ađô kiêng praaq hau rau?” Dyơq sôôq lââng nek praaq: “Nh'jau ađó ađek nek manưih truuih pachóóm leq nôôq yaang dhanuôr lââng,” taai ađó xók truuih đuui Taruuih liêm leq Chuôq Jê-su lơq mamông lóóiq. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Maan drươh, xong xók jư ađó lóóiq, piđó đââng tơk Kabhuh takóh A-rê-ô-ba, móón kơi ađô: “Nôôq yi ve chóóm n'nal rau tame ađô, paraaq pachóóm xók bâân amei pachóóm, nek hau kah? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Ơi amei đââng tơk nôôq chiên chrih katór nôôq yi. Kơi ađek hayơq nôôq yi kiêng n'nal nôôq rau achêk ve kiêng móón nek hau.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />(Xók achêk, tabhơt manưih A-thêên lơq nôôq dhanuôr tââq lââng mamông dhiq ađek maar kah pei lóóm malóóch leq hau rau lââng lơh nek truuih chiên môôiq xâng chiên tame chrih.)<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Kơi ađek hayơq, xók bâân dyương dhiq m'pơng Kabhuh takóh A-rê-ô-ba, Phaau-lô pei praaq:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:22">“Nhan móón nôôq pe nek manưih A-thêên, aku lêi nôôq pe bhlơng huuiq karơ ting dyóp kơi n'nal n'đơq. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Ơi xók vôôiq blôônh lơq đóng chamet lêi nôôq kabhêi bhuôih haanh ưng nôôq pe, aku patơk mơ lêi mưi baang bhanuôih hơq piing ađek bâân chan chư: ‘Bhuôih Yaang Kah N'nal.’ Kơi ađek, yaang hơq nôôq pe bhuôih xók kah n'nal, achêk nek Yaang aku xók truuih đuui đóng nôôq pe. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Yaang Pleng, Yaang ơi tavaaih pale katiêk lơq dyóp rau kalóóng ađek, nek Chuôq ưng pleng lơq katiêk, Ađó kah mamông kalóóng nôôq đong bhanuôih taai têi akóón manưih têêng. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Ađó kung kah chóóm têêng yaauq taai tapaang têi akóón manưih kơi ngóq Ađó kơng marau marâ, taai chênh Ađó đóng leq dyóp n'dreh m'ma parmông, parhââm palơq dyóp rau lââng. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Maan drươh, tââq mưi nak, Ađó ơi tavaaih dyóp dhanuôr akóón manưih mamông dhiq plok hóng katiêk, xong xók chaleq nôôq nil kah tadhơ lơq kalơng bhlưa xưưq xaang mamông ưng piđó, <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />đóng chik chêk Yaang Pleng, đóng hayơq n'nal kơi ve kơq nek piđó ve chóóm chêk ravơq bâân Ađó hayơq bâân lêi Ađó, dhơ Ađó lalua kah tơơt dhiq changaai palơq dyóp mưi nak kalóóng nôôq he. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Ơi kalóóng Ađó, nôôq he mamông, veq vôôiq lơq chaq ching, kung kơi masôôq manưih kalóóng nôôq manưih têêng thơ nôôq pe ơi praaq, kơi ađô: ‘Taai nôôq he kung nek akóón anaaq ưng Ađó.’ <verse eid="ACT 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Kơi ađek, taai nek akóón anaaq ưng Yaang Pleng, nôôq he kah chóóm karnóq kơi Yaang Bhi Chap nek thê kơi nôôq kabhêi palơq vaang, môôiq baak, môôiq dhơl taai têi ragêi lơq koq karnóq ưng akóón manưih. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Taai kơi ađek, xók Yaang Pleng ơi lơơi lơt klaang đơơi kah n'nal rau ađek, xók ađô Ađó praaq đóng akóón manưih, dyóp nak plok dyóp dhiq, phaai klôôq lóóm, <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />taai Ađó ơi têêng mưi tangêi, hơq leq tangêi ađek Ađó e xêi xanêi klaang katiêk kalóóng rau bhơt liêm ơi Manưih hơq Ađó ơi chaleq, xók pakah praaq truuih lalua đóng dyóp nak palơq têêng Manưih achêk mamông lóóiq tââq kan chêt.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Xók achêk, xók xâng leq đu mamông lóóiq ưng manưih chêt, masôôq pacheh ađó; bơơi sôôq lââng nek móón: “Nôôq yi kung e xâng amei leq tarnêêng ađô machu dyơq.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Taai kơi ađek, Phaau-lô xooq tââq m'pơng bhlưa piđó. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Bơơi nôôq manưih chêk ơi krong maleq ting ađó nek huuiq, kalóóng sôôq ađek patơk ve Đi-ô-ni-xi-uut, manưih kalóóng kabhuh takóh A-rê-ô-ba, mưi pađiil achak Đa-ma-ri, lơq nôôq manưih lââng palơq piđó.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Tatun nôôq tarnêêng achêk, xók yuur vôôiq tââq A-thêên, ađó vôôiq tơk Kô-rin-tô. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Hayơq xók bâân n'nal mưi manưih Jo Thaaiq chêk, achak A-kui-la, kanóón dhiq xưưq Bông, tame tơk tââq I-ta-li palơq Bê-rit-siin, kađiêl ađêi, taai Kơ-lôôt ơi praaq kayua đóng tabhơt manưih Jo Thaaiq phaai xooq tââq Rô-ma, nek ađó pađan leq nhiđó, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />hơq taai ve marau tarnêêng buôn têêng, ađó ơi tơơt lơq têêng tarnêêng palơq nhiđó, taai piđó maar nek nôôq thơơq bhaai ng'kar beeq pơơq ting kơi tarnêêng buôn têêng. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Xók achêk, bhiêk dyóp tangêi Sa-baat, ađó pakah lók kalóóng đong gươl, ađó đóng lêi pâng tââq manưih Jo Thaaiq tơk manưih Hi-laap. <verse eid="ACT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Bơơi xók miq Si-la lơq Ti-mô-thê ơi vôôiq dhuônh tââq Ma-xê-đoan, nek Phaau-lô bâân bhơt lóóm karnóq leq taruuih, bhơt kanóq liêm truuih đuui đóng manưih Jo Thaaiq leq Chuôq Jê-su nek Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Dhơ kơi ađek, xók piđó tajơl lơq praaq tamôôp ađó, nek tatun ađek kabhrung aau, ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Nhan ahaam nôôq pe n'toh dhiq akoq nôôq pe! Dyơq aku yươq matu! Nô tââq xók ađôk, aku e tơk palơq nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng.” <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Xók ơi yuur xooq tââq ađek, ađó vôôiq tơk đong mưi manưih bhuôih haanh Yaang Pleng chêk, achak Ti-ti-u Juut-tu, hơq đong ađó ađô tơơt hót tóór đong gươl. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Dhơ kơi ađek, Cơ-riit-bu, manưih jư lêi đong gươl, ơi huuiq Chuôq, palơq dyóp nak kalóóng đong ađêi, lơq bơk manưih Kô-rin-tô, xong xók xâng taruuih, nek huuiq lơq đơơp bap-teem. <verse eid="ACT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Xók achêk, Chuôq praaq palơq Phaau-lô tââq mưi tapalêi kalóóng hayum: “Óóq kakhin, palâh lóóiq, phaai bhiêk praaq, lơq óóq phaai parngau. <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Tââq Aku tơơt palơq akóón lơq yươq ngaai e tapâng têi dhiq akóón đóng janah chanaaq akóón, taai ve bơk ngaai koom đóng Aku kalóóng kanóón ađô.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Kơi ađek nek, ađó tơơt lóóiq mưi kamó chapat kaxe, pachóóm paraaq ưng Yaang Pleng dhiq m'pơng piđó.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Bơơi xók Ga-li-ôôn têêng kuôn kadhâng koq xưưq A-chaai, nek manưih Jo Thaaiq krong nhoom xóng ađêi yuur dyương jơl lóóiq Phaau-lô lơq đââng ađó leq đong xêi xanêi, <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />móón kơi ađô: “Manưih ađô tamóói manưih dhanuôr bhuôih haanh Yaang Pleng lơt gani.” <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Bơơi xók Phaau-lô kanóq pơơh bóóp, Ga-li-ôôn ơi praaq palơq manưih Jo Thaaiq: “Ơ alua, nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq tôôh, la ađôk lalua nek rau tarnêêng lơt gani môôiq tarnêêng matu lơt môôp aak, nek ting kơi rau ađek, lalua kơi aku ơi jruôn palơq nôôq pe, <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />dyơq la ađôk nek nôôq tarkaai leq bóóp paraaq, dhanóók kanal lơq gani takóh n'tua ưng nôôq pe, nek nôôq pe tư ađêi haliq lêi. Aku kah kiêng têêng kuôn xêi xanêi đóng nôôq rau tarnêêng kơi ađôk.” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Hayơq ađó đuôi piđó gluh tââq đong xêi xanêi. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Dhơ kơi ađek, xong xók kóóp Sôôt-theen, manưih jư lêi đong gươl, tabhơt kabhuh piđó m'bhiiq vei ađó toom dhiq đong xêi xanêi, hơq kah rau tarnêêng kalóóng nôôq ađek nek đaang karnóq tơk ting kơi palơq Ga-li-ôôn.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Dyơq Phaau-lô, đóng tơk xók ađôk bhiêk dyơq tơơt bơk tangêi, hayơq tablah tââq adhi anó, ađó vôôiq bhuông tơk Si-ri, kung palơq ađó nek Bê-rit-siin lơq A-kui-la, xong xók ơi tư goot koq ađêi dhiq Seen-kơ-rê, taai ađó ơi ve paraaq ng'kóh. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Xók achêk, piđó vôôiq chok leq tơk Ê-phê-sô, lơq ađó lơơi nhibơơr tơơt lóóiq dhiq ađek, dyơq chênh ađêi, xók ơi vôôiq mót leq kalóóng đong gươl, ađó tar-ââi palơq manưih Jo Thaaiq. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Bơơi xók palââng kayua ađó raan tơơt lóóiq mưi ganah dyơq, nek ađó kah đơơp. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Dhơ kơi ađek, xong xók tablah tââq piđó lơq praaq: “Aku e val lóóiq palơq adhi anó machu dyơq la Yaang Pleng kiêng,” nek ađó dhaluônh leq bhuông tââi tââq Ê-phê-sô.<verse eid="ACT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Lơq xók ơi dyók leq tóór dhiq Sê-sa-rê, hayơq vôôiq đơk lơq tamóh tham akóón dhơn chuôq, nek ađó vôôiq chok leq tơk An-ti-ôôt. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Xong xók ơi tơơt mưi ganah đươnh, ađó yuur vôôiq, matââq tââq vôôiq tơk nôôq kanóón Ga-la-ti lơq Phi-ri-gi, têêng đóng tabhơt nôôq môôn-đô karơ lóóm.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Xók achêk, mưi manưih Jo Thaaiq achêk, achak A-bô-lô, n'niên mamông dhiq A-lek-xan-đơ-ri-a, mưi chanak ve bóóp paraaq tar-ââi, ơi vôôiq chok leq tơk Ê-phê-sô, xók nek mưi chanak n'nal giit leq Bha-aar Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Ađó biêh ơi bâân pachóóm pató leq taruuih Chuôq, lơq taai lóóm kanóq bhơt lóóm, ađó truuih lơq pachóóm dhalam nôôq rau pâng kre tơk Chuôq Jê-su, xók chapiên n'nal pheep bap-teem ưng Jang hơq giêl. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Palơq, ađó tââp tanââp paraaq kơi lóóm nhóól kalóóng đong gươl, bơơi xong xók xâng ađó, Bê-rit-siin lơq A-kui-la ơi đââng ađó chô lơq lók kluôh đóng ađó mưi kơi dhalam lơh leq taruuih ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Xók achêk, taai ađó rââm kiêng tabhươh tơk A-chaai, hayơq xong xók payuur lóóm ađó, nôôq adhi anó xaraq bha-aar pagơơi pató nôôq môôn-đô đóng pơh yaauq ađó, hơq xong xók tơk leq ađek, ađó ơi jóói poor bơk bhlơng đóng nôôq ngaai ơi huuiq ganơơm phươk liêm. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Taai ađó pakah jơl manưih Jo Thaaiq mưi kơi karơ, xók tađuui tââq Bha-aar Yaang Pleng chaleq tơk Chuôq Jê-su nek Chuôq Paq Manưih.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Xók achêk, chiên val vaaih xók bhêêl A-bô-lô tơơt dhiq Kô-rin-tô, nek Phaau-lô, xong xók vôôiq gan nôôq kanóón dhiq hót piing, ađó vôôiq dhuônh tơk Ê-phê-sô lơq lum masôôq môôn-đô tôôh. <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />Mandrươh, ađó praaq palơq piđó: “Xók ơi huuiq, adhi anó ve pei đơơp Chuôq Yaang Liêm môôiq kah?” Bơơi piđó ââi lóóiq ađó: “Kah, patơk mơ la ve Chuôq Yaang Liêm, nek nôôq yi kung kah glêh xâng tơk.” <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Ađó kung praaq: “Kơi ađek nek, adhi anó ơi đơơp pheep bap-teem n'đó?” Hayơq piđó ââi: “Pheep bap-teem ưng Jang.” <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Kơi ađek nek, Phaau-lô praaq: “Jang têêng pheep bap-teem leq rau klôôq lóóm, xók pachóóm đóng manưih dhanuôr leq Yaang xók bhral tatun ađó, buôn đóng piđó ve chóóm huuiq, achêk nek huuiq dhiq Chuôq Jê-su.” <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Lơq hayơq, xong xók xâng kơi ađek, piđó đơơp pheep bap-teem kalóóng dhanóók Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Xók Phaau-lô lơơi têi dhiq piđó, nek Chuôq Yaang Liêm tơk dhiq piđó, n'drươh ađek piđó praaq nôôq rau dhariêng lââng palơq praaq đââng taruuih. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Xók achêk, piđó ve tabhơt mơ majêt bơơr chanak padruuih.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Xók achêk, xong xók vôôiq mót kalóóng đong gươl, ađó bhiêk nhóól truuih pachóóm kalóóng pe kaxe, kluôh lók lơq pei lóóm chô leq katiêk ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Bơơi xók masôôq manưih bhiêk nhâng lóóm lơq kah kiêng huuiq, praaq tamôôp Taruuih toom ganơr manưih, nek ađó ơi pantua nôôq môôn-đô, viêr changaai tââq piđó, dyóp tangêi praaq tamóh xóng ađêi dhiq đong pahok Ti-ra-nu. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />N'drươh ađek, tarnêêng ađô ơi yuur vaaih kalóóng bơơr kamó, patơk mơ tabhơt nôôq ngaai mamông dhiq A-si maar bâân xâng paraaq Chuôq, miq manưih Jo Thaaiq palơq manưih Hi-laap. <verse eid="ACT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Yaang Pleng kung têêng nôôq mataai chrih lââng buôn tââq têi ưng Phaau-lô, <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />tơk mơ pamơ bhaai dyuut mat môôiq bhaai chaguôk xuui leq ng'kar ađó bâân đââng tơk đóng nôôq ngaai mabinh nek ka-ai karuôq xooq tââq piđó, yaang môôp kung phaai gluh. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Achêk xók, nôôq thêi viêng abhưi manưih Jo Thaaiq vôôiq leq đi leq tôôh kung raan gavơh nhan dhanóók Chuôq Jê-su dhiq nôôq manưih bâân yaang abhưi bóq, kơi ađô: “Aku yua đóng amei tââq dhanóók Jê-su hơq Phaau-lô truuih pachóóm.” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />(Bhêêl achêk, ve tapól akóón padruuih ưng abhươp Sê-va tôôh, mưi takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm manưih Jo Thaaiq, xók têêng tarnêêng ađô.) <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Bơơi ââi lóóiq, yaang môôp praaq palơq piđó, kơi ađô: “Aku n'nal Jê-su, aku kung n'nal Phaau-lô, bơơi nôôq pe nek ngaai?” <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Hayơq manưih hơq yaang môôp xók mót bóq, xong xók chruum leq piđó nek kóóp jư luch piđó, ađó karơ jơl lóóiq piđó, patơk mơ tanteek taheek lalôh lalut lơq bâân bhrê, phaai mut klôôn lơh tââq đong ađek. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Achêk xók, tarnêêng ađô val kơi truuih chiên buôn xâng đóng tabhơt nôôq ngaai mamông dhiq Ê-phê-sô, miq manưih Jo Thaaiq palơq manưih Hi-laap. Rau kakhin kapơn n'toh dhiq tabhơt piđó, lơq dhanóók Chuôq Jê-su bâân bhi chap. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Bơk ngaai kalóóng sôôq nôôq manưih ơi huuiq kung tơk, pakah matu lơt lơq truuih đuui nôôq tarnêêng ưng ađêi. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />N'drươh ađek, bơk manưih têêng tarnêêng abhô abhưi, xong xók gaboq bha-aar bhatơ ưng ađêi lóóiq, ơi óch toom mat dyóp ngaai. Palââng yaap janaaq kiiq ưng nôôq ađek, lơq piđó bâân lêi nek xââng bhaan đông baak. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Kơi ađek hayơq, tââq mataai karơ, paraaq Chuôq tanđôôr bhươh lơh lơq karơ gamak.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Xók achêk, dhalam xók nôôq tarnêêng ađô bâân paxong, Phaau-lô mưng karnóq kalóóng Yaang Liêm, chaang gan tơk Ma-xê-đoan lơq A-chaai, đóng vôôiq leq Jê-ru-sa-leem, xók praaq kơi ađô: “Xong xók aku ơi tơk dhiq ađek, nek aku kung kơng phaai vôôiq tham Rô-ma dyơq.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Kơi ađek hayơq, xong xók kayua vôôiq bơơr kalóóng sôôq nôôq manưih jóói poor ađêi, nek Ti-mô-thê lơq Ê-raat, tơk Ma-xê-đoan, nek chênh ađó ơi tơơt dhiq A-si dyơq mưi ganah.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Bơơi tơk xók ganah ađek, mưi ganơt nhôôn nhaauq kah katưưiq ơi yuur vaaih pâng tơk Taruuih. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Taai mưi nak manưih tôk baak achêk, achak Đê-mê-triiu, buôn têêng kabhêi yaang pađiil At-tê-miit palơq baak, ơi đââng lóóiq kah m'bưưiq jêên baak buôn baan đóng kabhuh manưih kóóch chan, <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />hơq ađó ađek, xong xók krong nôôq manưih thơơq kalóóng tarnêêng ađô lóóiq, ơi móón: “Nhan móón nôôq pe, adhi anó n'nal kơi rau karvaan kabhôôq ưng nôôq he nek gluh tââq tarnêêng buôn baan ađô. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Adhi anó kung lêi lơq xâng kơi kah mơ dhiq Ê-phê-sô, bơơi ngóq kơi plok dhiq A-si, ađó Phaau-lô ađô, xong xók pei lóóm, ơi têêng masôôq bơk manưih dhanuôr palâh lóóm, taai móón kơi nôôq rau ơi têêng tââq têi palââng eh rau nek yaang marau marâ. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Bơơi ađek, chiên ađô eh meen nek rau pakhin đââng tơk dhariêng môôp ting kơi palơq tarnêêng ưng nôôq he, hơq patơk mơ ting kơi palơq đong bhanuôih yaang pađiil At-tê-miit karơ gamak xók kah bâân lêi rauriq. N'drươh ađek, rau cha-iil tabah ưng yaang pađiil hơq plok A-si, tơk luch pale katiêk bhuôih haanh, bơơi lalua ravang bil tich.” <verse eid="ACT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Bhêêl achêk, xong xók xâng kơi ađek nek vaaih kơi bablôh yuur pagrâ, piđó lalơu kơi ađô: “Karơ gamak alua yaang pađiil At-tê-miit ưng manưih Ê-phê-sô!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Hayơq paluch kanóón bâân bing rau nhôôn nhaauq achêk, lơq manưih dhanuôr tapajươk xóng ađêi vôôiq tơk đong babóóch chachơp, kóóp miq Gaai-uut lơq A-ri-taak, manưih Ma-xê-đoan, nek nôôq parjơơk ting vôôiq ưng Phaau-lô. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Bơơi xók Phaau-lô kiêng pakah mat dhiq m'pơng dhanuôr manưih, nek nôôq môôn-đô kah lơơi đóng ađó têêng kơi ađek. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Dyơq masôôq nôôq kuôn A-si, nek nôôq parjơơk ưng ađó, palơq kơi praaq truuih tơk ađó, kung ơi pató pachóóm ađó óóq tư pajaau ađêi leq đong babóóch chachơp achêk. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Kơi ađek hayơq, manưih ađô manưih tôôh bhiêk yuur lalơu dyóp kơi n'tua rau, taai paluch ganơr manưih nek xók nhôôn nhaauq, lơq bơk ngaai kah n'nal ađêi krong gaboq lóóiq taai hau rauriq. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Xók achêk, m'bưưiq manưih tââq kabhuh ganơr manưih praaq kluôh rau vaaih đóng A-lek-xan-đơ, xong xók manưih Jo Thaaiq dhalươq ađó dyók hót laloom, hayơq A-lek-xan-đơ, kavah têi pahêq, xók kiêng praaq pakah palơq manưih dhanuôr. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Bơơi xók bâân n'nal kơi ađó ađô nek manưih Jo Thaaiq, nek mưi dhariêng lalơu karơ tââq tabhơt kabhuh piđó ơi yuur vaaih tơk bhluuch bơơr jơ: “karơ gamak alua yaang pađiil At-tê-miit ưng manưih Ê-phê-sô.” <verse eid="ACT 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Dhơ kơi ađek, xók kuôn xaraq bha-aar ơi têêng ganơr manưih parngau lóóiq, ađó pei praaq: “Nhan móón nôôq pe, nôôq manưih dhanuôr Ê-phê-sô, alua ve ngaai đu hơq kah n'nal kơi kanóón Ê-phê-sô nek manưih jư đong ưng yaang pađiil At-tê-miit karơ gamak lơq kabhêi tââq pleng n'tôq? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Kơi ađek nek, taai nôôq chiên ađô nek kah chóóm kah đươi, hayơq rau kơng tââm đóng nôôq pe nek phaai jư gơt ađêi lơq óóq têêng rauriq tahươk tahơn. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Tââq nôôq pe ơi đââng nôôq manưih ađô tơk, hơq piđó eh rau nek manưih tatông kalóóng đong bhanuôih, kung eh rau nek manưih praaq tamôôp yaang pađiil ưng nôôq he. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Đóng hayơq, la Đê-mê-triiu lơq kabhuh thơơq kóóch chan palơq ađó achêk ve paraaq kaauq ngaai, nek nôôq dham xêi xanêi dyơq xók bâân lóng palóng, lơq kung ve nôôq kuôn kadhâng koq kanóón; phaai lơơi piđó takaauq xóng piđó. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Dyơq la nôôq pe xók kiêng nhan hau rau leq nôôq tarnêêng lââng, nek ađó e bâân praaq xêi kalóóng parhoop ting kơi ơi xêi. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Ơi lalua, nôôq he ve bhêêl bâân patu têêng nhôôn nhaauq tapâng tơk tarnêêng tangêi mađôk, xók kah ve hau taai rauriq, hơq tââq rau ađek, nôôq he e kah rau chóóm yuur pakah paraaq kluôh xêi đóng rau kaboq krong bil charnap liêm ađô.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Xong xók praaq kơi ađek, ađó đóng chô ganơr manưih krong gaboq achêk.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Xók achêk, xók talum nhôôn nhaauq ơi pat, Phaau-lô đóng kayua nôôq môôn-đô tơk, hayơq xong xók bhơơl lóóm piđó, praaq paraaq talơơi, nek ađó yuur vôôiq, vôôiq kalơng tơk Ma-xê-đoan. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Kơi ađek hayơq, xók ơi vôôiq gan nôôq parah ađek lơq bhơơl lóóm piđó palơq mưi taruuih pachóóm yaal, nek ađó vôôiq leq Hi-laap. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />N'drươh ađek, xók tơơt dhiq ađek pe kaxe ơi, taai yuur vaaih mưi mangê tabâân janah ađó tââq manưih Jo Thaaiq xók ravang vôôiq bhuông tơk Si-ri, hayơq ađó ơi pagluh karnóq val chô ting charhóóng Ma-xê-đoan. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Xók achêk, ting vôôiq palơq ađó nek Sô-ba-tê, akóón Bi-ru, manưih Bê-rê, dyơq ve A-ri-taak lơq Sê-kuun-đu, manưih Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka; Gaai-uut, manưih Đeet-bơ; Ti-mô-thê; palơq Ti-chi-kơ lơq Trô-phiim, manưih A-si. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Bơơi taai ơi vôôiq loom, piđó xók đương nôôq yi dhiq Trô-et. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Dyơq nôôq yi, lơh nôôq tangêi Bhiêk Beng Kah Piêng, ơi yuur vôôiq kalơng taxiiq tââq kanóón Phi-liip, lơq ơi lơh tơk xââng tangêi, nôôq yi ơi tơk palơq piđó dhiq Trô-et, nek dhiq hơq nôôq yi tơơt lóóiq dhiq ađek kalóóng tapól tangêi.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Xók achêk, tơk tangêi đu mưi kalóóng tun, xók nôôq yi nhoom lóóiq palơq xóng ađêi đóng veh beng, Phaau-lô praaq chiên palơq nôôq manưih huuiq. Taai karnóq yuur vôôiq tangêi rayiiu, hayơq ađó dyơq bhiêk patet taruuih pachóóm đóng tơk m'pơng hayum. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Xók achêk, ve bơk dhơu kalóóng buông dhiq yaal, dhiq hơq nôôq yi xók bâân nhoom lóóiq. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Bơơi, mưi padruuih n'dhóm tôôh, achak Ơ-tit, xók tơơt dhiq palóng luh, bâân tem bhanêch ngan, xók bhêêl Phaau-lô pachóóm đươnh lơh dyơq, taai bâân ngan dhiq bhanêch, ađó ađek ơi n'tôq tââq tơng đu pe chok leq lơq chêt xók bâân tơq hayuur. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Dhơ kơi ađek, xók ơi vôôiq dhaluônh, Phaau-lô kop chak leq padruuih, hayơq pei kuôr padruuih, ađó móón: “Óóq kakhin, taai parmông ưng padruuih dyơq tơơt kalóóng ađó.” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Tatun ađek, vôôiq val dyók, veh beng lơq cha vaar, chadrươh praaq chiên kalóóng mưi ganah đươnh đóng tơk marư brương, hayơq bhiêk kơi ađek, ađó yuur vôôiq. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Dyơq palââng đââng padruuih dyơq mamông chô lơq bâân tabhơơl lóóm bơk bhlơng.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Tatun ađek, xók ơi vôôiq loom tơk dhiq m'beq jatau, nôôq yi bâân đââng tơk A-sôôt, nek dhiq ơi karnóq e pơh Phaau-lô dyók leq jatau, taai ađó ơi ravang kơi ađek, xók chênh ađêi ting kơi karnóq vôôiq palơq kalơng kakóóng. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Hayơq xók ađó ơi lum nôôq yi dhiq A-sôôt, nek xong xók kêch ađó leq jatau, nôôq yi vôôiq tơk Mi-ti-leen. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Lơq xók vôôiq taxiiq tââq dham ađek, tangêi rayiiu nôôq yi vôôiq dhuônh chaang gan Chi-ô, dyơq tangêi tatun ađek, nôôq yi tơk dhiq Sa-môôt, hayơq tangêi tatun dyơq, nôôq yi ơi vôôiq tơk Mi-lê. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Taai Phaau-lô ơi kanóq loom vôôiq bhuông vôôiq lơh Ê-phê-sô, buôn đóng ađó yươq phaai bil bơk tangêi dhiq A-si, taai ađó xók tahươk đóng ve mat dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem tơk tangêi Bhiêk Xââng Jêt Tangêi, la tarnêêng ađek nek liêm kre palơq ađó.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Kơi ađek nek, tââq Mi-lê, xong xók kayua manưih tơk Ê-phê-sô, ađó đóng kayua nôôq takóh bhươl ưng akóón dhơn chuôq tơk. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Lơq hayơq, xók piđó ơi tơk palơq ađó, nek ađó praaq palơq piđó:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 20:18">“Chênh adhi anó n'nal giit, tââq tangêi tââp tanââp, nek tââq bhêêl aku tââp tađâq dyung tơk A-si, aku ơi tơơt palơq adhi anó ng'kơi bhluuch ganah ađek, <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />xók têêng yaauq Chuôq palơq tabhơt lóóm moor mêêm lơq đơơk mat palơq nôôq hadhaap janah yuur vaaih đóng aku tââq nôôq mangê tabâân ưng manưih Jo Thaaiq, <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />ng'kơi aku ơi kah jư lóóiq ve rau, chênh nek nôôq rau malơơi, hơq kah truuih pachóóm đóng adhi anó, aku kung ơi pachóóm adhi anó tơơt dhiq bơk manưih, lơq dhiq nôôq đong n'tua kala, <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />xók truuih đuui đóng paluch manưih Jo Thaaiq palơq Hi-laap leq rau klôôq lóóm malóóm leq Yaang Pleng lơq leq lóóm huuiq dhiq Chuôq nôôq he, nek Chuôq Jê-su. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Xók ađôk, nhan lêi nô, aku xók dhiq kalơng vôôiq tơk leq Jê-ru-sa-leem, taai ơi đơơp Yaang Liêm chut yua, biêh kah n'nal rau dhơơm e yuur vaaih đóng ađêi dhiq ađek, <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />lơh tââq tarnêêng Chuôq Yaang Liêm pakah palơq aku kalóóng dyóp kanóón, móón kơi talêi bhaxêi lơq hadhaap janah xók đương aku. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Dhơ kơi ađek, aku kah xêi n'đó paraaq đóng parmông aku nek liêm kiiq ting kơi palơq ađêi, bhiêk ve paxong kalơng mut ưng aku lơq tarnêêng hơq aku ơi đơơp pei tââq Chuôq Jê-su, đóng truuih đuui leq Taruuih Liêm taai phươk liêm ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="ACT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />Xók ađôk, nhan lêi nô, aku n'nal kơi tabhơt adhi anó, nek dhiq m'pơng nôôq manưih hơq aku ơi bóói mót xók truuih đuui leq Katiêk Pleng, e kah bâân lêi mat aku dyơq. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Taai kơi ađek, tơk tangêi mađôk, aku truuih đuui toom adhi anó kơi aku yươq matu leq ahaam ưng tabhơt adhi anó. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Taai aku kah jư lóóiq marau marâ têêng đóng tabhơt kanóq kiêng ưng Yaang Pleng kah paraaq pakah bâân dhiq adhi anó. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Phaai jư lêi chênh ađêi lơq paluch kabhuh m'bưưiq hơq Chuôq Yaang Liêm ơi patơơt adhi anó têêng manưih lêi gamang đóng chơơng đââng akóón dhơn chuôq ưng Yaang Pleng, nek kabhuh hơq Ađó ơi kơl palơq ahaam ưng chênh ađêi. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Aku n'nal kơi lơh hóng yuur vôôiq ưng aku, kabhuh axing grô ja-ââih e paliên mót dhiq m'pơng adhi anó, kah châq kayô kabhuh katưưiq. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Patơk mơ tââq m'pơng kalóóng chênh adhi anó e yuur vaaih mưi phơn manưih pei praaq nôôq rau lơt xraang đóng dharơơl tamôôiq bơk môôn-đô ting piđó. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Kơi ađek hayơq, phaai hêch lêi, hei kơi tangêi lơq hayum, dhiq bhluuch pe kamó, aku kah dhêi pató pachóóm ting chanak manưih palơq lơq đơơk mat. <verse eid="ACT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Xók ađôk, aku pajaau adhi anó đóng Yaang Pleng lơq đóng paraaq ưng phươk liêm Ađó, nek rau ve mataai raman đóng hayuur adhi anó lơq đóng leq adhi anó drươp karvaan dhiq m'pơng tabhơt nôôq ngaai xók bâân pasek liêm. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Aku kah n'thaam baak môôiq vaang môôiq kun aau ưng ngaai. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Chênh adhi anó n'nal kơi bơơr tapaang têi ađô ơi têêng yaauq đóng parmông ưng aku lơq ưng nôôq manưih tơơt nek palơq aku. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Aku ơi pakah đóng adhi anó kalóóng tabhơt dyóp tarnêêng kơi kơng phaai pajêi matêêng kơi ađek đóng jóói poor nôôq ngaai dhur praan, bhêêl ađek đóng hei karnóq nôôq paraaq ưng Chuôq Jê-su, taai chênh Ađó ơi kayua: ‘Alua ve phươk xók nh'xóóng đóng lơh mơ nek xók pei đơơp.’”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Xong xók praaq nôôq rau ađek, nek bhêêl ơi chakoh takól chok leq, ađó gavơh nhan palơq tabhơt piđó. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Xók achêk, rau nhiim hei gamak bhlơng val vaaih dhiq m'pơng piđó, lơq xók pei kuôr tuôr Phaau-lô xong, piđó chum ađó, <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />taai ka-ai karuôq tââm nek paraaq ađó ơi praaq, kơi piđó ravang kah dyơq talum mat ađó dyơq. Tatun ađek, piđó chalaang ađó dhaluônh jatau.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Xók achêk, chiên yuur vaaih bhêêl nôôq yi ơi bâân đââng gluh leq taxiiq, chênh nek xong xók talơơi lơh tââq piđó, nek tapat mưi ganhuh, nôôq yi vôôiq tơk Kôôt, hayơq lơh tangêi rayiiu tơk Rô-đơ, lơq tââq ađek tơk Ba-ta-ra. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Bhêêl ơi bâân chik-chêk mưi beq jatau vôôiq chaang tơk Phê-ni-xi, nek dhaluônh jatau achêk, nôôq yi bâân đââng leq taxiiq. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Bhêêl achêk, xong xók bâân lêi kôông Chiip-rơ, nek viêr palơh hót ađaai kôông, nôôq yi vôôiq bhuông tơk Si-ri lơq vôôiq dhaluônh tơk Ti-rơ, taai jatau phaai padhaluônh đô-đaak dhiq ađek. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Bhêêl achêk, xong xók bâân lêi nôôq môôn-đô, nôôq yi tơơt lóóiq dhiq ađek tapól tangêi, hơq piđó, ganơơm Yaang Liêm đóng n'nal, bhiêk móón Phaau-lô óóq tađâq dyung tơk Jê-ru-sa-leem. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Xók achêk, chiên val vaaih bhêêl nôôq yi ơi bhơt nôôq tangêi ađô, xong xók yuur vôôiq, nôôq yi bhiêk yuur vôôiq, xók tabhơt piđó maar ting vôôiq chalaang nôôq yi nek palơq kađiêl lơq nôôq akóón, đóng tơk luch hót nguôi kanóón, hayơq xong xók chakoh takól chok leq dhiq tóór taxiiq gavơh nhan, <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />nek nôôq yi talơơi changaai xóng ađêi lơq bhadyaang dyók leq jatau, dyơq nôôq manưih achêk nek val chô dham ađêi, <verse eid="ACT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />bơơi nôôq yi, xók ơi paluch ganhuh vôôiq kalơng taxiiq tââq Ti-rơ, nek vôôiq dhaluônh tơk Bê-tô-lê-maai, lơq xong xók chap yayar nôôq adhi anó, nôôq yi tơơt lóóiq palơq piđó mưi tangêi. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Hayơq tangêi rayiiu, xong xók yuur vôôiq, nôôq yi vôôiq tơk Sê-sa-rê lơq, xók ơi mót kalóóng đong ưng Phi-liip, manưih truuih Taruuih Liêm, nek mưi kalóóng tapól chanak têêng tarnêêng chuôq, nôôq yi tơơt lóóiq palơq ađó. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Xók achêk, ađó ve puôn panong akóón pađiil kamór praaq đââng taruuih. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Hayơq kalóóng bơk tangêi bhêêl nôôq yi tơơt lóóiq dhiq ađek, mưi manưih đââng taruuih achêk, achak A-ga-buut, ơi vôôiq dhuônh tââq Ju-đê. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Xong xók tơk lum nôôq yi lơq pei talêi xeet tarveng ưng Phaau-lô, hayơq klooiq dyung têi ưng ađêi lóóiq, ađó móón: “Chuôq Yaang Liêm praaq nôôq rau ađô: ‘Ting kơi ađô, manưih Jo Thaaiq dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem e klooiq manưih padruuih, hơq ađó achêk ve talêi xeet tarveng ađô, lơq piđó e pajaau ađó achêk leq têi dhanuôr katiêk lââng.’” <verse eid="ACT 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Hayơq nek, xók nôôq yi xâng nôôq praaq achêk, paluch nôôq yi lơq nôôq manưih mamông dhiq kanóón maar mââl ađó óóq vôôiq tơk Jê-ru-sa-leem. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Tatun ađek, Phaau-lô ââi lóóiq: “Adhi anó dyơq têêng haurau kơi ađek, nhiim hei lơq têêng lóóm aku ka-ai karuôq alua? Tââq aku ve rau ravang, kah meen đóng bâân klooiq, hơq dyơq đơơp chêt taai dhanóók Chuôq Jê-su dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem dyơq.” <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Bhêêl achêk, ađó kah đơơp xâng, hayơq nôôq yi kah praaq dyơq, móón kơi ađô: “Nhan kanóq Chuôq chóóm vaaih.”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Xók achêk, xong nôôq tangêi ađek, xók ơi dhoon rapaq đô-đaak, nôôq yi vôôiq đơk tơk Jê-ru-sa-leem. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Hayơq masôôq môôn-đô tââq Sê-sa-rê kung vôôiq palơq nôôq yi, đââng nôôq yi tơk leq Ma-na-sôôn, mưi nak kanóón dhiq Chiip-rơ, nek môôn-đô tââq tââp tanââp, hơq tơơt dhiq manưih ađô nôôq yi bâân pơh yaauq.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Xók achêk, xók nôôq yi ơi tơk dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem, nôôq adhi anó bhuui marhaal pơh chap yayar nôôq yi. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Hayơq tangêi rayiiu, Phaau-lô vôôiq palơq nôôq yi tơk lum Ja-kơ, chadrươh tabhơt nôôq takóh bhươl maar ve mat. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Chap yayar piđó xong, ađó truuih lóóiq ting rau tarnêêng dyóp rau hơq Yaang Pleng ơi têêng dhiq m'pơng nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng tââq tarnêêng ưng ađêi. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Xók achêk, xong xók xâng kơi ađek, piđó bhi haanh Yaang Pleng, chadrươh piđó praaq palơq ađó: “Nôôq adhi anó, amei lêi nek, ve kaaq-bhaan manưih ơi huuiq dhiq m'pơng dhanuôr Jo Thaaiq lơq piđó maar ve lóóm bhreh bhriêl leq gani. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Bơơi, piđó ơi bâân truuih đuui leq amei, kơi amei pató pachóóm leq tarnêêng m'peq lơơi lơh tââq gani Môôi-se đóng dyóp ngaai Jo Thaaiq dhiq m'pơng nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng, xók móón nôôq manưih achêk óóq iêt ng'kar đóng akóón anaaq ađêi, kung óóq mamông ting nôôq gani takóh. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Hayơq nek, phaai ng'kơi têêng? Dhakơi piđó e xâng kơi amei ơi tơk. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Kơi ađek phaai têêng kơi ađô, nek rau hơq nôôq yi móón palơq amei. Puôn chanak nôk xók tơơt palơq nôôq yi, xók ve dhiq ađêi mưi paraaq ng'kóh. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Xong xók đââng nôôq manưih ađô ting nek phaai đơơp pasek kung palơq piđó, lơq phaai chróót jêên đóng piđó, đóng piđó e bâân goot koq ađêi, hayơq dyóp ngaai e n'nal kơi nôôq rau piđó ơi bâân truuih đuui leq amei nek kah mơ ve, palâh lóóiq chênh amei kala kung tơơt cha liêm kre, xók đơơp jư gani. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Dyơq leq nôôq manưih katiêk lââng ơi huuiq, nôôq yi ơi pagơơi bha-aar, pave phaai jư ađêi lơh tââq chana bhanuôih kabhêi, ahaam, akóón dhah chêt kamap, lơq rau tapiing.” <verse eid="ACT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Kơi ađek hayơq, tangêi rayiiu, xong xók đââng nôôq manưih ađek ting, xók ơi bâân pasek kung palơq piđó, nek Phaau-lô vôôiq mót leq kalóóng đong bhanuôih, praaq móón paxong leq nôôq tangêi ưng bhiêk pasek, yaap tơk xók bhanuôih bâân tapôông đóng ting chanak kalóóng nôôq piđó.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Bơơi xók tapól tangêi ravang bâân dyóp, nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq bhral tââq A-si, xong xók lêi Phaau-lô kalóóng đong bhanuôih, ơi paxuq paluch ganơr manưih lơq pei têi kóóp ađó, <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />lalơu: “Bhươl kanóón ơơi, dhanuôr I-sơ-ra-êên ơơi, nhan jóói đâh! Ađô nek manưih pachóóm dyóp ngaai dyóp dhiq jơl lóóiq dhanuôr, gani lơq dhiq ađô. Chadrươh, ađó patơk mơ dyơq đââng manưih Hi-laap mót kalóóng đong bhanuôih lơq têêng nhơơp xrơơm dham tabah liêm ađô.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Ơi laloom ađek, piđó ơi lêi Trô-phiim, manưih Ê-phê-sô, kung palơq ađó kalóóng kanóón, hơq piđó ngóq kơi Phaau-lô ơi đââng ađó achêk mót leq đong bhanuôih. <verse eid="ACT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Bhơt kanóón n'drươh bâân tamôôiq, n'drươh bhral mưi ganơr manưih garuul tơk, hayơq xong xók pei kóóp Phaau-lô, piđó ơi galôôi ađó gluh leq nguôi đong bhanuôih, lơq palóng parmat bâân kađơp lóóiq. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Kung xók bhêêl tabâân leng ađó, nek tanđôôr đââr tơk takóh kadhâng koq kabhuh linh kơi tabhơt kanóón Jê-ru-sa-leem xók bâân nhôôn nhaauq, <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />nek parmat, xong xók ting đââng kabhuh linh lơq nôôq linh têêng koq, ađó mut dhuônh tơk dham ganơr manưih. Hayơq xók palââng bâân lêi takóh linh kadhâng koq palơq nôôq linh, piđó parngau m'bhiiq m'pah Phaau-lô. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Tơk xók ađô, xók ơi vôôiq lóóiq pagriêq, takóh linh kadhâng koq đóng kóóp jư ađó, praaq parâng đóng Phaau-lô bâân taklooiq palơq bơơr tarlêi xiêng, hayơq tamóh xâng ađó nek ngaai lơq ađó ơi têêng haurau. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Dhơ kơi ađek, manưih ađô manưih tôôh kalóóng ganơr manưih xók lalơu treeh mưi chiên lalei kơi, dyơq takóh linh kadhâng koq, xók kah ve đuôh tabâân n'nal haurau pâng taai dhariêng ka-uôih nhôôn nhaauq, nek ơi praaq kayua đóng ađó bâân đââng chô leq pơơq linh. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Bơơi xók ađó vôôiq tơk rakal paraang, nek chiên yuur vaaih leq ađó nek phaai bâân nôôq linh glâk vôôiq tââq rau grâ ja-ââih ưng dhanuôr manưih. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Taai mưi ganơr manưih bơk bhlơng bhiêk ting tapun, lalơu treeh: “Leng ađó vaq!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />N'drươh, xók ravang bâân đââng mót pơơq linh, Phaau-lô praaq palơq takóh linh kadhâng koq: “Ve pheep đóng aku praaq bơơr pe rau palơq amei kah?” Hayơq takóh linh kadhâng koq móón: “Amei n'nal dhariêng Hi-laap na? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Kơi ađek nek amei eh rau nek tadhươm Ai Kơp, manưih hơq laloom nôôq tangêi ađô ơi panhôôn nhaauq lơq đââng puôn ngaan manưih tarleng mót leq kruung vơng?” <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Hayơq Phaau-lô ââi: “Aku nek manưih Jo Thaaiq, kanóón dhiq Taat-sơ, xưưq Si-li-si, mưi manưih dhanuôr ưng kanóón manưih bơk eh rau nek katưưiq. Hayơq aku nhan amei đóng pheep aku praaq chiên palơq dhanuôr manưih.” <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Hayơq nek xong xók takóh linh kadhâng koq đóng pheep, xók dyương dhiq rakal paraang, Phaau-lô pahêq palơq têi leq dhanuôr manưih. Xók achêk, xók ơi đơơp parngau vaq, ađó pei praaq palơq dhariêng Hê-bơ-rơ, kơi ađô:<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Nhan móón nôôq pe, nôôq adhi anó lơq nôôq ama ayêi, nhan xâng paraaq paq ưng aku palơq nôôq pe xók ađô.”<verse eid="ACT 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Bhêêl achêk, xók xâng kơi ađó dyơq papraaq palơq dhariêng Hê-bơ-rơ palơq ađêi, piđó n'dhương dyơq parngau lơh dyơq. Hayơq ađó móón:<verse eid="ACT 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Aku nek manưih Jo Thaaiq, n'niên dhiq kanóón Taat-sơ xưưq Si-li-si, bơơi bâân hok kalóóng kanóón ađô raal dyung thêi Ga-ma-li-êên, bâân pachóóm ting kalơng vôôiq pagat ưng gani đơơp xâng tââq abhươp ama, ve lóóm bhreh bhriêl leq Yaang Pleng thê kơi tabhơt nôôq pe xók ve tangêi mađôk, <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />nek manưih ơi kóóp janah Taruuih ađô đóng tơk chêt, xók kóóp klooiq lơq tamót leq đong kanam paluch padruuih palơq pađiil, <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />i kơi takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm truuih đuui đóng aku palơq tabhơt nôôq takóh bhươl, nek nôôq manưih hơq xong xók đơơp bha-aar tââq dham piđó pagơơi đóng nôôq adhi anó, aku yuur vôôiq tơk Đa-met, vôôiq kóóp klooiq nôôq manưih bâân takóóp jư tơơt dhiq ađek chô tơk leq Jê-ru-sa-leem, buôn đóng piđó ve chóóm bâân taphaak. <verse eid="ACT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />Xók achêk, chiên val vaaih đóng aku ađek nek xók vôôiq kalơng lơq đan tơk Đa-met, mơ m'pơng dhơng, parmat, mưi kalaaq brương lóng karơ tââq pleng dyóól klaaq xirvir aku. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Chadrươh, aku n'tôq chok leq katiêk lơq xâng mưi dhariêng praaq palơq aku, kơi ađô: ‘Saau-lơ, Saau-lơ, hau akóón janah Aku?’ <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Kơi ađek hayơq, aku ââi lóóiq: ‘Chuôq ơơi, Amei nek ngaai?’ Ađó praaq palơq aku: ‘Aku nek Jê-su manưih Na-xa-reet, Yaang hơq akóón xók janah.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Bhêêl achêk, nôôq manưih xók tơơt palơq aku ve lêi kalaaq brương ađek, bơơi piđó kah n'nal rau dhariêng ưng Yaang xók praaq palơq aku. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Dyơq aku nek ââi: ‘Kakoh Chuôq, hau akóón phaai têêng?’ Tatun ađek, Chuôq praaq palơq aku: ‘Xong xók yuur dyương, phaai vôôiq mót leq kanóón Đa-met, lơq dhiq ađek akóón e bâân móón đóng n'nal leq tabhơt rau dhơơm ơi bâân ravang đóng akóón phaai têêng.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Hayơq nek, xók bhêêl aku kah chóóm lêi giit ơi taai kalaaq brương cha-iil chadhiêng ađek, hayơq ganơơm bâân dyuôch têi chơơng vôôiq tââq nôôq manưih tơơt palơq aku, aku ơi vôôiq mót leq kanóón Đa-met. <verse eid="ACT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />Xók achêk, anó A-na-nia achêk, mưi manưih bhơt lóóm ting gani, bâân truuih liêm tââq dyóp ngaai manưih Jo Thaaiq mamông dhiq ađek, <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />xók ơi tơk palơq aku lơq dyương hót tóór, ađó móón aku: ‘Anó Saau-lơ ơơi, nek brương mat lóóiq.’ Chênh xók ađek, aku ngơơq lêi ađó achêk. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Tatun ađek, ađó móón: ‘Yaang Pleng ưng abhươp avuôq nôôq he ơi chââih amei đóng n'nal kanóq kiêng Ađó, lơq đóng lêi Yaang Bhơt Liêm, kung kơi đóng xâng dhariêng praaq tââq bóóp Ađó, <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />taai amei e nek mưi manưih truuih đuui leq Ađó toom dyóp ngaai leq rau dhơơm amei ơi lêi lơq xâng. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Xók ađôk, amei hau dyơq pađươnh? Xong xók yuur dyương, phaai đơơp bap-teem lơq phaai têêng pasek matu lơt ađêi ganơơm nhan gavơh dhanóók Ađó.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />Tatun ađek, chiên val vaaih leq aku xók ơi val chô leq Jê-ru-sa-leem, lơq bhêêl aku xók gavơh nhan kalóóng đong bhanuôih, ađek nek chênh ađêi vaaih rangat gluh ravaai. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Aku lêi Ađó praaq palơq aku: ‘Pađâh aq, lơq nek gluh tââq Jê-ru-sa-leem đóng pađâh, taai piđó e kah đơơp xâng paraaq truuih đuui ưng akóón leq Aku.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Bơơi aku ââi: ‘Kakoh Chuôq, chênh piđó n'nal kơi akóón biêh ơi kóóp lơơi đong kanam lơq m'bhiiq vei kalóóng nôôq đong gươl nôôq ngaai huuiq leq Amei. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Bhêêl ahaam ưng Ê-tiên, manưih truuih đuui ưng Amei, bâân gluh n'toh, chênh akóón biêh kung dyương đan ađek, iêm lóóm, lơq đương jư aau nguôi ưng nôôq manưih leng chêt ađó achêk.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Hayơq Ađó praaq palơq aku: ‘phaai vôôiq, taai aku e kayua akóón vôôiq changaai tơk palơq nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng.’”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Xók achêk, manưih dhanuôr xók xâng ađó đóng tơk paraaq ađô, nek piđó yuur praaq, móón kơi ađô: “Phaai leng karchêt dhong manưih kơi ađô tââq hóng katiêk, taai kah đaang đóng ađó mamông.” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Chadrươh, xók piđó nek dyơq lalơu treeh, m'peq aau nguôi lơq vươk puui leq pleng, <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />nek takóh linh kadhâng koq ơi kayua parâng đóng Phaau-lô bâân đââng mót pơơq linh, móón ađó phaai đơơp avuôt palơq parvuôt, đóng ve chóóm n'nal taai hau rau hơq dhanuôr manưih val treeh lalơu jơl ađó kơi ađek. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Bơơi xók piđó ơi bhriêq ađó palơq talêi ravang avuôt, Phaau-lô móón palơq linh têêng koq xók dyương dhiq ađek: “Ve alua gani đóng pheep nôôq pe pei parvuôt avuôt mưi manưih Rô-ma hơq kah glêh xêi matu lơt?” <verse eid="ACT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Bhêêl achêk, taai xâng kơi ađek, nek linh kadhâng koq, xong xók tơk palơq takóh linh kadhâng koq, ơi móón lóóiq kơi ađô: “Amei hau karnóq têêng? Taai manưih ađô nek dhanuôr Rô-ma.” <verse eid="ACT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Kơi ađek, xók ơi vôôiq tơk, takóh linh kadhâng koq praaq palơq Phaau-lô: “Phaai đóng aku n'nal, amei ve lua nek dhanuôr Rô-ma eh alua?” Hayơq Phaau-lô móón: “Alua.” <verse eid="ACT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Xók achêk, takóh linh kadhâng koq ââi lóóiq: “Aku ơi kơl đóng bâân đóók dhanuôr ađek palơq mưi sôôq jêên gamak.” Bơơi Phaau-lô móón: “Dyơq aku lalua bâân n'niên kơi ađek.” <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Tââq kơi ađek, nôôq manưih karnóq vuôt ađó n'drươh róch xooq lơh tââq ađó, dyơq takóh linh kadhâng koq nek kakhin xók n'nal kơi ađó nek dhanuôr Rô-ma, lơq taai ađêi ơi đóng kóóp kađaai ađó.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Kơi ađek hayơq, tangêi rayiiu, taai kiêng n'nal lalua ng'hau kơi hơq ađó bâân manưih Jo Thaaiq kaauq patu, hayơq takóh linh kadhâng koq ơi lêh talêi kađaai ađó, lơq kayua parâng đóng nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm palơq tabhơt Kabhuh Xêi Xanêi hoop lóóiq. Hayơq xong xók đââng Phaau-lô dhaluônh, takóh linh kadhâng koq patơơt ađó dyương dhiq m'pơng piđó.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Xók achêk, xong xók lêi li-mrang leq kabhuh xêi xanêi, Phaau-lô praaq: “Nhan móón nôôq pe, nhan móón nôôq adhi anó, aku ơi mamông toom mat Yaang Pleng palơq paluch lóóm liêm sek tabah đóng tơk tangêi mađôk.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Bơơi takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm A-na-nia praaq parâng đóng nôôq manưih dyương đan ađó m'bhah leq bóóp ađó. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Tơk bhêêl ađô, Phaau-lô móón palơq ađó ađek: “Jađơr bâân kathel parhóm bhóók tôôh, Yaang Pleng ravang m'bhiiq amei! Amei tơơt xêi xanêi aku ting gani, hơq praaq kayua đóng aku bâân tambhiiq lơt gani alua?” <verse eid="ACT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Dhơ kơi ađek, nôôq manưih dyương tóór ađek móón: “Amei xók praaq môôp takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm ưng Yaang Pleng alua?” <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Phaau-lô móón: “Nhan móón adhi anó, aku ơi kah n'nal kơi ađó ađek nek takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm. Taai ơi ve xaraq kơi ađô: ‘Amei óóq praaq rau tamôôp palơq manưih kadhâng akoq dhanuôr ađêi.’”<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Kơi ađek hayơq, xók bâân lêi kơi mưi kabhuh nek manưih Sa-đu-sê, dyơq kabhuh tôôh nek manưih Pha-ri-si, Phaau-lô ơi praaq karơ dhariêng dhiq m'pơng Kabhuh Xêi Xanêi, kơi ađô: “Nhan móón nôôq pe, nhan móón nôôq adhi anó, aku nek mưi manưih Pha-ri-si, akóón ưng manưih Pha-ri-si; Aku xók bâân xêi xanêi tapâng tơk rau lóóm rââm lơq mamông lóóiq ưng manưih chêt.” <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Xók achêk, xók ađó móón rau ađô, nek mưi rau tarkaai val vaaih dhiq m'pơng manưih Pha-ri-si lơq manưih Sa-đu-sê, hayơq kabhuh manưih bâân yuur tablah <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Taai manưih Sa-đu-sê praaq kơi kah ve mamông lóóiq, kung kah ve dhơn pleng môôiq nôôq yaang, bơơi manưih Pha-ri-si nek đơơp huuiq miq bơơr rau ađek. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Kơi ađek hayơq, dhariêng lalơu jơl kah đươi kabroong val vaaih, lơq xong xók yuur dyương, masôôq takóh pachóóm gani mađó kabhuh Pha-ri-si tarkaai, kơi ađô: “Nôôq yi kah lêi ve matu lơt rauriq dhiq manưih ađô. Hơq ngaai n'nal, mưi yaang môôiq dhơn pleng ơi praaq palơq ađó ađek …” <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Lơq hayơq, xók tarkaai tarlak val xar karơ, takóh linh kadhâng koq, taai kakhin e Phaau-lô ve chóóm bâân piđó tech heek, ơi kayua parâng đóng nôôq kabhuh linh vôôiq dhaluônh pei jeng ađó tââq m'pơng piđó, chadrươh đââng ađó leq pơơq linh.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Bơơi, tơk hayum tangêi rayiiu, xók tơk hót tóór ađó, Chuôq praaq: “Phaai mưng lóóm taai akóón ơi truuih đuui leq Aku ng'kơi dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem, nek rau kơng bhlơng đóng akóón kung nek truuih đuui kơi ađek dhiq Rô-ma.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Kơi ađek hayơq tơk brương, xong xók xêi mangê xóng ađêi, nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq tư praaq ng'kóh parâng, kơi kah cha kung kah ơm đóng tơk xók nôôq piđó bâân leng Phaau-lô. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Bhêêl achêk, ve lơh puôn jêt chanak xêi mangê ađô, <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />hơq xók tơk palơq nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm lơq nôôq takóh bhươl, piđó móón: “Nôôq yi ơi paraaq ng'kóh parâng mưi paraaq tanóh chênh ađêi đóng kah cha rauriq đóng tơk xók nôôq yi bâân leng Phaau-lô. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Taai kơi ađek, xók ađôk, nhan nôôq pe palơq Kabhuh Xêi Xanêi pakah mat toom takóh linh kadhâng koq, kơi ngóq xók karnóq praaq xêi đóng giit lơh nôôq rau dhơơm pâng tơk ađó, đóng ađó ađek ve chóóm đââng xêi ađó dhaluônh leq nôôq pe. Dyơq nôôq yi nek ravang đóng leng ađó loom xók ađó tơk leq ađek.” <verse eid="ACT 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Bơơi akóón padruuih ưng mamóóq Phaau-lô, taai ơi xâng leq mangê đương choop góón, hayơq xong xók tơk lơq mót leq kalóóng pơơq linh, ơi truuih chiên ađô đóng Phaau-lô. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Kơi ađek nek, xók ơi dhaloong mưi kalóóng nôôq linh têêng koq lóóiq, Phaau-lô móón: “Nhan đââng padruuih tadhóm ađô tơk palơq takóh linh kadhâng koq, taai ađó ve rau truuih chiên leq ađó achêk.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Kơi ađek, xong xók đââng padruuih ting, linh têêng koq ơi đââng ađó tơk lum takóh linh kadhâng koq lơq móón: “Phaau-lô manưih takról, xong xók dhaloong aku, ơi kayua aku đââng padruuih tadhóm ađô tơk leq amei, taai ve rau phaai praaq palơq amei.” <verse eid="ACT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Kơi ađek nek, xong xók ơi kadhâng têi ađó lơq chơơng mót dhiq lalââp, takóh linh kadhâng koq tamóh: “Rau hơq amei ve đóng truuih chiên leq aku nek hau?” <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Xók achêk padruuih ââi kơi ađô: “Nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq ơi makơi lóóm nhan yua amei ng'kơi đóng tangêi rayiiu amei ve chóóm đââng Phaau-lô dhaluônh leq Kabhuh Xêi Xanêi, kơi ngóq xók karnóq praaq xêi kơi giit lơh leq ađó achêk. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Taai ađek, nhan amei óóq đóng nôôq piđó đươk lóóm, taai lơh puôn jêt chanak kalóóng sôôq piđó xók kadrêi đương choop góón ađó achêk, nek nôôq manưih ơi tư praaq ng'kóh parâng kah cha kung kah ơm đóng tơk xók bâân leng ađó. N'drươh xók ađôk piđó ơi ravang, đương rââm rau đơơp xâng tââq amei.” <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Kơi ađek, takóh linh kadhâng koq đóng padruuih tadhóm gluh chô, pató ađó: “Óóq đóng ngaai n'nal nek amei ơi truuih chiên leq aku nôôq chiên ađô.” <verse eid="ACT 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Xong xók dhaloong bơơr nak linh têêng koq tôôh, ađó móón: “Phaai ravang bơơr hariêng linh palơq tapól jêt linh dhââng axeh lơq bơơr hariêng linh kadhâng kóóih kơi đóng kabhuh linh ve chóóm yuur vôôiq leq Sê-sa-rê leq jơ đu pe hayum ađôk,” <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />chadrươh ravang đóng adhah dhââng buôn đóng leq Phaau-lô dyók dhââng, tanóói ve chóóm đââng ađó ađek yươq rauha tơk leq kuôn têêng kala xưưq Phê-liit, <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Dhiq xók ơi xaraq bha-aar ve kiêng móón kơi ađô:<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />“Kơ-lôôt Li-sia pagơơi kuôn têêng kala xưưq Phê-liit bhi chap: Chap yayar khe liêm. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Manưih ađô, xong xók bâân takóóp tââq manưih Jo Thaaiq lơq ravang bâân palââng leng, nek aku ơi jóói poor xók lóón tơk kung palơq nôôq linh, taai bâân n'nal kơi manưih ađô nek dhanuôr La-ma. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />N'drươh ađek, taai kiêng n'nal leq paraaq kaauq patu hơq taai ađek piđó kaauq ađó ađek, aku ơi đââng ađó ađek dhuônh leq Kabhuh Xêi Xanêi ưng piđó, <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />hơq aku lêi ađó ađek bâân takaauq ve pâng nôôq tarkaai leq gani takóh ưng piđó, bơơi eh rau ve takaauq lââng chóóm chêt hamôôiq tamót đong kanam. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Kơi ađek hayơq, xong xók mưi mangê e val vaaih makhich palơq manưih ađô bâân pakah đóng aku, aku ơi n'drươh đââng manưih ađô tơk leq amei, xók kung kayua parâng đóng nôôq manưih kaauq patu phaai xêi xanêi manưih ađô toom mat amei.”<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Kơi ađek, nôôq kabhuh linh, ting paraaq râng bâân kayua đóng leq ađêi, xong xók đââng Phaau-lô ting, ơi đââng ađó vôôiq kalóóng hayum kanam tơk An-ti-ba-tri. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Hayơq tangêi rayiiu, piđó val chô leq pơơq linh, xók ơi lơơi linh dhââng axeh bhiêk vôôiq palơq ađó, <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />hơq kabhuh linh ađô, xók ơi mót leq kalóóng kanóón Sê-sa-rê lơq pajaau bha-aar đóng kuôn kala xưưq, nek kung ơi đââng pakah Phaau-lô đóng ađó achêk. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Xók achêk, xong xók đââng bha-aar lơq tamóh ađó nek n'niên tââq n'đó xưưq, hayơq xók ơi n'nal nek dhiq xưưq Si-li-si, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />kuôn kala xưưq móón: “Aku e xêi xanêi amei ting gani xók nôôq manưih kaauq patu amei kung tơk ađôk”, hayơq kayua đóng ađó bâân đương jư kalóóng đong ưng Hê-rôôt.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Xók achêk, tatun xââng tangêi, takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm A-na-nia, kung palơq nôôq takóh bhươl achêk, lơq manưih chóóm bóóp paraaq Teet-tu-lu tôôh ơi vôôiq dhaluônh, nek nôôq manưih tabhral đóng kaauq patu toom kuôn têêng kala jơl lóóiq Phaau-lô. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Hayơq xók ađó ơi bâân dhaloong tơk, Teet-tu-lu tââp tanââp kaauq ađó, xók ââi: “Taai bâân đơơp rau khe liêm gamak tââq Amei, lơq ơi bơk tadhơ vaaih tơk đóng dhanuôr ađô tââq rau lêi changaai chamet bhươh ưng amei,<verse eid="ACT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />hayơq nhan móón kuôn Phê-liit bhi chap, Paluch kalóóng dyóp tarnêêng lơq plok dyóp dhiq, nôôq yi pơh đơơp nôôq tarnêêng gamak achêk palơq tabhơt lóóm n'nal ơơn. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Bơơi đóng aku yươq têêng panhok amei grơơt bơk lơh, aku nhan amei, palơq rau lóóm jruôn ưng ađêi, xâng nôôq yi pakah praaq gađóq. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Lalua, taai bâân lêi dhươm ađô kơi rau parluh, lơq nek dhươm đââng paxuq rau nhôôn nhaauq dhiq dyóp ngaai manưih Jo Thaaiq plok hóng katiêk, n'drươh ađek nek dhươm kadhâng koq kabhuh Na-xa-reet, <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />nek ađó patơk mơ ơi toon têêng nhơơp xrơơm đong bhanuôih, kung nek manưih hơq nôôq yi ơi kóóp jư, lơq nôôq yi kiêng praaq xêi ting gani ưng nôôq yi. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Bơơi takóh linh kadhâng koq Li-sia, xong xók tơk ađek, ơi pei jeng ađó tââq têi nôôq yi palơq praan karơ, <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />pagluh praaq kayua leq nôôq manưih kaauq patu ađó phaai vôôiq toom amei, hơq tââq dhiq ađó, amei e ve chóóm chênh ađêi tamóh leq tabhơt nôôq tarnêêng ađô đóng bâân ting n'nal nôôq matu hơq nôôq yi xók kaauq patu ađó.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Kơi ađek hayơq, manưih Jo Thaaiq kung garu ting, đóng n'nal tarnêêng ađek nek kơi ađek.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Phaau-lô kung ơi ââi lóóiq, xong xók kuôn kadhâng xưưq pahêq đóng ađó praaq: “Taai n'nal amei ơi têêng kuôn xêi xanêi đóng dhanuôr ađô kalóóng bơk kamó, hayơq aku bhuui lóóm tư praaq paq leq nôôq tarnêêng tapâng tơk ađêi,<verse eid="ACT 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Taai Amei ve chóóm n'nal kơi tââq xók aku vôôiq đơk đóng bhuôih haanh dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem nek kah lơh majêt bơơr tangêi, <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />lơq piđó kah glêh lum aku tarkaai palơq ngaai kalóóng đong bhanuôih, kung kah yuur têêng rau nhôôn nhaauq dhiq manưih ganơr, ha môôiq kalóóng nôôq đong gươl, môôiq plok paluch kanóón manưih bơk, <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />piđó kung kah ve đuôh pakah lêi rau đóng amei leq nôôq matu hơq piđó nôk xók kaauq patu aku. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Bơơi aku praaq lalua palơq amei rau ađô, nek ting kơi Taruuih hơq piđó đóók nek kabhuh, hơq ting ađek aku têêng yaauq Yaang Pleng ưng nôôq abhươp avuôq, patơơt lóóm huuiq leq tabhơt rau dhơơm ting dhiq gani lơq nôôq paraaq bâân xaraq kalóóng nôôq bha-aar manưih đââng taruuih, <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />ve lóóm rââm dhiq Yaang Pleng hơq chênh piđó kung xók đương rââm, xók kanóq nek e ve mamông lóóiq ưng paluch manưih bhơt liêm palơq manưih têêng aak. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Taai kơi ađek, chênh aku kung tabhlơng praan đóng ve mưi lóóm kanóq kah dhiq jươm toom mat Yaang Pleng lơq akóón manưih kalóóng dyóp rau. <verse eid="ACT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />Xók achêk, lơh bơk kamó, aku val chô, ting đââng jêên poor jóói đóng katiêk karuung ađêi, palơq nôôq bhanuôih, <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />hơq tơk bhêêl ađek, piđó talum aku đơơp pasek pase kalóóng đong bhanuôih, kah mađó palơq ganơr manưih, kung kah mađó palơq talum nhôôn nhaauq. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Bơơi nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq tôôh tââq A-si, nek nôôq manưih kơi parpâng phaai tơk pakah mat toom amei hayơq kaauq patu, la piđó ve dhơ dharau tarnêêng makhich palơq aku. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Hamôôiq nek chênh nôôq manưih dhiq ađôk phaai praaq pakah n'đó rau lơt môôp hơq piđó ơi bâân lêi dhiq aku xók aku dyương toom Kabhuh Xêi Xanêi ưng manưih Jo Thaaiq; <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />ve alua nek leq mưi paraaq yuur praaq kơi ađô hơq aku ơi lalơu karơ bhêêl dyương dhiq m'pơng piđó, kơi ađô: ‘Aku xók đơơp xêi xanêi toom nôôq pe vaar ađôk tapâng tơk mamông lóóiq ưng manưih chêt.’”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Kơi ađek hayơq Phê-liit, ơi n'nal drêh dróói nôôq rau tarnêêng pâng tơk Taruuih, ơi kajơq praaq xêi dyóp hót, xók praaq: “N'đó bhêêl takóh linh kadhâng koq Li-sia ve chóóm vôôiq dhaluônh leq ađô, aku e xêi tarnêêng nôôq chiên tapâng tơk nôôq pe,” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />lơq praaq kayua đóng takóh linh têêng koq đương jư Phaau-lô, chadrươh ađek phaai đóng ađó ve bâân rathaai, lơq óóq jơl nôôq manưih parjơơk ưng ađó tơk poor jóói ađó.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Hayơq bơơr pe tangêi lơh ađek, Phê-liit, xók val lóóiq palơq Đơ-ru-si, kađiêl ađêi, nek mưi manưih pađiil Jo Thaaiq, nek ơi kayua dhaloong Phaau-lô tơk lơq xâng ađó praaq pakah tơk lóóm huuiq dhiq Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Bơơi xók ađó dyơq truuih đuui leq rau bhơt liêm lơq rau garđơq, palơq rau xêi xanêi e tơk, nek Phê-liit, taai vaaih kakhin, ơi ââi lóóiq: “Nôk xók nek róch aq, bơơi xók ve bhêêl hót, aku e đóng yua dhaloong amei tơk.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Palơq xók ađek, kung taai đương rââm kơi e ve m'bưưiq jêên baak bâân Phaau-lô tông đóng leq ađêi, hayơq tââq ađek, kuôn kadhâng xưưq bhiêk praaq chiên palơq ađó xók kayua dhaloong ađó tơk yayóóng. <verse eid="ACT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Bơơi xók lơh luch bơơr kamó, Phê-liit ve manưih klóóih tanơơt nek Bôôt-tiiu Phê-tu, chadrươh ađek ơi kiêng pei lóóm dhanuôr Jo Thaaiq, hayơq Phê-liit ơi lơơi Phaau-lô bâân takról.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Kơi ađek, xók ơi tơk đơơp tarnêêng kalóóng xưưq, nek lơh pe tangêi tatun, Phê-tu yuur vôôiq tââq Sê-sa-rê tơk Jê-ru-sa-leem. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Chadrươh ađek, nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm lơq nôôq manưih têêng gamak kalóóng dhanuôr Jo Thaaiq pakah mat toom ađó jơl makhich Phaau-lô lơq piđó mââl nhan ađó, <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />xók nhan mưi rau ơơn liêm makhich palơq Phaau-lô, ađek nek kuôn kadhâng xưưq ve chóóm đóng kayua dhaloong Phaau-lô đơk Jê-ru-sa-leem, dhiq xók ravang mangê đương góón buôn leng ađó chóók kalơng. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Xong ađek, Phê-tu ââi lóóiq kơi ađô Phaau-lô nak dyơq takról dhiq Sê-sa-rê, dyơq chênh ađó kala nek ravang pađâh yuur vôôiq. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Ađó praaq: “Taai kơi ađek, nôôq manưih têêng gamak dhiq m'pơng nôôq pe, xong xók ting dhaluônh leq ađek, la ve hau rau lơt dhiq manưih ađô, nek piđó phaai kaauq patu ađó ađek.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Xók achêk, xók ơi tơơt palơq piđó óóq bơk lơh takóól hamôôiq majêt tangêi, ađó ađek vôôiq chok leq tơk Sê-sa-rê. Tangêi tatun ađek, xong xók tơơt leq tanơơt xêi xanêi, ađó ađek kayua đóng Phaau-lô bâân đââng pagluh. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Kơi ađek hayơq, bhêêl ađó ơi bhral, nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq biêh tââq Jê-ru-sa-leem dhaluônh ơi pei xavaang ađó, pakah bơk rau paraaq kaauq patu haleng hadhơơp hơq piđó kah rau chóóm pakah lêi, <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Dhiq xók Phaau-lô tư paq praaq ađêi kơi ađô: “Aku yươq têêng marau marâ rau matu lơt jơl lóóiq gani ưng manưih Jo Thaaiq, yươq jơl lóóiq đong bhanuôih, kung yươq jơl lóóiq Xê-xa.” <verse eid="ACT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Bơơi taai kiêng pei lóóm manưih Jo Thaaiq, Phê-tu ââi bóóp Phaau-lô kơi ađô: “Amei ve kiêng, la đơk leq Jê-ru-sa-leem, đóng đơơp xêi xanêi dhiq ađek toom mat aku leq nôôq tarnêêng ađô kah?” <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Dhơ kơi ađek, Phaau-lô ââi: “Aku dyơq dyương toom đong xanêi ưng Xê-xa, nek dhiq kiêng đươi đóng aku phaai đơơp xêi xanêi. Aku kah têêng hau rau mahaai leq manưih Jo Thaaiq, kơi amei kung n'nal giit bhlơng. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Kơi ađek, la aku têêng mahaai lơq ơi têêng haurau chóóm chêt, nek aku kah nhan đóng yươq chêt. Bơơi la kah rau matu lơt lââng ve kalóóng nôôq rau dhơơm piđó kaauq patu aku, nek kah ngaai ve chóóm pajaau aku leq piđó. Aku kaauq xêi tơk leq Xê-xa.” <verse eid="ACT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Tatun ađek, xók ơi tapraaq xêi palơq kabhuh xêi xanêi pachóóm bóóp paraaq, Phê-tu ââi bóóp: “Amei ơi kaauq xêi leq Xê-xa. Amei e vôôiq tơk Xê-xa!”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Xók achêk, xong xók lơh bơơr pe tangêi, bhua Ak-riip-ba lơq amooq Bê-rê-niit ơi vôôiq dhaluônh tơk leq Sê-sa-rê, chap yayar Phê-tu. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Hayơq dhiq xók nôôq manưih achêk tơơt dhiq ađek bơk tangêi, Phê-tu pakah đóng bhua nôôq rau dhơơm leq Phaau-lô, kơi ađô: “Manưih padruuih tôôh nek manưih tơơt đong kanam bâân Phê-liit lơơi lóóiq, <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />hơq leq manưih ađô, nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm lơq nôôq takóh bhươl manưih Jo Thaaiq ơi truuih kaauq, xók aku tơơt dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem, nhan xêi patu makhich palơq ađó ađek. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Aku ơi ââi palơq piđó kơi kaxu ưng La Ma nek kah pajaau mak ngaai xók loom ađó bâân takaauq ve chóóm tajaap mat palơq nôôq manưih kaauq, chadrươh ađek bâân đơơp nek xók tư paq paraaq leq rau kaauq patu ađek. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Taai kơi ađek, xók ơi tamôôiq xóng ađêi tơk leq ađô, kah têêng m'bưưiq m'bâ pajih pangaang rauriq, nek tangêi rayiiu, bhêêl xók tơơt leq tanơơt xêi xanêi xong, aku kayua đóng ađó ađek bâân đââng tamót, <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />hơq tapâng tơk manưih ađô, xong xók nôôq manưih kaauq bâân đóng yuur dyương, piđó ơi kah pakah paraaq kaauq patu lââng kơi nôôq matu aak hơq aku karnóq. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Klóóih leq ađek, piđó ve masôôq tarkaai palơq ađó ađek leq lóóm huuiq ưng ađêi lơq tơk Jê-su achêk ơi chêt hơq Phaau-lô praaq tamưng nek bhiêk dyơq mamông. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Kơi ađek nek, taai kah n'nal dhalam rau tarkaai leq nôôq tarnêêng ađô, aku ơi tamóh ađó ađek ve lua kiêng vôôiq tơk leq Jê-ru-sa-leem đóng bâân xêi xanêi dhiq ađek leq nôôq tarnêêng achêk. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Bơơi xók Phaau-lô gavơh nhan đóng ađêi bâân kóóp król đương rau praaq xêi ưng bhua, aku ơi praaq kayua đóng ađó ađek bâân jư lêi đóng patơk xók aku ve chóóm đââng ađó ađek leq Xê-xa.” <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Hayơq Ak-riip-ba móón palơq Phê-tu: “Chênh aku kung kiêng xâng manưih ađô.” Phê-tu ââi lóóiq: “Rayiiu bhua e bâân xâng ađó achêk.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Kơi ađek, tơk tangêi rayiiu, xók Ak-riip-ba lơq Bê-rê-niit ơi tơk palơq dhale n'tót liêm bhlơng bhi chap lơq bhadyaang mót leq kalóóng đong palơq paluch nôôq takóh linh kadhâng koq, lơq nôôq manưih ting rau tarnêêng ưng kanóón manưih bơk, hayơq xók Phê-tu kayua parâng, nek Phaau-lô bâân đââng tamót. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Phê-tu yuur papraaq: “Nhan móón bhua Ak-riip-ba lơq tabhơt nôôq pe ve mat palơq nôôq yi, nôôq pe xók bâân lêi manưih ađô, nek manưih hơq mưi ganơr manưih Jo Thaaiq ơi palơq xóng piđó mââl nhan aku, tabhơt dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem lơq dhiq ađôk, lalơu nhan buôn óóq đóng ađó ađek mamông dyơq. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Bơơi aku bâân n'nal ađó ađek ơi kah têêng hau rau phaai chêt. Dhơ kơi ađek, taai chênh achak manưih ađô ơi kaauq leq bhua, hayơq aku kayua đââng ađó ađek vôôiq, <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />hơq tơk ađó ađek, aku kah ve rau lalua đóng xaraq bha-aar leq bhua. Taai kơi ađek, aku đââng ađó ađek pakah mat toom nôôq pe, lơq ơi tââm nek toom mat bhua, nhan móón bhua Ak-riip-ba, buôn xong xók vaar chamet lêi ađô ơi vaaih, aku ve haurau ađek hơq aku ve chóóm xaraq bha-aar. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Taai palơq aku, xók klóóp đââng mưi manưih matu lơt hơq kah chaleq rau nôôq matu lơt jơl lóóiq ađó hơq alua nek lơt bhlơng.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Kơi ađek hayơq, bhua Ak-riip-ba móón palơq Phaau-lô: “Amei chóóm pheep buôn truuih đuui leq ađêi.” Tơk bhêêl ađôk, xong xók hayuur têi gluh, Phaau-lô tư paq paraaq, kơi ađô:<verse eid="ACT 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Nhan móón bhua Ak-riip-ba, parpâng tơk dyóp rau hơq aku bâân takaauq tââq manưih Jo Thaaiq, aku lêi ađêi lalua tarhơơnh xók ravang tư pâân paq ađêi toom mat bhua tangêi ađôk, <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />tââm nek taai bhua nek manưih n'nal giit tabhơt nôôq gani takóh lơq paluch nôôq rau dhơơm tavaaih tarkaai dhiq m'pơng kalóóng manưih Jo Thaaiq. Kơi ađek hayơq aku nhan bhua đơơp jruôn tameng xâng aku. <verse eid="ACT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />Alua kơi ađek, dyóp ngaai manưih Jo Thaaiq maar n'nal kơi mamông ưng aku patư tââq paniên, ơi vaaih tââq xók tââp tanââp dhiq m'pơng dhanuôr aku kung kơi dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem, <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />taai ơi loom n'nal leq aku tââq đươnh, hayơq la piđó ve lóóm đóng truuih đuui, hơq ađek nek aku ơi mamông ting kabhuh pagei tââm kalóóng lóóm huuiq ưng nôôq yi, nek kabhuh Pha-ri-si. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Xók ađôk, aku dyương dhiq ađô đơơp xêi xanêi nek taai lóóm rââm dhiq paraaq hươq Yaang Pleng ơi têêng palơq nôôq abhươp avuôq ưng nôôq yi, <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />nek paraaq hươq hơq majêt bơơr kabhuh nôôq yi dhiq rau bhơt lóóm, xók đương rââm đóng bâân đơơp, xók bhuôih haanh Yaang Pleng tangêi lơq hayum. Nhan móón bhua, chênh taai rau lóóm rââm achêk, aku đôk bâân takaauq patu tââq manưih Jo Thaaiq. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />La Yaang Pleng têêng manưih chêt mamông lóóiq, hau kơi rau ađek bâân đóng nek chiên kah chóóm bâân huuiq dhiq m'pơng kalóóng nôôq pe? <verse eid="ACT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />Alua kơi ađek, aku ơi glêh karnóq kiêng phaai têêng bơk kơi tajơl ting kơi palơq dhanóók Jê-su Na-xa-reet, <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />nek nôôq tarnêêng hơq aku ơi têêng patơk dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem, aku patơk mơ dyơq kóóp król bơk manưih huuiq mót đong kanam xong xók đơơp kataai tââq nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm, lơq miq bhêêl xók piđó bâân leng chêt, nek aku ơi xaraq bha-aar ting tađuui. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Xók taluôn janah piđó dhiq dyóp đong gươl, aku ơi kóóp kayua kajuq piđó phaai praaq chôlô, chadrươh ađek taai kabhróónh bhlơng, aku patơk mơ ơi vôôiq kóóp janah piđó đóng patơk luch nôôq kanóón dhanuôr katiêk lââng, <verse eid="ACT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />hơq kalóóng nôôq tarnêêng kóóp janah achêk, dyơq xók vôôiq kalơng tơk Đa-met chadrươh palơq kataai lơq đơơp tarnêêng tââq nôôq takóh kadhâng bhanuôih bhơt liêm, <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />nek nhan móón bhua, bhêêl m'pơng dhơng, dhiq kalơng vôôiq, aku lêi kalaaq brương tââq pleng, cha-iil chalóng lơh mat tangêi, dyóól charoh xavaang praang aku lơq nôôq manưih xók vôôiq mandrươh palơq aku. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Chadrươh ađek, xong xók tabhơt nôôq yi pachruum chok leq katiêk, aku xâng mưi dhariêng praaq móón palơq aku palơq dhariêng Hê-bơ-rơ: ‘Saau-lơ, Saau-lơ, hau akóón janah Aku? Alua lóng hadhơơp xââng đóng akóón xók chadhơp leq nok huuch.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Tatun ađek, aku tamóh: ‘Kakoh Chuôq, Amei nek ngaai?’ Hayơq Chuôq móón: ‘Aku nek Jê-su, Yaang hơq akóón xók kóóp janah. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Dhơ kơi ađek, phaai yuur dyương lơq dyương tapat dhiq dyung ađêi, ơi taai rau ađôk hơq Aku ơi tabhral palơq akóón, đóng chaleq akóón têêng dhơn ratơơq lơq manưih truuih đuui paluch tơk nôôq rau akóón ơi lêi dhiq Aku, lơq nôôq rau Aku ơi pakah leq akóón, <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />xók paq jóói akóón lơh tââq dhanuôr ađêi lơq lơh tââq nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng hơq Aku kayua akóón vôôiq, <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />buôn lóng mat piđó, hơq đóng palâh lơh tââq bóng kanam chô leq kalaaq brương, lơq lơh tââq praan karơ ưng Sa-taan tơk palơq Yaang Pleng, đóng piđó pei đơơp rau lơơi matu lơt, palơq drươp kavaan dhiq m'pơng nôôq manưih ơi bâân pasek tââq lóóm huuiq dhiq Aku.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />Taai kơi ađek, nhan móón bhua Ak-riip-ba, aku ơi yươq khin kaai ting kơi palơq tapalêi tââq pleng achêk, <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />palâh lóóiq, laloom tââm aku ơi truuih pachóóm đóng nôôq manưih dhiq Đa-met, hayơq tabhơt dhiq Jê-ru-sa-leem, lơq plok xưưq Ju-đê, ting đóng nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng, phaai klôôq lóóm lơq val chô palơq Yaang Pleng, yuur têêng nôôq tarnêêng pâng dhalam palơq klôôq lóóm achêk. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Taai ơi nôôq tarnêêng ađek, manưih Jo Thaaiq, xong xók kóóp jư aku kalóóng đong bhanuôih, bhiêk chêk tabâân leng aku. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Kơi ađek, ơi bâân đơơp paq jóói tââq Yaang Pleng đóng tơk tangêi mađôk, aku ơi yuur dyương, truuih đuui drươh đóng manưih paniên, drươh đóng leq manưih taha, kah praaq rau lââng lơh, nôôq rau hơq tabhơt nôôq manưih đââng taruuih palơq Môôi-se ơi praaq nek ravang yuur vaaih — <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />kơi Chuôq Paq Manưih bâân đóng phaai đơơp janah, lơq ơi nek manưih tââp tanââp gluh tââq rau mamông lóóiq ưng nôôq manưih chêt, Ađó lalua e truuih đuui rau brương paluch đóng dhanuôr nôôq yi palơq nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Bhêêl achêk, xók ađó ơi tư paraaq paq palơq nôôq rau ađô, Phê-tu praaq pakarơ dhariêng kơi ađô: “Amei xươl aq, Phaau-lô ơơi! Tarnêêng tabâân hok bơk kuôq têêng amei xar manưih kah n'nal rarau.” <verse eid="ACT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Bơơi Phaau-lô móón: “Aku yươq vaaih xươl, nhan móón abhươp Phê-tu bhi chap, palâh lóóiq aku xók móón nôôq paraaq dhalam lơq karnóq brương. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Taai bhua n'nal tơk nôôq tarnêêng ađô — aku patơk mơ yươq kakhin ââi palơq amei — tââq aku huuiq lalua kah mưi rau lââng kalóóng nôôq chiên ađô bâân kadrêi bhua, taai rau tarnêêng achêk nek ơi kah ve bâân têêng dhiq mưi m'phooq n'tól ađek tôôh. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Nhan móón bhua Ak-riip-ba, bhua huuiq nôôq manưih đââng taruuih kah? Aku n'nal nek bhua huuiq.” <verse eid="ACT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Bơơi Ak-riip-ba móón Phaau-lô; “Amei kiêng pei lóóm aku đóng aku xar manưih huuiq Chuôq đâh nek kơi dhơq?” <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Bơơi Phaau-lô ââi: “Lalua nek aku nhan gavơh Yaang Pleng, dhơ kalóóng ganah êêp môôiq yaal, kah mơ bhua, hơq dyơq tabhơt nôôq ngaai xâng aku tangêi mađôk bâân xar ting marau mađó kơi aku xók ve, kah xêi nôôq tarlêi xiêng ađô.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Hayơq bhua yuur dyương, palơq kuôn kadhâng xưưq, dyơq amooq Bê-rê-niit lơq nôôq manưih xók tơơt palơq piđó, <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />lơq xong xók yuur xooq, piđó tapraaq xóng ađêi, móón kơi ađô: “Manưih ađô yươq rau têêng đaang chêt môôiq tơơt đong kanam.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Hayơq bhua Ak-riip-ba móón palơq Phê-tu: “Manưih ađô biêh ve chóóm bâân paloh, la ađó ơi yươq kaauq leq Xê-xa.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Xók achêk, xók kanóq ơi bâân pakah đóng leq nôôq yi vôôiq leq kalơng taxiiq tơk I-ta-li, nek piđó pajaau bhơt Phaau-lô lơq masôôq manưih matu lââng đóng mưi takóh linh kadhâng koq, achak Ju-lơ, mađó kabhuh linh Ơu-gu-ta. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Bhêêl achêk, xók ơi bhadyaang dyung leq mưi beq jatau tââq A-tra-miit, xók ravang ravưa chaang taxiiq tơk nôôq dhiq taring leq A-si, nek nôôq yi bâân đââng leq taxiiq, A-ri-taak, manưih kanóón Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka, xưưq Ma-xê-đoan dhiq palơq nôôq yi. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Hayơq tangêi rayiiu, nôôq yi bóói mót leq Si-đôôn, chadrươh Ju-lơ, ơi yaauq palơq Phaau-lô kơi liêm bhlơng, ơi đóng pheep ađó tơk palơq nôôq parjơơk đóng ve bâân rau gamang ưng piđó. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Tââq dhiq ađek, xong xók gluh vôôiq leq taxiiq, nôôq yi đóng jatau pagriêq kôông Chiip-rơ ơi taai dhiiq xók pruung chachriik. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Chadrươh, xong xók chaang gan prah taxiiq chóók ting Si-li-si lơq Baam-phi-li, nôôq yi ơi bóói mót leq jarơm Mi-ra, mađó leq Li-si. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Dhiq ađek, taai takóh kadhâng koq linh bâân lêi mưi beq jatau tââq A-lek-xan-tri ve vôôiq kalơng taxiiq tơk I-ta-li, hayơq ađó đââng nôôq yi dyók leq jatau ađek. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Hayơq, bhluuch bơk tangêi vôôiq jih lơq xók ơi tơk đan Kơ-niit mưi kơi hadhaap, nek taai dhiiq kah đóng pheep nôôq yi tơk đan lơh dyơq, nôôq yi ơi đóng jatau pagriêq kôông Kơ-rêêt, chaang gan Sa-môôn. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Hayơq bhiêk vôôiq taring tóór palơq kôông achêk mưi kơi hadhaap, nôôq yi vôôiq tơk mưi dham tôôh bâân đóók nek Mi Kaang, dham ađô dhiq đan kanóón La-sê.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Bơơi taai ơi bil bơk bhlơng tangêi, lơq kalơng vôôiq taxiiq nek ơi xar kadhaap taai patơk mơ ơi lơh ganah điêng cha lơh vaq, hayơq Phaau-lô móón praaq, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />xók praaq palơq piđó, kơi ađô: “Nhan móón adhi anó, aku lêi kơi kalơng vôôiq taxiiq ađô ve ngóq e talum palơq bhrê hư lơq bơk hư bil, eh chapiên nôôq đô-đaak lơq jatau, hơq dyơq parmông ưng nôôq he dyơq.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Bơơi takóh linh kadhâng koq bâân xâng bóóp tââq manưih laaiq jatau lơq kala jatau lơh nek nôôq paraaq bâân Phaau-lô praaq pakah. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Dhơ kơi ađek, taai jarơm kah kre đóng bóq jatau leq nil hapruôt, hayơq bơk manưih pakah praaq xêi gluh vôôiq leq taxiiq tââq dham ađôk, la palơq tarnêêng ve kơi, nek piđó ve chóóm mót leq jarơm tơơt dhiq Phê-niit, mưi jarơm dhiq Kơ-rêêt, lêi ting hót bhlưa charhóóng mat bhlót lơq ting hót bhlưa charhóóng hót lóóm, đóng ting xâng nil hapruôt. <verse eid="ACT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Xók achêk, xók dhiiq charhóóng hóng pruung taxiin, taai ngóq ơi pâng kơi kanóq, hayơq xong xók rôôq nok, piđó đóng jatau mut tring ting tóór, đan griêq kôông Kơ-rêêt. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Bơơi kah mơ đươnh dyơq, mưi gral dhiiq gamak bhlơng bâân đóók nek Ơ-ra-kui-lôôn, tââq kôông pruung chok leq. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Xók achêk, xók jatau ơi bâân palóóng lơq kah chóóm tajơl palơq dhiiq đuôh dyơq, nek xong xók lơơi mak kơi, nôôq yi bâân lóóng. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Bơơi xong xók mut tring ting hót đơp dhiiq ưng mưi kôông achêk bâân đóók nek Kơ-lô-đa, nek kadhaap bhlơng nôôq yi hơq ve chóóm tabâân kadhâng bhuông trôông parmông katưưiq, <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />nek rau hơq xók ơi ruiq padyók, piđó pei đươi nôôq rau dhơơm chóóm đươi, gariêq jư jatau đóng tamưng. Chadrươh ađek, taai kakhin, n'nal kơi ve n'jau kađóóng hariêq dhiq xuôr tóór Si-rơ-tơ, nek xók ơi đóng patôq talêi chok leq, piđó bhiêk lơơi đóng lóóng kơi ađek. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Bơơi xók nôôq yi bâân dhiiq m'bhrah tatech taheek, nek tơk tangêi rayiiu, palââng tââp laloom vuung đô-đaak chok leq taxiiq đóng hangiil jatau. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Lơh tangêi đu pe, piđó tư têi vuung chok leq taxiiq nôôq đô-đaak dhiq jatau. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Xók achêk, bhêêl xók kah ve mat tangêi kung kah ve nôôq xatur vaaih dhiq bơk tangêi, chadrươh dhiiq gamak bhlơng bhiêk dyơq janah nôôq yi, nek tabhơt rau rââm dyơq lóóiq ng'kơi đóng nôôq yi bâân trôông ơi bâân bil luch. <verse eid="ACT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Hayơq xók lơh mưi ganah đươnh kah chacha, nek Phaau-lô, xók yuur dyương dhiq m'pơng piđó, ơi praaq: “Nhan móón nôôq pe, kơi parpâng la ơi xâng kơi aku óóq yuur vôôiq gluh tââq Kơ-rêêt, nek kung ơi bâân viêr bhrê hư lơq hư bil ađô. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Xók ađôk, aku nhan móón adhi anó yuur panhóól, taai e yươq ve bhrê hư leq parhââm akóón manưih dhiq m'pơng adhi anó, hơq chapiên bil jatau ađô giêl. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Taai yum ađôk, mưi dhơn pleng tââq Yaang Pleng, Yaang aku mađó lơq nek Yaang aku bhuôih haanh, ơi dyương hót tóór aku, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />móón: ‘Phaau-lô, óóq kakhin. Amei kơng phaai dyương dhiq toom Xê-xa, hayơq phaai lêi tôôh, tââq lóóm ayô ka-er Yaang Pleng ơi đóng leq amei dyóp ngaai dyơq vôôiq dhiq kalơng vôôiq taxiiq chadrươh palơq amei.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Taai kơi ađek, nhan móón adhi anó, phaai mưng lóóm! Taai aku huuiq ganơơm Yaang Pleng, kơi rau tarnêêng e yuur vaaih kơi ađek, ting kơi rau ơi bâân truuih leq aku. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Bơơi nôôq he phaai kađóóng hariêq dhiq mưi beq kôông mak ađó.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Xók achêk, xók tơk hayum đu majêt puôn, dhiq xók nôôq yi bhiêk dyơq lalơơng dhơơng dhiq Taxiiq A-đơ-ria-tiit, nek đan m'pơng hayum, nôôq manưih gaai jatau đóng kơi piđó n'dhương đan tơk mưi dham katiêk mak ađó. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Xong xók patôq pale dhanang, piđó lêi dhơuq bơơr jêt achương, hayơq vôôiq grơơt mưi gral changaai lơh, lơq val patôq pale dhanang, piđó lêi dyơq majêt xââng achương. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Chadrươh ađek, taai ơi kakhin, kah machưng nôôq yi nh'jau chóóm ng'guh leq dhơl klêch mak dhiq ađek, hayơq xók ơi patôq puôn beq nok dhâng tââq dham chađui jatau, piđó đương rââm tơk pleng brương. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Bơơi xók nôôq manưih gaai jatau tabâân yuur klôôn tââq jatau lơq đóng padhaluônh bhuông trôông katưưiq chok leq taxiiq, xanaan têêng kơi kanóq vôôiq patôq nok tââq koq jatau, <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Phaau-lô móón palơq takóh linh kadhâng koq lơq nôôq kabhuh linh: “La nôôq manưih ađô kah tơơt lóóiq dhiq jatau, nôôq pe kah chóóm bâân trôông.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Kơi ađek nek nôôq linh kut patươt talêi bhariêq ưng bhuông trôông parmông lơq lơơi đóng ađó yuur lóóng. <verse eid="ACT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Xók achêk, đóng tơk xók pleng đan val kơi brương kiêt, Phaau-lô móón bhơơl dyóp ngaai phaai cha m'bưưiq chana, kơi ađô: “Xók dyơq đương rââm đóng patơk vaar ađôk, tangêi đu majêt puôn, adhi anó dyơq bhiêk tơơt tadhrơng, kah đơơp cha marau marâ. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Kơi ađek, aku nhan adhi anó phaai cha m'bưưiq chana, taai rau ađek nek ravang đóng rau paq jóói adhi anó. Taai kah ngaai kalóóng adhi anó e bil mưi n'dreh xok dhiq koq.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Kơi ađek nek, xók ơi praaq kơi ađek lơq pei pagluh beng, ađó ma-ơơn Yaang Pleng toom mat dyóp ngaai, hayơq xong xók veh beng, ađó ravang cha. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Hayơq xók dyóp ngaai ve bâân rau tabhơơl lóóm, nek chênh piđó ơi pei chana cha. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Xók achêk, nôôq yi ve tabhơt bơơr hariêng tapól jêt chapat chanak dhiq jatau. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Lơq hayơq, xók bâân kabhôôq luônh palơq rau cha xong, piđó têêng pahangiil jatau, palơq kơi vuung haró aviq chok leq taxiiq. <verse eid="ACT 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Xók achêk bhêêl pleng ơi brương, piđó kah n'nal xưưq achêk, bơơi piđó bâân lêi mưi beq n'tól achêk ve xuôr taxiiq, nek dham hơq piđó tapraaq xóng ađêi lêi ve chóóm gaai jatau mót chóóm kah. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Kut m'peq talêi nok xong, piđó lơơi lóóiq dhiq taxiiq. Chadrươh ađek, xong xók lêh talêi benh chir lơq yoong bhaai dhiq moh jatau, nek ting kalơng dhiiq, piđó jư đóng jatau jaluông tapat tơk tóór taxiiq. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Bơơi xók ng'guh dhalam dhiq bơơr palô đơơk tajaap nek jatau kađóóng hariêq, lơq taai moh jatau tagliêq mưng dhiq ađek, jatau bhiêk kah chóóm pagơơt m'bưưiq m'bâ, dyơq chađui jatau nek bâân havóh lêêk taai ga-uul karơ. <verse eid="ACT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Bhêêl achêk, karnóq ưng kabhuh linh nek ng'kơi têêng đóng piđó leng chêt nôôq manưih tơơt đong kanam, nh'jau kơi mak ngaai ve chóóm loh taai bhaluôh lơh. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Bơơi taai kiêng paq Phaau-lô, takóh linh kadhâng koq ơi kajơq karnóq ưng piđó, chadrươh ađó kayua parâng đóng ngaai dhơơm chóóm bhaluôh laloom tââm chrơm gluh tââq jatau đóng bhaluôh leq kakóóng, <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />lơq nôôq manưih đu dyơq, ve ngaai bhuôm leq nôôq tala bhaan, dyơq nôôq chanak tôôh pei nôôq rau lââng tââq jatau, hayơq ting kơi achêk, rau vaaih tơk leq tabhơt nôôq yi nek bâân đââng dyók leq kakóóng kơi yươq rau ha.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Xók bâân yươq rau ha, nek bhêêl ađek nôôq yi bâân n'nal kơi kôông ađô bâân đóók nek Maan-tơ. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Chadrươh ađek, dhanuôr xưưq ađek pơh yaauq nôôq yi paliêm n'tua lơq kaxu, tââq piđó ơi pơh yayar tabhơt nôôq yi palơq kơi kơm óih taai mưi ganơt bó xók tơk lơq taai khau. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Bơơi xók Phaau-lô ơi karong mưi gabê óih lơq m'peq leq óih, nek mưi panong kaxênh karviêng, xong xók laai lơh tââq dhiq puih, ơi pươr mưng dhiq têi ađó. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Bhêêl achêk, xók dhanuôr xưưq ađek bâân lêi akóón anaaq pươr dhiq têi ađó, piđó móón xóng ađêi: “Manưih ađô lalua nek dhươm leng manưih, nek manưih hơq dhơ bâân trôông tââq taxiiq, bơơi rau bhơt liêm kah đóng mamông.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Tatun ađek, xók ơi takróh akóón anaaq leq óih, ađó ơi yươq ve rau bhrê. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Dhơ kơi ađek, piđó biêh ngóq ađó ravang bâân eh hamôôiq parmat kalơm chêt. Bơơi xong xók piđó chamet lêi bhluuch mưi gral đươnh lơq lêi kah ve rauriq chrih vaaih palơq ađó, nek xók ơi dhơ karnóq, piđó móón ađó nek mưi yaang.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Bhêêl achêk, tơơt parah ađek nek nôôq dham katiêk ưng takóh kala kôông, achak Bup-li-u, nek manưih pơh yayar nôôq yi, ơi pơh yaauq mưi kơi liêm kre kalóóng pe tangêi. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Xók achêk, chiên yuur vaaih ađek nek ama ưng Bup-li-u xók bêch haliêt achak taai bâân ka-ai kahiir lơq ka-ai kroong, nek Phaau-lô, xong xók vôôiq mót lum abhươp lơq gavơh Chuôq, lơơi têi dhiq abhươp, ơi payươh ka-ai đóng abhươp. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Kơi ađek hayơq, xong xók rau tarnêêng achêk yuur vaaih, nôôq manưih lââng dhiq kôông bâân ka-ai kung vôôiq tơk lơq bâân payươh ka-ai, <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />hơq piđó kung ơi bhi chap nôôq yi palơq rau bhi chap gamak bhlơng, patơk mơ xók yuur vôôiq taxiiq, piđó đââng kliim bơk rau koom đóng rau chóóm đươi ưng nôôq yi.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Xók achêk, lơh pe kaxe, nôôq yi yuur vôôiq dhiq mưi beq jatau ve chan a-ô Đi-ôôt-ku-ri, tââq A-lek-xan-ri-a, ơi kađơu nil ha-ót dhiq kôông. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Xók bâân tơk jrơm dhiq Si-ra-ku-sơ, nôôq yi tơơt dhiq ađek pe tangêi. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Tââq ađek yuur vôôiq taxiiq, nôôq yi vôôiq đan tơk Rê-gi-uum, hayơq mưi tangêi tatun, taai dhiiq chrhóóng hót hóng yuur vaaih, nôôq yi ơi vôôiq tơk Pu-tê-ô-li tangêi ađek xong ađek, <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />ađek nek dhiq hơq xong xók lum maphơn adhi anó, nôôq yi ơi bâân mââl nhan tơơt lóóiq palơq piđó kalóóng tapól tangêi, lơq bhiêk kơi ađek, nôôq yi vôôiq tơk Rô-ma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Tââq ađek, xók xâng truuih tơk nôôq yi, nôôq adhi anó ơi vôôiq tơk vaar talum mat palơq nôôq yi tơơt dhiq Chơơq Ap-bi-u lơq Pe Đong Buôn Baan, xók bâân lêi piđó, Phaau-lô ơi ve bâân mưng lóóm huuiq, ma-ơ Yaang Pleng.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Kơi ađek hayơq, xók nôôq yi ơi mót leq kalóóng kanóón Rô-ma, Phaau-lô chóóm pheep tơơt n'tua mưi ađó palơq mưi chanak linh đương jư ađó.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Xók achêk, chiên yuur vaaih lơh pe tangêi ađek nek ađó đóng kayua nôôq manưih nek nôôq takóh kadhâng koq kalóóng dhanuôr Jo Thaaiq ting vôôiq. Hayơq xók piđó ơi krong madhiq, ađó móón palơq piđó: “Nhan móón nôôq pe, nôôq adhi anó, dhơ yươq têêng rauriq jơl lóóiq dhuôr manưih hamôôiq gani takóh ưng ama abhươp nôôq he, bơơi tââq Jê-ru-sa-leem aku bâân kóóp đââng kơi manưih matu lơt kalóóng têi manưih La Ma, <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />hơq chênh piđó, xong xók tamóh aku, biêh kanóq paloh rathaai đóng aku taai yươq ve mưi matu lơt kơi chóóm chêt lââng tơơt dhiq aku. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Bơơi taai manưih Jo Thaaiq praaq jơl, aku phaai kaauq đââng leq Xê-xa, dhiq xók kah ve kanóq kaauq patu dhanuôr ađêi. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Kơi achêk, ơi taai ađek, aku ơi kayua nôôq pe tơk, đóng talum lơq praaq chiên. Ơi taai lóóm rââm ưng I-sơ-ra-êên, hayơq aku ơi bâân taxiêng ađô.” <verse eid="ACT 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Dhơ kơi ađek, piđó móón palơq ađó: “Nôôq yi kah rau đơơp bha-aar xaraq rauriq leq amei tââq Ju-đê, kung kah ve adhi anó ngaai lââng tơk truuih môôiq móón dhơ dharau môôp leq amei. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Bơơi nôôq yi lêi buôn tameng xâng tââq amei rau dhơơm amei karnóq, taai leq kabhuh ađô, rau bâân n'nal tơơt dhiq nôôq yi ađek nek ađó bâân jơl plok dyóp dhiq.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Kơi ađek hayơq, xong xók đóng tangêi leq ađó, nek bơk manưih lơh ơi pơh palơq ađó dhiq dham tơơt ưng ađó, hơq tââq yayóng đóng patơk habu hayum, ađó truuih đuui palơq piđó, palơq truuih đuui leq katiêk Yaang Pleng, chadrươh ađek pachô piđó leq Chuôq Jê-su miq gani Môôi-se lơq nôôq manưih đââng taruuih. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Dhơ mưi phơn manưih đơơp huuiq nôôq rau bâân praaq pakah, bơơi nôôq lââng nek kah huuiq. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Xók achêk, xók ve rau tarkaai xóng ađêi, piđó yuur xooq xong xók Phaau-lô móón mưi rau, kơi ađô: “Tââq Ê-saai manưih đââng taruuih, Chuôq Yaang Liêm ơi praaq dhalam palơq abhươp avuôq ưng nôôq pe, <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />kơi ađô: ‘Phaai vôôiq tơk leq dhanuôr ađô lơq praaq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">“Xók xâng, nôôq akóón e chóóm xâng, hơq nôôq akóón dhakơi kah n'nal,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">lơq xók lêi, nôôq akóón e lêi, hơq nôôq akóón dhakơi kah rau chóóm n'nal.”<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Taai lóóm dhanuôr ađô val xar kakơu tiêl,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">katór piđó kơi ngóq kah xâng,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">lơq mat piđó nek kaxir kiêr,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">bóh ve bhêêl ađek, piđó ve chóóm lêi palơq mat,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">bâân xâng palơq katór, lơq chóóm n'nal palơq lóóm,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">hayơq piđó ve chóóm val lóóiq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">lơq Aku e payươh đóng piđó.’<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Kơi ađek hayơq, rau bâân n'nal phaai ve dhiq nôôq pe, ađek nek rau paq jóói ađô ưng Yaang Pleng ơi bâân truuih pakah đóng nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng, lơq piđó e xâng.” <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />[Xók ađó móón xong nôôq praaq ađek, nôôq manưih Jo Thaaiq yuur chô, ve rau tarkaai gamak dhiq m'pơng kalóóng piđó.]<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Xók achêk, ađó tơơt dyóp bơơr kamó kalóóng dhanong đong vaq ưng ađêi, lơq pơh yaauq tabhơt ngaai dhơơm vôôiq tơk palơq ađó, <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />xók truuih pachóóm leq katiêk Yaang Pleng lơq pachóóm rau dhơơm leq Chuôq, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, palơq tabhơt lóóm nhóól, yươq talum rau hadhơơp kajơq.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>